{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01_72MokoX3VRGmKkzgf2205387","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tile-Level Operator Fusion (WELDER).md\",\"basename\":\"Tile-Level Operator Fusion (WELDER)\",\"score\":722.9287873957578,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"operator，无匹配规则）\",\"operator的非常规融合模式，最大将48个operator融合为单个kernel。\",\"operator的非常规融合模式\",\"operator（如matmul+softmax）在shared\",\"level\",\"level=0\",\"level连接后，traffic减少了，welder就自动生成fused\",\"level连接后\",\"level，propagate自动对齐tile\",\"level的连接通过tvm\",\"level的连接通过load/store\",\"level的连接通过load\",\"level+1,\",\"level+1\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":8},{\"match\":\"Operator\",\"offset\":14},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":52},{\"match\":\"Operator\",\"offset\":58},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":163},{\"match\":\"level，Propagate自动对齐tile\",\"offset\":223},{\"match\":\"operator（如Matmul+Softmax）在shared\",\"offset\":320},{\"match\":\"level连接后，traffic减少了，WELDER就自动生成fused\",\"offset\":360},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":437},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":513},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":549},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":567},{\"match\":\"operator的非常规融合模式，最大将48个operator融合为单个kernel。\",\"offset\":610},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":677},{\"match\":\"Operator\",\"offset\":683},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":824},{\"match\":\"level=0\",\"offset\":957},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":985},{\"match\":\"level+1\",\"offset\":1432},{\"match\":\"level+1,\",\"offset\":1471},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1575},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1610},{\"match\":\"operator，无匹配规则）\",\"offset\":1712},{\"match\":\"level的连接通过Load/Store\",\"offset\":2054},{\"match\":\"level的连接通过TVM\",\"offset\":2175}],\"excerpt\":\"## Tile-Level Operator Fusion (WELDER)\\n术语是什么？\\nTile-Level Operator Fusion是WELDER提出的一种统一融合框架，将DNN算子的融合从传统的\\\"规则匹配（rule-based matching）\\\"抽象为\\\"tile-graph连接调度\\\"。核心理念是：不限制哪些operator类型可以融合，而是通过SetConnect在tile-graph的edge上指定数据复用的memory level，Propagate自动对齐tile shape，然后由traffic cost model判断融合是否有益（减少total traffic）。如果两个redu…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/AU Arithmetic Intensity (ARI) for Operator-Level AU Selection.md\",\"basename\":\"AU Arithmetic Intensity (ARI) for Operator-Level AU Selection\",\"score\":669.6651021217417,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"operator计算ari→判定u_au→记录到auv\",\"operator计算ari→判定u\",\"operator-level\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Operator-Level\",\"offset\":37},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":143},{\"match\":\"operator计算ARI→判定U_AU→记录到AUV\",\"offset\":1208},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1490}],\"excerpt\":\"## AU Arithmetic Intensity (ARI) for Operator-Level AU Selection\\n术语是什么？\\nARI (Arithmetic Intensity for AU Selection) 是AUM论文提出的轻量级AU使用率判定指标，用于在operator级别选择最优AU (AMX vs AVX)。定义为：\\n- Prefill phase: ARI = 6(1/d + 3/BL)^(-1)，其中d=model hidden dimension, B=batch size, L=input sequence length\\n- Decode phase: ARI = 6(1/d + 3/B)^(-1)\\nARI越高表示AU使用…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference.md\",\"basename\":\"Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference\",\"score\":652.0118888628941,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"operators——self-attention和convolution，需要跨patch上下文信息来保证输出一致性（self-attention需要all\",\"operators——linear、feedforward、cross\",\"operators通过标准py\",\"operators通过标准pytorch\",\"operators:\",\"operators\",\"在operator\",\"此operator\",\"level\",\"level\\\"（全局）信息上，这些算子可被decompose为独立子算子在各patch上并行执行。算子分为两类：\",\"level\\\"（局部）而非\\\"image\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Operator\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":31},{\"match\":\"Operator\",\"offset\":81},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":109},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":214},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":273},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":292},{\"match\":\"operators——Linear、FeedForward、Cross\",\"offset\":362},{\"match\":\"operators——Self-Attention和Convolution，需要跨patch上下文信息来保证输出一致性（Self-Attention需要all\",\"offset\":467},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":679},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":685},{\"match\":\"operators:\",\"offset\":763},{\"match\":\"在operator\",\"offset\":1571},{\"match\":\"operators通过标准PyTorch\",\"offset\":1936},{\"match\":\"此operator\",\"offset\":2234},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":2299},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":2448}],\"excerpt\":\"## Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nOperator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference（patch级扩散推理的算子分类）是MixFusion提出的将扩散模型中的算子按是否需要跨patch上下文(context)进行分类的体系，用于指导patch-level parallel serving的设计。扩散模型的denoising过程中，大多数算子操作在\\\"pixel level\\\"（局部）而非\\\"image level\\\"（全局）信…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）.md\",\"basename\":\"Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）\",\"score\":402.0261027681646,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":61},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":115},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":257},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":309},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":3148},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":3182},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":3288}],\"excerpt\":\"## Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）\\n术语是什么？\\nIntra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap 是 MegaScale-MoE 提出的一种细粒度 kernel 级优化技术，将有直接数据依赖关系的通信算子与计算算子以 tile（瓦片）粒度融合到单个 GPU kernel 中执行。与 inter-operator overlap（在不同 CUDA stream 上异步执行独立算子）不同，intra-…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hamming Score Operator (popc-based GPU Kernel for Hash Distance Computation).md\",\"basename\":\"Hamming Score Operator (popc-based GPU Kernel for Hash Distance Computation)\",\"score\":360.52639076313284,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"operator是hata中用于高效计算query\",\"operator聚合各int32的count得到最终hamming\",\"operator。核心是利用gpu的硬件级popc（population\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Operator\",\"offset\":17},{\"match\":\"Operator是HATA中用于高效计算query\",\"offset\":125},{\"match\":\"operator。核心是利用GPU的硬件级popc（population\",\"offset\":203},{\"match\":\"operator聚合各INT32的count得到最终Hamming\",\"offset\":513},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":595},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":2340}],\"excerpt\":\"## Hamming Score Operator (popc-based GPU Kernel for Hash Distance Computation)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nHamming Score Operator是HATA中用于高效计算query hash code与所有cached key hash codes之间Hamming距离的自定义GPU operator。核心是利用GPU的硬件级popc（population count）指令来统计bit mismatch数量，配合coalesced memory access pattern以最大化HBM带宽利用。\\n计算流程…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Triton-based MoE Operator Implementation (基于 Triton 的 MoE 算子实现).md\",\"basename\":\"Triton-based MoE Operator Implementation (基于 Triton 的 MoE 算子实现)\",\"score\":333.8911648612497,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Operator\",\"offset\":20},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":210},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":342}],\"excerpt\":\"## Triton-based MoE Operator Implementation (基于 Triton 的 MoE 算子实现)\\n术语解释\\nBrownoutServe 使用 Triton 语言（而非 C++/CUDA）重写 MoE 模块的所有算子，包括 expert FFN 计算、token dispatch/combine、united expert 调用。Triton 在 Python 层面编写 tile-level 计算逻辑，编译为高效 GPU kernel，与 PyTorch 无缝兼容。\\n术语是什么？\\nTriton（Tillet et al. 2019）是一个 Python-based 的 GPU 编程语言和编译器。…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/concat_reorder Operator (dKV-Cache 的 KV 重排操作符).md\",\"basename\":\"concat_reorder Operator (dKV-Cache 的 KV 重排操作符)\",\"score\":326.6570741934337,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Operator\",\"offset\":18},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":3857}],\"excerpt\":\"## concat_reorder Operator (dKV-Cache 的 KV 重排操作符)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。\\nconcat_reorder 是 dKV-Cache 论文中为扩散语言模型 (DLM) 的 KV 缓存设计的底层操作符，用于高效实现非连续位置的 Key/Value gather 和 scatter 操作。在标准 KV Cache (AR) 中，缓存 token 是连续的（位置 1→t），只需简单的 concat 追加操作。但 DLM 中解码位置是任意的，缓存 token 分散在整个序列的非连续位置，导致每步需要多次 gather（收集缓存 token 的 K/V）和…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Patch-Level Cache Reuse for Diffusion Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"Patch-Level Cache Reuse for Diffusion Serving\",\"score\":232.48280321555725,\"foundWords\":[\"operators（如self-attention,\",\"operators:\",\"operators\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":79},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":561},{\"match\":\"operators:\",\"offset\":815},{\"match\":\"operators（如Self-Attention,\",\"offset\":909},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1761},{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":1936}],\"excerpt\":\"## Patch-Level Cache Reuse for Diffusion Serving\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nPatch-Level Cache Reuse（patch级缓存复用）是一种在扩散模型逐step denoising过程中，以patch（而非全图）为粒度进行block输出的缓存和选择性重算的技术。核心观察是扩散模型denoising过程中相邻steps的block输出高度相似——但不同分辨率的图像在不同blocks上的相似性分布不同（Figure 7, 512/768/1024分辨率下skipped blocks集合显著不同），因此需要per-patch的动态复用决…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Byte-level Memory Budget（字节级内存预算）.md\",\"basename\":\"Byte-level Memory Budget（字节级内存预算）\",\"score\":219.67104350694657,\"foundWords\":[\"operatorname\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":8},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":87},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":300},{\"match\":\"operatorname\",\"offset\":422}],\"excerpt\":\"## Byte-level Memory Budget（字节级内存预算）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nByte-level Memory Budget 是 StreamingEval 提出的统一资源约束方法，将流式视频评估中不同模型之间的比较从 token 数量约束转换为字节级统一预算。传统做法按 \\\"最多 N 个 visual tokens\\\" 限制上下文窗口，但不同模型 visual token embedding 维度不同（如 3584 vs 5120），导致相同 token 数实际 GPU 内存占用差异可达 2-3×。Byte-level bu…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling（协同编译与调度）.md\",\"basename\":\"Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling（协同编译与调度）\",\"score\":72.45726248574485,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"operator生成多种ilp/tlp/intensity配置的