e\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-based Programming Language (TileLang DSL).md\",\"basename\":\"Tile-based Programming Language (TileLang DSL)\",\"score\":37.134727928521926,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"operator。tilelang\",\"operators（t.copy,\",\"operators\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":231},{\"match\":\"operators（T.copy,\",\"offset\":237},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":510},{\"match\":\"operator。TileLang\",\"offset\":3026}],\"excerpt\":\"…ed 领域特定语言（DSL），允许用户在 tile（瓦片/分块）粒度上编写高性能 GPU kernel。其核心设计哲学是\\\"dataflow-centric\\\"（以数据流为中心）：用户仅需使用 tile-level operators（T.copy, T.gemm, T.reduce, T.atomic 等）描述数据在各级硬件内存层次（global memory → shared memory → registers）之间的流动路径和计算逻辑，编译器自动处理并行化、线程绑定、内存布局、pipeline 重叠和向量化等底层调度优化。TileLang 的 tile 是一等公民——tile 代表一块有形状的数据（如 block_M × block_K），可由 warp、thread block 或等效并行单元所有和操作。与 Triton 只提供 block-level 原语且隐藏 thread 行为…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md\",\"basename\":\"Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation\",\"score\":36.730929208308424,\"foundWords\":[\"operator生成多个ilp/tlp/arithmetic\",\"operator生成多个ilp\",\"operator生成多种kernel\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"operator生成多种kernel\",\"offset\":126},{\"match\":\"operator生成多个ILP/TLP/arithmetic\",\"offset\":294},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":1107}],\"excerpt\":\"Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation是Infera compiler为每个micro operator生成多种kernel candidates的策略：通过配置不同的register使用上限（64/96/128）、shared memory上限（48/80/112/144 KiB）、pipeline stage数（2/3/4）、以及spatial/reduction axis tile size组合，为同一micro operator生成多个ILP/TLP/arithmetic intensity trade-off不同的kernel版本。推理时scheduler根据GPU并发状态、kernel hazard和data dependency选择最优kernel版本。\\n从编译框…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）.md\",\"basename\":\"CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）\",\"score\":29.798046267412424,\"foundWords\":[\"operators\",\"level\",\"level控制\",\"level和instruction\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\"