→ F(v) = 0\nπ_sel: Selection Policy (greedy/MCTS/evolutionary)\nO: Universal Opera…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/LLMCompass.md","basename":"LLMCompass","score":37.80887344384358,"foundWords":["operator","operator（gemm、softmax、layernorm","level","level）"],"matches":[{"match":"level","offset":150},{"match":"operator（GEMM、softmax、LayerNorm","offset":191},{"match":"operator","offset":883},{"match":"level","offset":1090},{"match":"level）","offset":1245},{"match":"level","offset":2126}],"excerpt":"…rsity 在 ISCA 2024 发表的 LLM 推理性能模拟框架（开源：https://github.com/PrincetonUniversity/LLMCompass）。它是一个 block-level（tile-by-tile）模拟器，利用 LLM 计算图的 dense operator（GEMM、softmax、LayerNorm 等）具有结构化和可预测的 compute/memory access pattern 的特性，在不损失精度的情况下实现比 cycle-accurate simulator 快数个数量级的模拟。LLMCompass 包含：(1) tile-by-tile 模拟引擎——分层建模 compute 和 memory hierarchy（Main memory → Global buffer → Local buffer → Lanes/PE array）；(…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-based Programming Language (TileLang DSL).md","basename":"Tile-based Programming Language (TileLang DSL)","score":37.134727928521926,"foundWords":["operator","operator。tilelang","operators（t.copy,","operators","level"],"matches":[{"match":"level","offset":231},{"match":"operators（T.copy,","offset":237},{"match":"level","offset":510},{"match":"operator。TileLang","offset":3026}],"excerpt":"…ed 领域特定语言（DSL），允许用户在 tile（瓦片/分块）粒度上编写高性能 GPU kernel。其核心设计哲学是\"dataflow-centric\"（以数据流为中心）：用户仅需使用 tile-level operators（T.copy, T.gemm, T.reduce, T.atomic 等）描述数据在各级硬件内存层次（global memory → shared memory → registers）之间的流动路径和计算逻辑，编译器自动处理并行化、线程绑定、内存布局、pipeline 重叠和向量化等底层调度优化。TileLang 的 tile 是一等公民——tile 代表一块有形状的数据（如 block_M × block_K），可由 warp、thread block 或等效并行单元所有和操作。与 Triton 只提供 block-level 原语且隐藏 thread 行为…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md","basename":"Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation","score":36.730929208308424,"foundWords":["operator生成多个ilp/tlp/arithmetic","operator生成多个ilp","operator生成多种kernel","level"],"matches":[{"match":"operator生成多种kernel","offset":126},{"match":"operator生成多个ILP/TLP/arithmetic","offset":294},{"match":"level","offset":1107}],"excerpt":"Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation是Infera compiler为每个micro operator生成多种kernel candidates的策略：通过配置不同的register使用上限（64/96/128）、shared memory上限（48/80/112/144 KiB）、pipeline stage数（2/3/4）、以及spatial/reduction axis tile size组合，为同一micro operator生成多个ILP/TLP/arithmetic intensity trade-off不同的kernel版本。推理时scheduler根据GPU并发状态、kernel hazard和data dependency选择最优kernel版本。\n从编译框…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）.md","basename":"CUTLASS（CUDA Templates for Linear Algebra Subroutines）","score":29.798046267412424,"foundWords":["operators","level","level控制","level和instruction"],"matches":[{"match":"level","offset":245},{"match":"level","offset":2136},{"match":"level控制","offset":2181},{"match":"level和instruction","offset":2194},{"match":"level","offset":2212},{"match":"Operators","offset":2487}],"excerpt":"…的高性能GPU线性代数模板库，提供C++模板抽象用于构建自定义GEMM（通用矩阵乘法）kernel。CUTLASS将GEMM分解为thread block tile、warp tile和thread-level fragment的层次化tiling结构，通过模板参数配置数据精度（FP16/BF16/INT8/INT4/FP8等）、tile size、pipeline stages等，自动生成针对特定GPU架构优化的kernel。CUTLASS支持Tensor Core的所有精度模式（包括INT4的mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k32等），并提供software pipeline、epilogue fusion（如dequantization+scaling）等高级特性。\n从编译框架角度拆解术语：\nCUTLASS的层次化GEMM抽象（以INT4 GEMM为例）：\n```\n/…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm (Minimum Equivalent Graph + Bipartite Matching).md","basename":"Stream Assignment Algorithm (Minimum Equivalent Graph + Bipartite Matching)","score":29.2975811205556,"foundWords":["operator","operator-level","operators,","operators","level"],"matches":[{"match":"operators,","offset":1049},{"match":"operator-level","offset":3417}],"excerpt":"// Input: DAG G = (V, E) where V = operators, E = data dependencies\n// Output: stream_assignment: map<v ∈ V, stream_id>\nfunction assign_streams(G):\n    // Step 1: Minimum