{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_02_OG709iIPPZ4nYR11ILJk4936","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/kernel实验笔记/Tilus_ A Tile-Level GPGPU Programming Language for Low-Precision Computation.md\",\"basename\":\"Tilus_ A Tile-Level GPGPU Programming Language for Low-Precision Computation\",\"score\":207.48133499701558,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"operator级\",\"operator，auto-tune\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":17},{\"match\":\"operator，auto-tune\",\"offset\":729},{\"match\":\"operator级\",\"offset\":812}],\"excerpt\":\"## Tilus: A Tile-Level GPGPU Programming Language for Low-Precision Computation\\n- 属于kernel调度/运行时计算的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  实现是Tilus的thread-block级VM指令集（Table 1）对低精度tensor计算和内存传输的调度。核心kernel调度机制包括：(1) 软件流水线（software pipelining）——通过CopyAsync/CopyAsyncCommitGroup/CopyAsyncWaitGroup指令实现异步global→shared memory拷贝与计算的overlap，在decod…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/算法实验笔记/Tilus_ A Tile-Level GPGPU Programming Language for Low-Precision Computation.md\",\"basename\":\"Tilus_ A Tile-Level GPGPU Programming Language for Low-Precision Computation\",\"score\":198.68057929517158,\"foundWords\":[\"operator\",\"operator，编译时间~1分钟。\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Level\",\"offset\":17},{\"match\":\"operator，编译时间~1分钟。\",\"offset\":2596}],\"excerpt\":\"## Tilus: A Tile-Level GPGPU Programming Language for Low-Precision Computation\\n- 属于算法pipeline的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  实现是Tilus生成的任意位宽（1-8 bit）低精度矩阵乘法kernel，支持三种数据类型族：有符号整数（int2-int8）、无符号整数（uint1-uint8）、浮点数（float3-float8，含任意exponent/mantissa分布如e4m3、e3m3、e3m2、e2m2、e2m1、e1m1）。低精度计算流程：权重在kernel启动前做global memory layout变换（如i6[K…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/MixFusion_ A Patch-Level Parallel Serving System for Mixed-Resolution Diffusion Models.md\",\"basename\":\"MixFusion_ A Patch-Level Parallel Serving System for Mixed-Resolution Diffusion Models\",\"score\":192.8834605679845,\"