{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01_CeILFiXf5x09fQ2pBc2p7812","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Shepherd Operator.md\",\"basename\":\"Shepherd Operator\",\"score\":658.0640247000432,\"foundWords\":[\"micro\",\"operator\",\"operator调度会引入过大的scheduling/fusion/launch\",\"operator调度会引入过大的scheduling\",\"operator在infera\",\"operator对外表现为单一调度单元（一个micro\",\"operator对外表现为单一调度单元\",\"operator内部按原始operator的拓扑顺序调用子kernel。shepherd\",\"operator内部按原始operator的拓扑顺序调用子kernel\",\"operator内部包含多个原始operator的kernel，由shepherd\",\"operator内部包含多个原始operator的kernel\",\"operator降级为per\",\"operator将小operator的调度从per\",\"operator将小operator的调度从per-micro-operator降级为per-shepherd-operator，保持scheduling\",\"operator将小operator的调度从per-micro-operator降级为per-shepherd-operator\",\"operator是infera\",\"operator）。shepherd\",\"operator），避免teu\",\"operator。shepherd\",\"operator的具体大小阈值。\",\"operator的具体大小阈值\",\"operators的合并抽象：当某些operator计算量很小（如elementwise\",\"operators的合并抽象\",\"operators\",\"operator（shepherd\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Operator\",\"offset\":12},{\"match\":\"Operator是Infera\",\"offset\":53},{\"match\":\"operators的合并抽象：当某些operator计算量很小（如elementwise\",\"offset\":84},{\"match\":\"micro\",\"offset\":149},{\"match\":\"operator调度会引入过大的scheduling/fusion/launch\",\"offset\":155},{\"match\":\"operator（shepherd\",\"offset\":234},{\"match\":\"operator）。Shepherd\",\"offset\":252},{\"match\":\"operator内部包含多个原始operator的kernel，由shepherd\",\"offset\":271},{\"match\":\"operator在Infera\",\"offset\":413},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":524},{\"match\":\"micro\",\"offset\":535},{\"match\":\"operators\",\"offset\":541},{\"match\":\"micro\",\"offset\":629},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":654},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":680},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":908},{\"match\":\"operator将小operator的调度从per-micro-operator降级为per-shepherd-operator，保持scheduling\",\"offset\":973},{\"match\":\"oper