"hits":[{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Shepherd Operator.md","basename":"Shepherd Operator","score":658.0640247000432,"foundWords":["micro","operator","operator调度会引入过大的scheduling/fusion/launch","operator调度会引入过大的scheduling","operator在infera","operator对外表现为单一调度单元（一个micro","operator对外表现为单一调度单元","operator内部按原始operator的拓扑顺序调用子kernel。shepherd","operator内部按原始operator的拓扑顺序调用子kernel","operator内部包含多个原始operator的kernel，由shepherd","operator内部包含多个原始operator的kernel","operator降级为per","operator将小operator的调度从per","operator将小operator的调度从per-micro-operator降级为per-shepherd-operator，保持scheduling","operator将小operator的调度从per-micro-operator降级为per-shepherd-operator","operator是infera","operator）。shepherd","operator），避免teu","operator。shepherd","operator的具体大小阈值。","operator的具体大小阈值","operators的合并抽象：当某些operator计算量很小（如elementwise","operators的合并抽象","operators","operator（shepherd"],"matches":[{"match":"Operator","offset":12},{"match":"Operator是Infera","offset":53},{"match":"operators的合并抽象：当某些operator计算量很小（如elementwise","offset":84},{"match":"micro","offset":149},{"match":"operator调度会引入过大的scheduling/fusion/launch","offset":155},{"match":"operator（shepherd","offset":234},{"match":"operator）。Shepherd","offset":252},{"match":"operator内部包含多个原始operator的kernel，由shepherd","offset":271},{"match":"operator在Infera","offset":413},{"match":"operator","offset":524},{"match":"micro","offset":535},{"match":"operators","offset":541},{"match":"micro","offset":629},{"match":"operator","offset":654},{"match":"operator","offset":680},{"match":"operator","offset":908},{"match":"operator将小operator的调度从per-micro-operator降级为per-shepherd-operator，保持scheduling","offset":973},{"match":"operator","offset":1133},{"match":"operator","offset":1146},{"match":"operator。Shepherd","offset":1195},{"match":"operator内部按原始operator的拓扑顺序调用子kernel。Shepherd","offset":1248},{"match":"operator对外表现为单一调度单元（一个micro","offset":1293},{"match":"operator），避免TEU","offset":1321},{"match":"operator","offset":1388},{"match":"operator的具体大小阈值。","offset":1415}],"excerpt":"## Shepherd Operator\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nShepherd Operator是Infera compiler对小型DNN operators的合并抽象：当某些operator计算量很小（如elementwise add、activation），单独作为micro operator调度会引入过大的scheduling/fusion/launch overhead，compiler将它们合并为一个子图并创建virtual operator（shepherd operator）。Shepherd operator内部包含多个原始operator的kernel，由shepherd…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md","basename":"Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation","score":414.6486961624227,"foundWords":["micro","operator生成多个ilp/tlp/arithmetic","operator生成多个ilp","operator生成多种kernel"],"matches":[{"match":"Micro","offset":17},{"match":"Micro","offset":78},{"match":"micro","offset":120},{"match":"operator生成多种kernel","offset":126},{"match":"micro","offset":288},{"match":"operator生成多个ILP/TLP/arithmetic","offset":294}],"excerpt":"## Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nMulti-Version Micro Kernel Generation是Infera compiler为每个micro operator生成多种kernel candidates的策略：通过配置不同的register使用上限（64/96/128）、shared memory上限（48/80/112/144 KiB）、pipeline stage数（2/3/4）、以及spatial/reduction axis tile size组合，为同一micro operator生成多个ILP/TLP/ari…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Arithmetic Intensity-Aware PIM-GPU Operator Scheduling（算术强度感知的PIM-GPU算子调度）.md","basename":"Arithmetic Intensity-Aware PIM-GPU Operator Scheduling（算术强度感知的PIM-GPU算子调度）","score":333.4649767487757,"foundWords":["micro","micro-batch","operator"],"matches":[{"match":"Operator","offset":38},{"match":"Operator","offset":128},{"match":"operator","offset":162},{"match":"micro-batch","offset":291},{"match":"operator","offset":313},{"match":"operator","offset":445},{"match":"operator","offset":515},{"match":"micro-batch","offset":2087},{"match":"operator","offset":2259},{"match":"operator","offset":2468}],"excerpt":"## Arithmetic Intensity-Aware PIM-GPU Operator Scheduling（算术强度感知的PIM-GPU算子调度）\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nArithmetic Intensity-Aware Operator Scheduling是SADDLE提出的一种运行时operator-to-device动态映射机制，用于PIM+GPU异