{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_02_pjDWWJOWX3Ol7C5NYLfv4701","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Megatron-LM _ Megatron-MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"Megatron-LM _ Megatron-MoE\",\"score\":599.3227415104622,\"foundWords\":[\"megatron-mo\",\"megatron-moe\",\"megatron-lm（shoeybi\",\"megatron-lm\",\"megatron\",\"kernel\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Megatron-MoE\",\"offset\":17},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM（Shoeybi\",\"offset\":76},{\"match\":\"Megatron-MoE\",\"offset\":316},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM\",\"offset\":331},{\"match\":\"Megatron-MoE\",\"offset\":463},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM\",\"offset\":543},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM\",\"offset\":749},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":874},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM\",\"offset\":973},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM\",\"offset\":1041},{\"match\":\"Megatron-MoE\",\"offset\":1124},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM\",\"offset\":1509},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM\",\"offset\":1642},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM\",\"offset\":2278}],\"excerpt\":\"## Megatron-LM / Megatron-MoE\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMegatron-LM（Shoeybi et al., 2019）是 NVIDIA 开发的大规模语言模型分布式训练框架，核心贡献是提出了高效的模型并行策略——Tensor Parallelism (TP) 将单层 Transformer 的算子切分到多 GPU。后续版本扩展支持 Pipeline Parallelism (PP)、Data Parallelism (DP)、Sequence Parallelism (SP) 和 Expert Para…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CPU Chunked Attention Verification Kernel（CPU 分块注意力验证 Kernel）.md\",\"basename\":\"CPU Chunked Attention Verification Kernel（CPU 分块注意力验证 Kernel）\",\"score\":539.8922023798888,\"foundWords\":[\"megatron\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel）\",\"kernel（cpu\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Kernel（CPU\",\"offset\":38},{\"match\":\"Kernel）\",\"offset\":57},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":123},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":366},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":579},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":662},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":706},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":1893},{\"match\":\"kerne\",\"offset\":2203},{\"match\":\"在 Megatr\",\"offset\":2845}],\"excerpt\":\"## CPU Chunked Attention Verification Kernel（CPU 分块注意力验证 Kernel）\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nCPU Chunked Attention Verification Kernel 是 SpecMoEOff 为 speculative decoding 在 MoE offloading 场景下设计的 CPU 端 attention 算子。它处理 Q∈R^{n×d}, K∈R^{(l+n)×d}, V∈R^{(l+n)×d}（其中 n 为 draft tokens 数，l 为 prefix tokens 数）的 chunked attention 计算，是 speculative decodi…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block-Sparse GEMM for MoE (MegaBlocks).md\",\"basename\":\"Block-Sparse GEMM for MoE (MegaBlocks)\",\"score\":465.31511804424684,\"foundWords\":[\"mega\",\"megablocks:\",\"megablocks\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel，在不丢弃\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":30},{\"match\":\"kernel，在不丢弃\",\"offset\":134},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":285},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":427},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks:\",\"offset\":449},{\"match\":\"megablocks\",\"offset\":974},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":1311},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1330},{\"match\":\"Megablocks\",\"offset\":1572},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1596},{\"match\":\"Megablocks\",\"offset\":1723},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1826},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":1865},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":1892},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1946},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2004},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":2039},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2060},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2076},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":2137},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2148},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":2170},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":2199},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":2243},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":2276},{\"match\":\"MegaBlocks\",\"offset\":2303},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2459}],\"excerpt\":\"## Block-Sparse GEMM for MoE (MegaBlocks)\\n术语解释\\n由 Gale et al. (Stanford, 2023) 提出，将 MoE 计算重新表述为 block-sparse 操作，开发专用 block-sparse GPU kernel，在不丢弃 token 的前提下高效处理 MoE 的动态负载。\\n术语是什么？\\n传统 MoE 实现先 scatter token 到各 expert 组的连续 buffer，然后对每组执行 dense GEMM。这需要数据拷贝且可能因 expert capacity 限制丢弃 token。MegaBlocks 将 MoE 问题直接映射为 block-sparse matrix…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE\",\"score\":455.731855250418,\"foundWords\":[\"megakernel（fused\",\"megakernel。\",\"megakernel\",\"megatron-lm+deep\",\"megatron-lm+deepep\",\"megatron\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel）是将原本由多个独立\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Megakernel\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":33},{\"match\":\"Megakernel（Fused\",\"offset\":106},{\"match\":\"Kernel）是将原本由多个独立\",\"offset\":134},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":151},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":208},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":223},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":267},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":314},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":362},{\"match\":\"megakernel\",\"offset\":381},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":429},{\"match\":\"megakernel\",\"offset\":471},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":576},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":645},{\"match\":\"megakernel。\",\"offset\":687},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":701},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":722},{\"match\":\"megakernel\",\"offset\":775},{\"match\":\"megakernel\",\"offset\":816},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1409},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1425},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM+DeepEP\",\"offset\":1442},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1738},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1793},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1833},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":1934}],\"excerpt\":\"## Megakernel / Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMegakernel（Fused Persistent Kernel）是将原本由多个独立 kernel 和 CPU-coordinated collective 组成的复杂分布式计算融合为单个 CUDA kernel 的设计范式。该 kernel 以 persistent 方式运行——一次 launch 后持续执行，在 kernel 内完成全部计算和通信，直到所有工作完成才返回。与传统的 \\\"…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Persistent Kernel _ Megakernel for Distributed MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"Persistent Kernel _ Megakernel for Distributed MoE\",\"score\":446.5089983806953,\"foundWords\":[\"megakernel（巨型融合内核），将分布式\",\"megakernel\",\"megatron-lm\",\"megatron\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel（持久内核）是一种仅需一次\",\"kernel。传统实现（deepspeed-moe、megatron-lm）每个\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":14},{\"match\":\"Megakernel\",\"offset\":23},{\"match\":\"Kernel（持久内核）是一种仅需一次\",\"offset\":111},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":169},{\"match\":\"Megakernel（巨型融合内核），将分布式\",\"offset\":206},{\"match\":\"kernel。传统实现（DeepSpeed-MoE、Megatron-LM）每个\",\"offset\":331},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":396},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":461},{\"match\":\"megakernel\",\"offset\":490},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":515},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":545},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":566},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":652},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":707},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1245},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":1260},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1483},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1648},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1716},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1861},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":1972}],\"excerpt\":\"## Persistent Kernel / Megakernel for Distributed MoE\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nPersistent Kernel（持久内核）是一种仅需一次 CPU launch、在 GPU 上持续运行直到完成全部计算任务的 GPU kernel 设计范式。FlashMoE 将这一概念推向极致，构建了一个 Megakernel（巨型融合内核），将分布式 MoE operator 的全部阶段——Gate routing、Token Dispatch、Expert FFN (2×GEMM)、Expert Combine、跨…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）.md\",\"basename\":\"Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）\",\"score\":400.8765038727101,\"foundWords\":[\"megatron-core\",\"megatron\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel——将两个第一层投影\",\"kernel）\",\"kernel，专门针对\",\"kernel，消除中间结果的\",\"kernel。关键差异于推理融合：\",\"kernel。通过配置文件或环境变量启用。moe-inference-bench\",\"kernel。\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Kernel）\",\"offset\":20},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":122},{\"match\":\"kernel，消除中间结果的\",\"offset\":229},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":252},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":300},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":528},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":554},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":695},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":801},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":941},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":962},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1015},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1053},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":1151},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1262},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":3126},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":3152},{\"match\":\"kernel。通过配置文件或环境变量启用。MoE-Inference-Bench\",\"offset\":3340},{\"match\":\"kernel。\",\"offset\":3407},{\"match\":\"Megatron-Core\",\"offset\":3419},{\"match\":\"kernel，专门针对\",\"offset\":3575},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":4163},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":4371},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":4459},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":4676},{\"match\":\"kernel——将两个第一层投影\",\"offset\":4731},{\"match\":\"kernel。关键差异于推理融合：\",\"offset\":4816}],\"excerpt\":\"## Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nFused MoE 是一种针对 Mixture of Experts（MoE）推理优化的 GPU kernel 融合技术，核心思想是将 expert 选择（routing）、token 分发（dispatch）和 expert FFN 计算（GEMM + activation + GEMM）融合为单个 GPU kernel，消除中间结果的 HBM 往返和 kernel launch 开销。在未融合的 naive MoE 实现中，推理流程包含多个串行 kernel launch：(1) ro…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megablocks (Block-Sparse Kernel for MoE Training).md\",\"basename\":\"Megablocks (Block-Sparse Kernel for MoE Training)\",\"score\":392.70835697978254,\"foundWords\":[\"megablocks:\",\"megablocks\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel，使得不同\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Megablocks\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":28},{\"match\":\"Megablocks\",\"offset\":99},{\"match\":\"kernel，使得不同\",\"offset\":206},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":262},{\"match\":\