oken\",\"kernel（用于\",\"kernel。\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":10},{\"match\":\"kernel，编译为\",\"offset\":160},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":213},{\"match\":\"kernel（计算传递给路由器的近似稠密梯度）、token\",\"offset\":340},{\"match\":\"kernel、以及梯度注入\",\"offset\":373},{\"match\":\"kernel。\",\"offset\":387},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":417},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":475},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":503},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":543},{\"match\":\"kernel，利\",\"offset\":1390},{\"match\":\"kerne\",\"offset\":1457},{\"match\":\"kerne\",\"offset\":1558},{\"match\":\"Megablock\",\"offset\":1580},{\"match\":\"kerne\",\"offset\":1648},{\"match\":\"Kernel-Fusio\",\"offset\":1794},{\"match\":\"kernel（用\",\"offset\":2000},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":2100}],\"excerpt\":\"## Triton Kernel for MoE Training（MoE训练的Triton内核）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nTriton (Tillet et al., 2019) 是 OpenAI 开发的一种中间语言和编译器，用于编写高性能 GPU kernel，编译为 PTX 代码在 NVIDIA GPU 上执行。在 MoE 训练场景中，Triton kernel 用于实现专家分组近似、token 重排、梯度聚合等操作，替代原生 PyTorch 操作以提升效率。本论文使用 Triton 实现 Expert Group Approximatio…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）.md\",\"basename\":\"Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）\",\"score\":275.8625988713141,\"foundWords\":[\"mega\",\"megascale-moe:\",\"megascale-moe\",\"megascale\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel：分配少量\",\"kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）\",\"kernels\",\"kernel（论文\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）\",\"offset\":73},{\"match\":\"MegaScale-MoE\",\"offset\":160},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":183},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":238},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":507},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":600},{\"match\":\"MegaScale-MoE\",\"offset\":617},{\"match\":\"kernel（论文\",\"offset\":643},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":769},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"off