:2459}],\"excerpt\":\"## Block-Sparse GEMM for MoE (MegaBlocks)\\n术语解释\\n由 Gale et al. (Stanford, 2023) 提出，将 MoE 计算重新表述为 block-sparse 操作，开发专用 block-sparse GPU kernel，在不丢弃 token 的前提下高效处理 MoE 的动态负载。\\n术语是什么？\\n传统 MoE 实现先 scatter token 到各 expert 组的连续 buffer，然后对每组执行 dense GEMM。这需要数据拷贝且可能因 expert capacity 限制丢弃 token。MegaBlocks 将 MoE 问题直接映射为 block-sparse matrix…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE\",\"score\":455.731855250418,\"foundWords\":[\"megakernel（fused\",\"megakernel。\",\"megakernel\",\"megatron-lm+deep\",\"megatron-lm+deepep\",\"megatron\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel）是将原本由多个独立\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Megakernel\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":33},{\"match\":\"Megakernel（Fused\",\"offset\":106},{\"match\":\"Kernel）是将原本由多个独立\",\"offset\":134},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":151},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":208},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":223},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":267},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":314},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":362},{\"match\":\"megakernel\",\"offset\":381},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":429},{\"match\":\"megakernel\",\"offset\":471},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":576},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":645},{\"match\":\"megakernel。\",\"offset\":687},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":701},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":722},{\"match\":\"megakernel\",\"offset\":775},{\"match\":\"megakernel\",\"offset\":816},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1409},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1425},{\"match\":\"Megatron-LM+DeepEP\",\"offset\":1442},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1738},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1793},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1833},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":1934}],\"excerpt\":\"## Megakernel / Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMegakernel（Fused Persistent Kernel）是