 Attention Verification Kernel（CPU 分块注意力验证 Kernel）\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nCPU Chunked Attention Verification Kernel 是 SpecMoEOff 为 speculative decoding 在 MoE offloading 场景下设计的 CPU 端 attention 算子。它处理 Q∈R^{n×d}, K∈R^{(l+n)×d}, V∈R^{(l+n)×d}（其中 n 为 draft tokens 数，l 为 prefix tokens 数）的 chunked attention 计算，是 speculative decodi…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block-Sparse GEMM for MoE (MegaBlocks).md","basename":"Block-Sparse GEMM for MoE (MegaBlocks)","score":465.31511804424684,"foundWords":["mega","megablocks:","megablocks","kernel","kernel知识笔记","kernel，在不丢弃"],"matches":[{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":30},{"match":"kernel，在不丢弃","offset":134},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":285},{"match":"kernel","offset":427},{"match":"MegaBlocks:","offset":449},{"match":"megablocks","offset":974},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":1311},{"match":"kernel","offset":1330},{"match":"Megablocks","offset":1572},{"match":"kernel","offset":1596},{"match":"Megablocks","offset":1723},{"match":"kernel","offset":1826},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":1865},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":1892},{"match":"kernel","offset":1946},{"match":"kernel","offset":2004},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":2039},{"match":"kernel","offset":2060},{"match":"kernel","offset":2076},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":2137},{"match":"kernel","offset":2148},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":2170},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":2199},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":2243},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":2276},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":2303},{"match":"kernel","offset":2459}],"excerpt":"## Block-Sparse GEMM for MoE (MegaBlocks)\n术语解释\n由 Gale et al. (Stanford, 2023) 提出，将 MoE 计算重新表述为 block-sparse 操作，开发专用 block-sparse GPU kernel，在不丢弃 token 的前提下高效处理 MoE 的动态负载。\n术语是什么？\n传统 MoE 实现先 scatter token 到各 expert 组的连续 buffer，然后对每组执行 dense GEMM。这需要数据拷贝且可能因 expert capacity 限制丢弃 token。MegaBlocks 将 MoE 问题直接映射为 block-sparse matrix…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md","basename":