otes/kernel知识笔记/GroupedGEMM in MoE Expert Computation（MoE 专家计算中的分组通用矩阵乘法）.md","basename":"GroupedGEMM in MoE Expert Computation（MoE 专家计算中的分组通用矩阵乘法）","score":103.03946740098309,"foundWords":["mega","megascale-moe:","megascale-moe","megascale","megatron-lm","megatron","kernel","kernel知识笔记","kernel，一次","kernel。在"],"matches":[{"match":"kernel。在","offset":160},{"match":"kernel","offset":336},{"match":"kernel","offset":435},{"match":"MegaScale-MoE","offset":454},{"match":"kernel","offset":532},{"match":"MegaScale-MoE","offset":549},{"match":"kernel","offset":1913},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":2121},{"match":"kernel","offset":2174},{"match":"MegaScale-MoE","offset":2197},{"match":"kernel，一次","offset":2234},{"match":"kernel","offset":2244},{"match":"kernel","offset":2337},{"match":"MegaScale-MoE","offset":2575},{"match":"MegaScale-MoE","offset":2724},{"match":"MegaScale-MoE:","offset":2938}],"excerpt":"GroupedGEMM（Grouped General Matrix Multiplication）是 MoE 模型训练和推理中用于加速多个 expert FFN 层并行计算的核心 kernel。在 MoE 架构中，每个 token 被路由到 top-k 个 expert，不同 expert 接收不同数量的 token，因此需要对多个不同形状的小矩阵乘法进行批量计算。GroupedGEMM 将多个 expert 的矩阵乘法（每个 expert 执行 input_tokens × expert_weight）合并到一个 CUDA kernel 中执行，通过 cuFuncSetAttribute 精细控制每个 expert 的资源使用（shared memory、L1 cache、线程数），避免逐个 expert 串行调用的 kernel launch 开销。在 MegaSc…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/GroupGEMM (Grouped GEMM for MoE).md","basename":"GroupGEMM (Grouped GEMM for MoE)","score":79.5564235088694,"foundWords":["megatron-cutlass","megatron-lm","megatron","kernel","kernel知识笔记","kernel，当","kernel，并对","kernel，将多个"],"matches":[{"match":"kernel，将多个","offset":70},{"match":"kernel","offset":105},{"match":"kernel","offset":133},{"match":"kernel，当","offset":277},{"match":"kernel","offset":320},{"match":"kernel，并对","offset":491},{"match":"kernel","offset":528},{"match":"kernel","offset":1498},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":1637},{"match":"Megatron-Cutlass","offset":1672},{"match":"kernel","offset":1775}],"excerpt":"GroupGEMM 是针对 MoE 场景的批量矩阵乘法 kernel，将多个 expert 的独立 GEMM 操作合并为单次 kernel launch，避免 per-expert kernel launch overhead，同时利用 GPU 并行性提升小 expert 的计算效率。\n术语是什么？\n在 MoE 的 expert FFN 中，每个 expert 需要处理不同数量、不同来源的 tokens。传统实现为每个 expert 独立 launch GEMM kernel，当 expert 数量多且单个 expert token 少时产生大量 kernel launch overhead 和 GPU under-utilization。Gro…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Grouped-GEMM.md","basename":"Grouped-GEMM","score":75.63272455945769,"foundWords":["mega","megablocks","kernel","kernel知识笔记","kernel，因为每个","kernel，支持","kernel。"],"matches":[{"match":"kernel","offset":107},{"match":"kernel","offset":268},{"match":"kernel","offset":286},{"match":"kernel","offset":349},{"match":"kernel，因为每个","offset":596},{"match":"kernel","offset":748},{"match":"kernel","offset":768},{"match":"kernel","offset":988},{"match":"kernel","offset":1136},{"match":"kernel","offset":1194},{"match":"kernel","offset":1272},{"match":"kernel","offset":1292},{"match":"kernel","offset":1719},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":1855},{"match":"kernel，支持","offset":1892},{"match":"kernel。","offset":2074}],"excerpt":"Grouped-GEMM 是将多个具有相同形状但不同数据的矩阵乘法（GEMM）批量执行的 kernel 技术。在 MoE 推理/训练中，每个 expert 的 FFN 计算是独立的 GEMM：B_i W_i（token batch × expert weight matrix）。当每 GPU 持有多个 experts 时，传统方案是 for-loop 逐个 expert 调用 cuBLAS GEMM（N 次 kernel launch，N 次 kernel launch overhead），而 Grouped-GEMM 将所有 expert 的 GEMM 合并为单次 kernel launch，消除 N-1 次 launch overhead。\nLLEP 论文 Fig. 8 对此…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Block-Sparse Matrix Multiplication (SDD_DSD_DDS) for MoE.md","basename":"Block-Sparse Matrix Multiplication (SDD_DSD_DDS) for MoE","score":72.88876392037659,"foundWords":["mega","megablocks:","megablocks","kernel","kernel知识笔记","kernel（对应图"],"matches":[{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":142},{"match":"kernel","offset":540},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":556},{"match":"kernel","offset":571},{"match":"kernel（对应图","offset":1284},{"match":"Kernel","offset":1600},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":1817},{"match":"kernel","offset":1833},{"match":"MegaBlock