aining 是 MegaScale-MoE 提出的一种系统级调度策略，将每个 MoE Transformer 层的 attention 和 FFN 模块分解为独立的 GPU kernel 算子（而非依赖 torch.autograd 的 monolithic 自动微分），在一个统一的 macro module 中手动编排前向和反向传播的所有计算与通信算子的执行顺序。相比于 Megatron-LM 依赖 PyTorch 自动微分系统（torch.autograd）进行反向传播，Holistic Scheduling 可以实现：\n(1) 通信算子与无依赖的计算算子在独立的 CUDA stream 上异步并发执行（…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Adaptive All-to-All Communication（自适应全交换通信）.md","basename":"Adaptive All-to-All Communication（自适应全交换通信）","score":64.07680657087143,"foundWords":["megatron-lm","megatron","kernel","kernel知识笔记","kernel,","kernel）","kernel，对称反向）"],"matches":[{"match":"kernel","offset":570},{"match":"kernel","offset":619},{"match":"kernel）","offset":707},{"match":"kernel,","offset":940},{"match":"kernel）","offset":1137},{"match":"kernel）","offset":1334},{"match":"kernel，对称反向）","offset":1385},{"match":"Megatron-LM","offset":1763}],"excerpt":"从kernel调度角度拆解术语：\nAdaptive All-to-All 在每个 MoE 层的通信 kernel 调度流程：\n```\n// 4 GPUs, 4 experts, 每 GPU 10 tokens 为例\n// Step 1: Monitoring（本地 GPU kernel）\nGPU-1: expert_counts = {E1:4, E2:1, E3:3, E4:2}\nGPU-2: expert_counts = {E1:2, E2:6, E3:1, E4:1}\nGPU-3: expert_counts = {E1:0, E2:3, E3:7, E4:0}\nGPU-4: expe…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Transpose Indices (Secondary Index for Sparse Matrix Transposition).md","basename":"Transpose Indices (Secondary Index for Sparse Matrix Transposition)","score":62.166624422814266,"foundWords":["mega","megablocks:","megablocks","kernel","kernel知识笔记"],"matches":[{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":136},{"match":"MegaBlocks","offset":335},{"match":"kernel","offset":492},{"match":"kernel","offset":562},{"match":"kernel","offset":825},{"match":"kernel","offset":1191},{"match":"MegaBlocks:","offset":1341}],"excerpt":"Transpose Indices 是 MegaBlocks 用于高效支持 block-sparse 矩阵转置访问的技术（§5.1.4）。在模型训练的前向+后向传播中，需要混合转置和非转置的 block-sparse 操作（SDD^T, DS^T D, DSD^T, DD^T S）。纯 BCSR 按行存储，在转置顺序下迭代（按列访问）需要搜索所有行来查找目标列中的 non-zero blocks（Buluç et al. 2009）。MegaBlocks 避免显式转置稀疏矩阵（需 O(nnz) 数据复制）