nt Video Understanding)\",\"score\":10.380183396050143,\"foundWords\":[\"patches\",\"level\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":393},{\"match\":\"patches\",\"offset\":1752}],\"excerpt\":\"…ransformer, Bulatov et al. NeurIPS 2022) 启发：RMT 将特殊 memory tokens 添加到 Transformer 输入/输出中以实现 segment-level recurrence，每个 segment 的 memory token 输出作为下一 segment 的输入。VideoLLaMB 将这一思想从纯 NLP 迁移到 video-language 设置，关键创新在于：memory tokens 在 vision-LLM bridge 位置运作（而非 LLM 内部），因此不会干扰 LLM 的语言理解能力；memory tokens 通过 self-attention 同时吸收视觉信息和历史记忆；最终 32 个 memory tokens 代表整个视频的压缩表示，与当前段视觉表示一起送入 LLM。\\n从算法pipeline角度拆解术语，…\"}],\"totalCount\":27,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"patch-level parallel decomposition diffusion DiT spatial temporal MixFusion path:knowledge_notes\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a511cfb5-3fb6-4c7c-8af6-bb71922ecdfb","uuid":"cb9efee4-c5fe-4aa0-8887-15a90ebb9d98","timestamp":"2026-05-30T18:47:46.568Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference.md\",\"basename\":\"Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference\",\"score\":751.0136268529667,\"foundWords\":[\"patch\",\"patch,\",\"patch内部信息\",\"patch:\",\"patch-level\",\"patches_of_this_resolution\",\"patches_batch\",\"patches交互形成cartesian\",\"patches\",\"patch级扩散推理的算子分类\",\"level\",\"level\\\"（全局）信息上，这些算子可被decompose为独立子算子在各patch上并行执行。算子分为两类：\",\"level\\\"（局部）而非\\\"image\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Patch-Level\",\"offset\":25},{\"match\":\"Patch-Level\",\"offset\":103},{\"match\":\"patch级扩散推理的算子分类\",\"offset\":135},{\"match\":\"patch\",\"offset\":179},{\"match\":\"patch-level\",\"offset\":208},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":273},{\"match\":\"level\",\"offset\":292},{\"match\":\"patch\",\"offset\":329},{\"match\":\"patch内部信息\",\"offset\":417},{\"match\":\"patch\",\"offset\":432},{\"match\":\"patch\",\"offset\":508},{\"match\":\"patches交互形成Cartesian\",\"offset\":547},{\