rnel barrier (1.0-1.7× speedup) |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling（协同编译与调度）.md | 72.5 | Infera：离线多版本 kernel + 在线动态选择/fusion/launch 的协同编译-调度架构 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture (AI Core _ AI Vector _ Da Vinci).md | 24.0 | Ascend NPU：AI Core (16×16×16 MAC) + AI Vector (256-bit SIMD) + Scalar 三单元异构并发 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md | 14.6 | EEVEE：Visual encoder / Text decoder 独立 SM 分区 + Synergistic Greedy Search 策略生成 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Flexible Stage Disaggregation with Physical Co-location.md | 21.7 | EPD-Serve：7 种 E/P/D 解耦拓扑 + AI Core/Vector 算子级互补复用 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm (Minimum Equivalent Graph + Bipartite Matching).md | 29.3 | Nimble：MEG 去除冗余传递边→Bipartite Matching→CUDA stream 分配 (max concurrency=15) |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mixed-Resolution Batching for Diffusion Model Serving.md | 138.9 | MixFusion：GCD-based patch 统一化 (sequential 17.8s→batched 9.5s) |\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节（数据流/架构）—— 四种分解粒度与硬件映射\n\n### 1.1 分解粒度分类总览\n\nServing 层对单请求推理计算图的分解可在四个粒度层次上进行，每个层次对应不同的并行机会和硬件利用模式：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"单请求推理计算图 DAG\"] --> B[\"算子级分解<br/>Operator-Level\"]\n    A --> C[\"层/模块级分解<br/>Layer/Module-Level\"]\n    A --> D[\"Token/Patch级分解<br/>Token/Patch-Level\"]\n    A --> E[\"模态级分解<br/>Modality-Level\"]\n    \n    B --> B1[\"Micro-operator tiles<br/>Infera / Nimble / MegaScale-MoE\"]\n    C --> C1[\"Expert FFN / Attention Block<br/>Fused MoE / HAP / EEVEE / EPD-Serve\"]\n    D --> D1[\"Uniform Patches / Token Sub-batches<br/>MixFusion / FinDEP / MegaBlocks\"]\n    E --> E1[\"Vision/Text/Audio 独立子图<br/>EEVEE / EPD-Serve / Cornfigurator\"]\n    \n    B1 --> HW1[\"GPU Warp/SM Tensor Core<br/>NPU AI Core/Vector<br/>TPU MXU/VPU\"]\n    C1 --> HW2[\"GPU SM Group (MPS)<br/>NPU AI Core Group\"]\n    D1 --> HW3[\"GPU SM Array (全并行)<br/>TPU MXU Array\"]\n    E1 --> HW4[\"Multi-NPU / Multi-GPU<br/>NCD / NVLink 互联\"]\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- 四种粒度的关系是层次化的——实际上系统通常组合使用多层分解。例如 Infera 在编译期做算子级 tile 分解（大 op→micro op），运行时由 TEU 将 micro-kernel 在 warp 级水平融合为高效执行单元。MixFusion 同时使用 patch 级（CSP 格式）和算子级（pixel-wise vs context-dependent 分类）分解。\n- 粒度越细，潜在并发度越高，但调度开销（kernel launch、同步、metadata 管理）也越大。Shepherd Operator 的存在正是为了解决「小算子调度开销超过执行时间」的粒度下限问题。\n\n---\n\n### 1.2 算子级分解（Operator-Level Decomposition）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md` (score: 1309.2), `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Shepherd Operator.md` (score: 1413.2), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm (Minimum Equivalent Graph + Bipartite Matching).md` (score: 29.3)\n\n#### 方法1: Infera Tile-Based 分解 + 自适应粒度控制\n\nInfera compiler 将模型 forward pass 的每个 DNN operator 按 tile size 决策切分为 micro operator。关键创新在于**自适应粒度控制**——大型 operator（Conv2D、GEMM）切分为 tile 级 micro operator，每个 tile 独立编译为 micro-kernel；小型 operator（elementwise add、activation）合并为 **shepherd operator**，避免 per-operator 调度 overhead 超过计算时间。\n\n**编译与执行框架模拟**:\n\n```\nStep 1: ONNX Model → TVM Relay Frontend → Computation Graph\nStep 2: Tile-Tailored Partition\n  ├── 大 operator: Conv2D → Conv_tile_0, Conv_tile_1, ...\n  │   └── 每个 tile 独立编译为 micro-kernel\n  └── 小 operator 组: Add + ReLU + BatchNorm → Shepherd_0\n      └── Shepherd kernel 内部按拓扑顺序调用子 kernel\n      └── 对外表现为单一调度单元（一个 micro operator）\nStep 3: Tile Size 决策 (Top-Down 静态分析)\n  ├── Register file level: 32-bit register/thread limit = 64/96/128\n  │   └── 平衡 ILP vs TLP: register 越多→ILP 越高, 但 concurrent warp 越少\n  ├── Shared memory level: usage/block limit = 48/80/112/144 KiB\n  │   └── spatial tile = thread_tile × thread_count\n  └── Global memory level: spatial tile = block_tile × grid_size(64)\nStep 4: Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation\n  ├── pipeline stage 2/3/4 + async copy + warp specialization\n  └── cut-and-patch SASS instruction scheduling (ILP 优化)\nStep 5: CUDA Binary Static Library (.a) → 注册到 Inference Server Model Pool\n\n在线推理 (TEU 三阶段):\n  Phase 1 - SelectKernels: DAG 中选 zero in-degree 且最大化 asynchronous wavefront\n                           的 data blocks → 在线回归模型选最优 kernel 版本\n  Phase 2 - FuseKernels: CUDA binary level warp-level horizontal fusion\n  Phase 3 - LaunchKernel: HKQ→GDRCopy→DKQ→daemon kernel CDP launch\n```\n\n**伪时间线（H100 单 GPU, Conv+ReLU+BN 融合, 4 mainloop + 4 copy warps）**:\n\n```\nT0-T1: TMA 异步加载 Conv_tile_0 input (global→shared)    [Copy Warp 0-3, 不占 SM]\nT1-T3: Conv_tile_0 compute (Tensor Core MMA)               [Mainloop Warp 0-3]\nT2-T4: TMA 预取 Conv_tile_1 input (与 tile_0 compute 重叠) [Copy Warp 0-3]\nT3-T5: Conv_tile_1 compute + tile_0 ReLU/BN in shepherd    [Mainloop Warp 0-3]\nT4-T6: TMA 预取 Conv_tile_2 input                         [Copy Warp 0-3]\n...\n→ 关键: copy warp 和 mainloop warp 在不同 warp scheduler slot 上并发执行\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **Shepherd Operator 的设计动机**: tile-based 调度有 overhead（kernel selection metadata、fusion cost、launch latency），对小 operator（单个 elementwise op 仅数 μs 执行时间）来说调度 overhead 可能超过执行时间。Shepherd operator 将小 operator 的调度从 per-micro-operator 降级为 per-shepherd-operator，保持调度粒度合理。\n- **Zero-tuning 特性**: 所有 tile size、register/shared memory 分配、pipeline 配置由静态约束直接计算，无需 GPU profiling 反馈。编译时间比 Ansor/MetaSchedule 低 2-3 个数量级，比 Roller（仍使用 performance model）节省 66-86% CPU 时间。\n- **协同编译-调度**: 编译器提供 multi-version kernels + metadata (#inst, resource usage)，调度器根据运行时 GPU 并发状态选择最优 kernel 版本——实现 Halide 的 algorithm/schedule 解耦思想在推理时调度层面的延伸。\n\n#### 方法2: Nimble DAG→MEG→流分配\n\nNimble 将 DAG 中算子分配到多个 CUDA stream 以实现最大逻辑并发度。核心算法分四步：\n\n```\n输入: DAG G = (V, E) 其中 V = operators, E = data dependencies\n输出: stream_assignment: map<v ∈ V, stream_id>\n\nStep 1: 构建 Minimum Equivalent Graph (MEG)\n  计算传递闭包，去除冗余传递边\n  例: A→B→C 且 A→C 存在 → A→C 是冗余边（可通过 A→B→C 推导）\n  MEG 暴露真正的直接依赖关系\n\nStep 2: 构建 Bipartite Graph\n  每条 MEG 边 → 二分图中的节点\n  若两条边 (u₁,v₁) 和 (u₂,v₂) 无共同节点且无依赖 → 二分图中连接\n\nStep 3: Maximum Matching (Ford-Fulkerson)\n  每个 matching → 一组可并行执行的边 → 分配到一个 CUDA stream\n\nStep 4: Stream Assignment + CUDA Event 插入\n  同 stream 内算子按拓扑序排列\n  跨 stream 仅在 MEG 边跨越 stream 边界时插入 CUDA event 同步\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **为什么需要 MEG**: 原始 DAG 的 max_flow 可能给出误导性结论。如图 3 示例：DAG 中 A→E 有两条路径（A→B→C→D→E 和 A→E 直连），max_flow(A→E)=1 暗示「并行度=1」。MEG 去除 A→E 冗余传递边后暴露真实并行度。\n- **理论保证**: 算法实现 maximum logical concurrency 且 minimum number of synchronizations。NASNet-A 实测 max concurrency=15，multi-stream 贡献 up to 1.88× speedup。\n- **GPU 硬件并发模型**: H100 支持 32 个并发 CUDA stream——每个 stream 内 kernel 串行，跨 stream kernel 可真正并发（前提是不共享同一 SM 子分区）。GPU warp scheduler 在各 SM 上以 warp 粒度交错执行不同 stream 的 thread block。\n\n#### 硬件映射：算子级分解在不同硬件上的执行效率\n\n| 硬件平台 | 计算单元 | 算子级分解适配 | 关键约束 |\n|----------|---------|---------------|---------|\n| GPU (H100) | 132 SM, Tensor Core + CUDA Core + TMA | Micro-kernel warp specialization 在 SM 内并发; TMA 异步搬运与计算 overlap | per-micro-op kernel launch overhead; SM 内 register/shared memory 竞争 |\n| NPU (Ascend 910B) | AI Core (16×16×16 MAC) + AI Vector (256-bit SIMD) + Scalar | AI Core 执行 MatMul tile; AI Vector 并发执行 AllReduce/LayerNorm tile——算子级空间复用 | UB (256KB) 容量约束 tile 粒度下限; 三单元虽并发但共享 UB |\n| TPU (v5e/v5p) | MXU (128×128 systolic) + VPU (vector) | XLA 编译期自动分解为 MXU/VPU 操作序列 | 编译期固定调度, 运行时不可动态调整 |\n\n---\n\n### 1.3 层/模块级分解（Layer/Module-Level Decomposition）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）.md` (score: 400.9), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md` (score: 455.7), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md` (score: 14.6)\n\n#### 方法3: MoE Expert 级分解（Fused MoE → Megakernel）\n\n将 MoE 层的 Gate→Dispatch→Expert FFN→Combine 四个阶段作为独立并发计算单元。传统实现为 per-expert kernel launch（每个 expert 一次 GEMM launch），产生大量 kernel launch overhead。Fused MoE 将所有 expert 的 FFN 合并为单 kernel；FlashMoE Megakernel 更进一步将分布式场景的全部 MoE 算子（含跨 GPU 通信）融合为单个 persistent kernel。\n\n**vLLM Fused MoE 执行模拟（Mixtral-8x7B, H100）**:\n\n```\nStep 1: Router → Top-K\n  logits = Linear(x)                              // [total_tokens, 8]\n  topk_vals, topk_idx = topk(softmax(logits), k=2)\n\nStep 2: Token Sorting (moe_align_block_size)\n  sorted_tokens = sort_by_expert(topk_idx)\n  padding to BLOCK_SIZE 对齐 (BLOCK_M=64)\n  → Expert 0: tokens [t3, t7, t12, ...]\n  → Expert 1: tokens [t1, t5, t9, ...]  (可能空)\n\nStep 3: Fused MoE Kernel (单次 launch, Grid = E × ceil(tokens/BLOCK_M))\n  For expert_id in 0..7:\n    For token_block in expert's tokens:\n      a_block = A[sorted_token_ids[block_start:...]]    // 间接寻址, 仅加载该 expert 的 token\n      w1 = B[expert_id]                                  // 仅加载一次 expert 权重\n      gate = silu(a_block @ w1_gate)                     // FC1 gate+up 融合\n      up   = a_block @ w1_up\n      hidden = gate * up\n      out = hidden @ w2                                  // FC2 down\n      out = out * topk_weights[block_start:...]          // routing weight 内联\n      atomic_add(C[sorted_token_ids], out)               // top-k experts 的加权和原子聚合\n\n对比传统: 6-8 次 kernel launch → 1-2 次\n吞吐提升: 15-20% (大 batch, H100)\n```\n\n**FlashMoE Megakernel 执行模拟（分布式 MoE, 多 GPU）**:\n\n```\nGrid: N blocks/GPU; Block 角色: blockId < N-1 → Processor, blockId == N-1 → OS Block\n\nOS Block (block N-1) 内:\n  Warp 0: Scheduler (work-conserving, 多线程调度)\n    └── 循环 sweep doorbells → WarpInclusiveSum → 分配 ready task → idle Processor\n  Warp 1-3: Subscriber\n    └── Poll remote flags → decode remote tile packet → enqueue task → doorbell Scheduler\n\nProcessor Block:\n  while(!interrupt):\n    switch(task.type):\n      case GEMM0: CUTLASS device-side fused GEMM + GELU → notify Scheduler\n      case GEMM1: CUTLASS device-side GEMM → NVSHMEM put to remote combine buffer\n\n性能: 1 kernel launch vs Megatron-LM+DeepEP 的 432 次\nSM occupancy: tile=(128,64), block_size=128, registers=255/thread, max 2 blocks/SM, 0 spill\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **In-kernel Work-Conserving Scheduler**: FlashMoE 用 1 个 warp（32 threads）实现 GPU 内多线程任务调度器——doorbell 是 monotonic counter（非 binary flag），Scheduler warp 并行 sweep doorbells 实现 O(1) 的 task discovery。这消除了 CPU-GPU 同步的全部开销。\n- **Device-side BLAS**: CUTLASS device-side API 在 persistent kernel 内直接执行 GEMM——传统方式必须通过 CPU launch cuBLAS kernel。\n- **Megakernel 化趋势**: 笔记证据（MPK, FlashMoE, MegaScale-MoE）显示行业正从「分解后独立调度」向「分解后重新融合为 mega-kernel」演进——分解是手段，消除 kernel barrier 后的 mega-kernel 是目标执行形态。\n\n#### 方法4: EEVEE Module Multiplexing（多模态模型模块级分解）\n\n将多模态模型的 modality-specific modules 拆分为独立进程，各自拥有独立 batch size 和 SM allocation。\n\n**EEVEE 执行框架模拟（LLaVA-1.5, A100 80GB）**:\n\n```\nGPU A100 (108 SMs)\n├── Visual Encoder Process (CLIP ViT-L/14)\n│   ├── SM allocation: 70% (≈75 SMs), 通过 CUDA_MPS_ACTIVE_THREAD_PERCENTAGE 设定\n│   ├── Batch size: B_vis=2 (图像预处理 batch)\n│   └── 执行: image resize→normalize→H2D→ViT forward→visual tokens [577, 1024]\n│\n├── Text Decoder Process (LLaMA-7B)\n│   ├── SM allocation: 30% (≈33 SMs)\n│   ├── Batch size: B_txt=8 (文本生成 batch)\n│   └── 执行: text embedding→[visual tokens; text tokens]→LLM decode\n│\n└── Inter-Module Communication: GPU shared memory + CUDA IPC handler\n    └── Visual tokens → Text Decoder 消费 (延迟远低于 PCIe 的 ~50μs)\n\nOffline Synergistic Greedy Search 策略生成:\n  Step 1: 从 monolithic 顺序执行初始化策略\n  Step 2: 逐步增加各模块 batch size\n    └── 每次将增量放在对 batch latency 负面影响最小的 stage\n  Step 3: Balanced SM Reallocation\n    └── 从最短 latency 模块转移 SM→最长 latency 模块, 直至 stage 内各模块 latency 趋近平衡\n  约束: per-stage SM 总和=100%, 各模块 B = egress module B 的整数倍, E2E latency≤SLO\n  复杂度: O(|M|² · max_batch · 100)\n\nStage-Level Parallelism:\n  Visual Encoder preprocess (resize/normalize/H2D, 可达 inference 时间 40%)\n    ↔ Text Decoder inference 重叠执行\n  → 利用 pipeline 并行度避免 GPU 等待 CPU 完成预处理\n\nModal Cache:\n  同一图像对应多个问题时 (VQA2: ≥3 问题/图), 后续问题直接加载缓存的 visual tokens\n  Cache loading 通过 CUDA streams 与新请求 computation kernel 重叠\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **MPS SM Partition 的硬约束**: CUDA MPS 的 SM allocation 必须在 CUDA 初始化前通过环境变量设定且运行时不可更改。因此 EEVEE 的策略是「部署时固定、按需切换」——当负载变化超过阈值时通过 active-standby 机制（权重已驻留 GPU）在毫秒级切换到预计算策略。\n- **实验效果**: RTX 3090/A100 上 max capacity 平均 +157%, 高负载 LLaVA latency 平均 -90% vs Triton monolithic serving, GPU active SM ≈90%。\n\n#### 方法5: EPD-Serve Encode/Prefill/Decode 三阶段解耦\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Flexible Stage Disaggregation with Physical Co-location.md` (score: 21.7), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture (AI Core _ AI Vector _ Da Vinci).md` (score: 24.0)\n\n**EPD-Serve 部署拓扑切换模拟**:\n\n```\n7 种部署拓扑:\n  E-P-D:    Encode | Prefill | Decode  (3 NPU 全解耦, SLO attainment 94.34%)\n  EP-D:     Encode+Prefill | Decode   (2 NPU)\n  ED-P:     Encode+Decode | Prefill   (2 NPU, 推荐最低 TTFT)\n  E-PD:     Encode | Prefill+Decode   (2 NPU)\n  (E-P)-D:  Encode+Prefill 共置 | Decode (2 NPU, 推荐最高吞吐: +57-69% vs EP-D)\n  (E-D)-P:  Encode+Decode 共置 | Prefill (2 NPU, TTFT 降低 39-55%)\n  (E-PD):   全部共置 (1 NPU, 最大化吞吐 +13-15% vs monolithic)\n\n物理共置关键机制 (Ascend NPU):\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  AI Core (Cube Unit)    │  AI Vector (Vector)   │\n  │  MatMul (Encode ViT)    │  AllReduce (通信)     │\n  │  MatMul (Prefill LLM)   │  LayerNorm, GELU      │\n  │  256 MACs/cycle         │  256-bit SIMD         │\n  │                         │                       │\n  │  算子互补: 当 MatMul 执行时, AllReduce 可同时用 AI Vector  │\n  │  当 Prefill 等待 P-D 传输时, Encode 利用空闲 AI Core 继续  │\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **三阶段解耦的硬件依据**: Encode (ViT) 为 compute-heavy + 大 activation; Prefill 为 compute-heavy + 产生大 KV Cache; Decode 为 memory-bound (token-by-token GEMV)。三个阶段的计算/内存特征完全不同，统一调度必然导致硬件利用率低。\n- **物理共置的关键洞察**: 不同算子的硬件资源需求互补——MatMul 是 AI Core compute-heavy（低数据搬运）、AllReduce 是 AI Vector communication-heavy（高数据搬运），在同一 NPU 上交替执行减少 idle 周期。该策略的本质是**利用硬件异构计算单元的独立性**实现细粒度空间复用。\n\n---\n\n### 1.4 Token/Patch 级分解（Token/Patch-Level Decomposition）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference.md` (score: 751.0), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mixed-Resolution Batching for Diffusion Model Serving.md` (score: 138.9)\n\n#### 方法6: MixFusion Patch-Level 并行分解 (DiT/扩散模型)\n\n将不同分辨率的扩散模型输入图像 partition 为 uniform size patches，通过 CSP 格式和 Operator Taxonomy 分类实现混合分辨率批处理。\n\n**MixFusion 执行模拟（SDXL, H100, 3 请求 512²/768²/1024²）**:\n\n```\nStep 1: Patch Partition\n  patch_size = GCD(512, 768, 1024) = 256\n  Req_512: 4 patches (2×2); Req_768: 9 patches (3×3); Req_1024: 16 patches (4×4)\n  Total: 29 uniform patches [256, 256, C]\n\nStep 2: CSP Format 构建 (4 个 integer arrays, O(1) 查找)\n  RequestOffset = [0, 4, 13]; ResolutionOffset = [0, 4, 13]\n  patch→request 逆向查找表\n\nStep 3: Per-Block Denoising (每个 denoising step 的每个 block)\n  For op in block.operators:\n    if op is Pixel-wise (Linear/FFN/CrossAttn):        // >70% 计算量\n      output = batched_op(all_29_patches)              // 统一 batch=29, 标准 PyTorch\n      → GPU SM[0..131] 全并行\n\n    elif op is Self-Attention:                          // ~20% 计算量\n      For each resolution_group in [512, 768, 1024]:\n        full_feature = reconstruct_from_patches(patches_of_res)\n        output = FlashAttention(full_feature)           // per-resolution batched attn\n      → SM[0..43]→Res 512, SM[44..87]→Res 768, SM[88..131]→Res 1024 (并行)\n\n    elif op is Convolution (仅 U-Net, DiT 无):          // ~10% 计算量\n      For each patch:\n        output = FusedGroupNormWithStitching(patch, neighbor_boundaries)\n      → boundary pixels 通过 TB 间 shared memory 交换 (Patch Edge Stitcher)\n\n性能: sequential 17.8s → batched 9.5s (3 分辨率)\nDiT 优势: 无 Convolution → patched inference 自然 100% accuracy\nU-Net 约束: Convolution kernel size 1-3 → Patch Edge Stitcher 处理跨 patch 边界\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **Operator Taxonomy 分类体系**: Pixel-wise operators（仅依赖当前 patch/pixel 内部信息）可直接在各 patch 上独立并行；Context-dependent operators（Self-Attention 需要 all patches 交互、Convolution 需要相邻 patch 边界像素）需要特殊处理。\n- **Patch Size 选择**: patch_size 必须 = batch 内各 resolution 在 height/width 维的 GCD。限制是当分辨率差异极大时 patch 数可能超过 GPU memory。\n- **PES 质量**: Patch Edge Stitcher latency 接近理论 optimal（Figure 5），生成质量 PSNR 与 unpatched 无显著差异。\n\n---\n\n### 1.5 模态级分解（Modality-Level Decomposition）\n\n多模态模型的视觉流、文本流、音频流编码子图天然具有模态级独立性。EEVEE 将各模态编码器作为独立进程通过 CUDA MPS 空间多路复用；EPD-Serve 通过模态感知多路径调度将不同模态请求路由到不同实例。\n\n**核心机制**: 模态级分解的关键在于**跨模态数据就绪管理**和**模态间资源隔离**。笔记证据显示 EEVEE 通过 GPU shared memory + CUDA IPC handler 实现低延迟模态间通信，EPD-Serve 通过 Global Instance Status Table 实现 least-loaded-first 的实例选择。\n\n**注解**: 笔记未明确说明 Video 模型的 spatial encoder + temporal encoder 独立调度分解的具体方法和实验数据——这是笔记覆盖的一个空白。\n\n---\n\n### 1.6 Mega-Kernel 化：跨粒度的终极融合\n\n**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/Mirage Persistent Kernel_ A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs.md` (score: 59.2)\n\nMirage Persistent Kernel (MPK) 代表了分解策略的反向极致——将分解后的细粒度 task 重新融合为单个 mega-kernel，以 **SM 级 tGraph** 替代 kernel 级 computation graph。\n\n**MPK tGraph 编译与执行模拟（Qwen3-8B decode, H100）**:\n\n```\n离线编译:\n  Step 1: Operator Decomposition\n    MatMul(X,W_Q): [B×H]×[H×H] → 132 tasks (每 SM 一个)\n    Attention: 动态 task 数 (JIT, 依赖 sequence length)\n  Step 2: tGraph 构建\n    每个 task 352 bytes metadata: dependent_event | trigger_event | I/O ptrs | config\n    每个 event: required_trigger_count | [first_task_id, last_task_id]\n    → 全部以连续数组存储于 GPU device memory\n  Step 3: Dependency Analysis (task-pair level, 非 operator level)\n    仅当 task t1 输出区域 ∩ task t2 输入区域 ≠ ∅ 时才插入 event\n\n在线执行 (单次 kernel launch):\n  SM 物理分区: 128 Workers + 4 Scheduler-SMs (16 warp-schedulers)\n  \n  T0: Start event → Scheduler 分发 Q/K/V projection tasks (AOT pre-assigned)\n  T1: Worker SM_i: Q_proj (TMA preload W_Q → Tensor Core MMA)\n      同时 TMA 预取 K_proj weight tile (cross-task pipelining, 消除 pipeline bubble)\n  T2: Q/K/V 完成 → Scheduler 分发 attention tasks (JIT, dynamic load balance)\n      快 worker 先完成先获得下游 O_proj tasks\n  T3: All attention done → barrier → MLP tasks (AOT)\n      Worker: Gate_proj GEMM + 同时 prefetch Up_proj weight → SiLU → Down_proj\n  T4: 跨全部层, TMA/Tensor Cores/CUDA Cores 三种硬件持续饱和\n\n性能: MPK 12.5ms vs SGLang/vLLM 14.5ms, 仅比理论下限 10ms 高 ~25%\n加速: end-to-end 1.0-1.7× (cross-task pipelining 1.2-1.3× + fine-grained overlap 1.1×)\n```\n\n**注解**:\n- **tGraph 的核心价值**: SM 级表示暴露了 kernel barrier 遮蔽的细粒度并行性。例如 MatMul→AllReduce：每个 AllReduce task 仅依赖一个对应 MatMul task 的输出——传统 kernel-per-operator 必须等整个 MatMul kernel 完成才能启动 AllReduce，MPK 通过 per-task-pair events 使 compute 和 communication 在不同 SM 上并发执行。\n- **Hybrid JIT+AOT**: Attention（data-dependent 执行时间）用 JIT launch 实现 dynamic load balance；MatMul（确定性执行时间）用 AOT pre-assigned 消除 dispatch overhead。这是对 MoE/DiT/多模态等多样化模型负载的关键适配机制。\n- **笔记未明确说明**: MPK 对 MoE Expert 动态路由、DiT 扩散步骤迭代、多模态多阶段等场景的具体支持程度和性能数据。\n\n---\n\n## 二、分解粒度选择的硬件依据\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture (AI Core _ AI Vector _ Da Vinci).md` (score: 24.0), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）.md` (score: 275.9)\n\n| 约束维度 | GPU (H100) | NPU (Ascend 910B) | TPU (v5e/v5p) |\n|----------|-----------|-------------------|---------------|\n| 计算单元数量 | 132 SMs, 每 SM 可并行 32+ warp | ~32 AI Core + ~32 AI Vector (笔记未精确) | 1-8 MXU/chip, 128×128 systolic array |\n| 片上存储/SM | 227KB shared memory + 256KB register file/SM | 256KB Unified Buffer (共享) | 16-48MB vector memory |\n| HBM 带宽 | 3.35 TB/s | 1.5-2.0 TB/s (笔记未精确) | ~2.76 TB/s (v5p) |\n| 并发执行模型 | CUDA streams + MPS 空间分区 | AI Core/Vector/Scalar 独立指令队列, 硬件并发 | XLA 编译期固定调度, 运行时不可调 |\n| 同步原语 | __syncthreads, mbarrier (TMA), CUDA event | Barrier instruction (笔记未详述) | Collective permute |\n| 关键瓶颈 | SM count + register pressure + kernel launch overhead | UB容量 + AI Core/Vector 通信带宽 | 编译期调度固定, 缺少运行时动态粒度调整 |\n\n**分解粒度选择的启发式规则**（从笔记证据推断）:\n\n1. **算子级分解上限**: 分解后的 micro-operator 计算量应大于调度 overhead。Shepherd Operator 的存在表明 elementwise op（数 μs 执行）的调度 overhead 已超过其计算收益——需合并。\n2. **层/模块级分解约束**: 分解出的独立模块应具有互补的硬件资源需求。GPU 上 Attention (compute-heavy) 和 Expert FFN (memory-heavy) 可通过 MPS SM 分区减少竞争；NPU 上 MatMul (AI Core) 和 AllReduce (AI Vector) 可通过异构单元并发实现空间复用。\n3. **Token/Patch 级分解上限**: 子批次数量受计算单元数量约束——每个 SM 至少需要一个完整的 GEMM tile (≥64×128) 才能有效利用 Tensor Core。子批次过多导致 occupancy 下降。\n4. **模态级分解约束**: 受显存限制——所有模态的权重需同时驻留。GPU H100 80GB 可同时容纳 LLaVA-1.5 的 ViT (~300M) + LLaMA-7B，但更大模型可能需要串行或 offloading。\n5. **Mega-kernel 化前提**: 编译时必须能静态分析全部 task 的依赖关系和资源需求（MPK 的 tGraph 依赖 Mirage superoptimizer 自动生成每个 task 的优化 CUDA 实现）——对于高度动态的 MoE routing 或扩散步骤可能需要 Hybrid JIT+AOT 混合策略。\n\n---\n\n## 三、实现（辅助说明）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling（协同编译与调度）.md` (score: 72.5)\n\n| 系统 | 分解策略 | 实现方式 | 适用模型 | 硬件平台 |\n|------|---------|---------|---------|---------|\n| Infera | 算子级 tile 分解 + shepherd 合并 | TVM 0.16.0 tile-tailored compiler (~17k LoC C++), zero-tuning | 通用 DNN | NVIDIA GPU |\n| Nimble | DAG→MEG→Bipartite Matching→CUDA stream | PyTorch TorchScript IR 分析 + AoT stream assignment | 通用 DL (CNN/Transformer) | NVIDIA GPU |\n| MixFusion | Patch级 + 算子级 (pixel-wise/context-dependent) | PyTorch custom ops (CSP, PES CUDA kernel) | DiT (SD3), U-Net (SDXL) | NVIDIA H100 |\n| vLLM Fused MoE | Token 组 + Expert 级融合 | Triton JIT kernel (`fused_moe.py`) | MoE (Mixtral, DeepSeek-V2) | NVIDIA H100 |\n| FlashMoE | Megakernel (全融合) | CUDA C++ (~6820 行), CUTLASS device-side, NVSHMEM | 分布式 MoE | NVIDIA GPU |\n| MegaScale-MoE | Tile 级通信-计算 barrier 融合 (4 类 fused kernel) | CUDA kernel + device memory barrier + GPU copy engine | MoE 训练/推理 | NVIDIA GPU |\n| EEVEE | 模块级 + 模态级 (SM MPS 分区) | Python (~5000 行), vLLM + NVIDIA MPS | LLaVA, BLIP-2, InternVL2.5 | NVIDIA A100, RTX 3090 |\n| EPD-Serve | 阶段级 (E/P/D 解耦) + 算子级硬件互补 | PyTorch/Ascend + Mooncake Store | 多模态 LLM | Ascend NPU (Atlas 800I A2) |\n| MPK | SM 级 tGraph→mega-kernel | torch.compile(backend=MPK) + Mirage superoptimizer | LLM (Qwen3 等) | NVIDIA H100, B200 |\n| MoE-Blaze | Atomic-free GPU parallel dispatch | CUDA kernel (3 步替代 multi-pass radix sort) | MoE | NVIDIA GPU |\n\n**注解**: 笔记显示大部分前沿系统未开源（FlashMoE、MegaScale-MoE、MPK、EEVEE 均未找到官方仓库），实验可复现性受限。vLLM Fused MoE 为开源实现，是当前最成熟的 MoE 推理分解参考实现。\n\n---\n\n## 四、实验环境（辅助说明）\n\n**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/MixFusion_ A Patch-Level Parallel Serving System for Mixed-Resolution Diffusion Models.md` (score: 192.9), `experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/Efficient Multimodal Serving via Module Multiplexing.md` (score: 24.0)\n\n| 系统 | 硬件 | Benchmark | 关键指标 |\n|------|------|-----------|---------|\n| MixFusion | H100 80GB | SDXL/SD3 多分辨率 (512/768/1024) | Sequential 17.8s→Batched 9.5s; PES ~optimal |\n| EEVEE | A100, RTX 3090 | CLIP, BLIP, BLIP-2, LLaVA-1.5, InternVL2.5-8B | Max capacity +157%, latency -90% vs Triton, SM active ~90% |\n| EPD-Serve | Atlas 800I A2 (Ascend 910B, 64GB) | VisualWebInstruct (256+256 mixed) | (E-P)-D 吞吐 +57-69%, SLO attainment 94.34% (E-P-D) |\n| Infera | NVIDIA GPU (笔记未给出型号) | Multi-model mixed serving | Cooperative speedup 1.6-3.5× vs operator-based |\n| MegaScale-MoE | NVIDIA GPU (笔记未给出型号) | 6 种 MoE 模型 | Fused vs non-fused 通信+计算 time 1.2-4.7×; 训练 iteration time -7.1-12.9% |\n| Fused MoE (vLLM) | 4×H100 | Mixtral-8x7B (MoE-Inference-Bench) | 吞吐 +15-20% (大 batch), 不同 seq length 保持 12-18% |\n| MPK | H100, B200 | Qwen3-8B/1.7B | E2E 1.0-1.7× vs SGLang/vLLM; 仅比理论下限高 ~25% |\n| Nimble | A100 40GB ×4 | NASNet-A, BERT, GPT-2 | Multi-stream up to 1.88× speedup |\n\n**注解**: 笔记中跨硬件平台（GPU vs NPU vs TPU）的分解效率对比实验数据缺失。各系统独立验证自身的硬件平台，缺乏统一 benchmark 下的 apple-to-apple 粒度对比（如 MixFusion patch 级 vs 纯算子级在 DiT 上的对比）。\n\n---\n\n## 五、方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | 分解粒度 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键并行机会 | 调度开销 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|---------|---------|---------|-------------|---------|---------|\n| Infera Tile-Based | 大 op→micro-op tile + 小 op→shepherd merge + multi-version kernel | 算子级 | TVM compiler + TEU runtime | GPU | Micro-op tile 间异步流水线 (overlap load/compute) | 中 (per-tile metadata) | knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记 (1309.2/1413.2) |\n| Nimble Stream Assign | MEG + Bipartite Matching 最大逻辑并发度 | 算子级 | PyTorch JIT trace + AoT | GPU | 15 个可并行算子 (NASNet-A) | 低 (AoT 离线) | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记 (29.3) |\n| MegaScale-MoE Intra-op | 4 类 tile 级通信-计算 barrier 融合 | 算子内 Tile 级 | CUDA kernel + device memory barrier | GPU (分布式) | Tile 到达即计算, 不等全量通信完成 | 中 (per-tile flag polling) | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记 (275.9) |\n| vLLM Fused MoE | Router→Dispatch→GEMM→Combine 单 kernel | Token组 + Expert级 | Triton JIT kernel | H100 | 8 experts FFN 在单 kernel 内并发 | 低 (1 launch) | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记 (400.9) |\n| FlashMoE Megakernel | 全部 MoE ops + 跨 GPU 通信融合为单 persistent kernel | Megakernel (全融合) | CUDA + CUTLASS + NVSHMEM | GPU (分布式) | Processor/Scheduler/Subscriber warp 角色分工 | 极低 (1 launch) | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记 (455.7) |\n| EEVEE Module Mux | 模态模块独立进程 + SM 分区 + Modal Cache | 模块级 + 模态级 | vLLM + NVIDIA MPS | A100/RTX3090 | Visual encoder ↔ Text decoder MPS 并发 | 低 (硬件分区) | knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记 (14.6) |\n| EPD-Serve Stage Disagg | E/P/D 三阶段解耦 + 物理共置 + AI Core/Vector 互补 | 阶段级 + 算子级 | PyTorch/Ascend + Mooncake | Ascend NPU 910B | AI Core (MatMul) ↔ AI Vector (AllReduce) 交替 | 中 (topology switch) | knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记 (21.7) |\n| MixFusion Patch Decomp | CSP uniform patch + Operator Taxonomy (pixel-wise/context-dependent) | Patch级 + 算子级 | PyTorch cust. ops + PES | H100 | Pixel-wise ops 全并行; per-resolution attn 分组并行 | 低 (patch batch) | knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记 (751.0) |\n| MPK tGraph Mega-Kernel | SM级 tGraph (task-pair 依赖) + cross-task pipelining + Hybrid JIT/AOT | SM 级 (超算子级) | torch.compile + Mirage superopt | H100/B200 | TMA/Tensor Core/CUDA Core 三种单元持续饱和 | 极低 (1 launch) | idea_notes (59.2) |\n| FinDEP | r₁(batch) × r₂(token) 两级 pipeline + ASAS/AASS 选择 | Token 级 | FlashInfer + NCCL | A6000/A10/H20 | AG attention 与 EG expert compute 流水线重叠 | 低 (solver <1ms) | paper_secs (2703.4) |\n\n---\n\n## 六、不确定性\n\n1. **TPU (v5e/v5p/v6e) 上的分解策略实验数据**: 笔记中所有主要实验（MixFusion, EEVEE, EPD-Serve, Fused MoE, MPK）均基于 GPU 或 NPU。TPU 上 MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 模型的算子级/模块级分解 benchmark 数据在笔记中完全缺失。XLA 编译器的自动分解策略在笔记中未详细描述。\n\n2. **Video 模型的时空分解**: 笔记未找到 Video 模型（VideoDiT, Sora-like, Video-LLaMA）的 spatial encoder + temporal encoder 独立调度分解的具体方法和实验数据。最接近的笔记是 MixFusion 的图像 patch 级分解和 OneVision-Encoder 的 HEVC codec-based patchification，但针对 Video generation 的帧间/帧内并行调度在 Serving 层的证据缺失。\n\n3. **NPU 片上 UB 容量约束的数值分析**: EPD-Serve 描述了 Ascend NPU 的算子级空间复用，但 Unified Buffer (256KB) 在共置场景下的 per-operator partition 大小和 spill 策略笔记未给出具体数值。\n\n4. **Groq LPU / Cerebras CS-3 的分解策略**: 笔记中未找到这两类 dataflow 架构加速器的分解策略证据——其分解粒度选择是否与传统 GPU/NPU 策略有本质差异，笔记未明确说明。\n\n5. **跨粒度组合的最优配置**: 笔记中各系统独立验证各自的分解策略，缺乏统一 benchmark 下不同粒度分解策略的对比（如 MixFusion patch 级 vs 纯算子级在 DiT 上的对比实验）。\n\n6. **前沿系统开源状态**: FlashMoE、MegaScale-MoE (ByteDance 内部)、MPK、EEVEE 的官方开源仓库在笔记中均未标注——实验可复现性受限。\n\n7. **Video 专用 benchmark**: 笔记未找到 Video-MME 或类似 Video 推理 benchmark 上与计算图分解相关的实验数据。\n\n---\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q2.3\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":656,"newStart":4,"newLines":484,"lines":[" "," | 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |"," |------|------|----------|","-| paper_secs/secs_2026/30-MixFusion.../1-Introduction.md | 8286.9 | Patch-level 并行分解：CSP 格式 + operator taxonomy 分类体系 |","-| paper_secs/secs_2026/79-Efficient Multimodal Serving.../1-Introduction.md | 5412.7 | Module Multiplexing：模块级分解 + SM 空间多路复用 |","-| paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Inference...FinDEP.md | 2703.4 | DEP + FinDEP: expert 微批次 token 级细粒度 pipeline 分解 |","-| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/EPD-Serve.../3-Method.md | 1289.4 | EPD 三阶段解耦 + operator-level 空间复用 (Ascend NPU) |","-| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Module Decomposition for MoE.md | 1134.4 | HAP: Attention/Expert 模块二元分解 + 独立并行策略 |","-| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion.md | 652.0 | MixFusion: Pixel-wise vs Context-dependent 算子分类 |","-| paper_secs/secs_moe/EPS-MoE.../2.3-Operator-level-Parallelism.md | 645.2 | EPS-MoE: 算子级并行需结合 MoE 特征避免重复 I/O |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md | 23.3 | EEVEE: module-level scheduling + stage-level parallelism 运转流程 |","-| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture.md | 24.0 | Ascend NPU AI Core/AI Vector 异构单元 operator-level 空间复用 |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mixed-Resolution Batching for Diffusion.md | 9.9 | MixFusion CSP 格式: GCD-based patch partition |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Flexible Stage Disaggregation.md | 21.7 | EPD-Serve: 逻辑隔离 + 物理共置的部署拓扑 |","-| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm.md | 29.3 | Nimble: MEG + Bipartite Matching 多 CUDA stream 分配 |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Colocation vs Disaggregation in A2A.md | 21.6 | Cornfigurator: Colocation vs Disaggregation tradeoff 决策 |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Parallelism.md | 22.9 | Expert Parallelism 全流程：dispatch→compute→combine |","-| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Roofline Model for MoE.md | 22.0 | HRM: operator-level arithmetic intensity → bottleneck 判定 |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Shepherd Operator.md | 1413.2 | Infera：小算子合并为 shepherd operator 的粒度控制，避免 per-op 调度 overhead 超过计算时间 |","+| knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md | 1309.2 | Infera：大 op→micro-op tile 分解 + multi-version kernel generation (zero-tuning) |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference.md | 751.0 | MixFusion：Pixel-wise vs Context-dependent 算子分类，DiT 无 Conv→100% accuracy patched inference |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md | 455.7 | FlashMoE：Gate→Dispatch→Expert FFN→Combine→跨GPU通信 融合为单 persistent kernel |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）.md | 400.9 | vLLM Fused MoE：Router→Dispatch→GEMM→Combine 单 kernel 融合 (15-20% 吞吐提升) |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）.md | 275.9 | MegaScale-MoE：四种 tile 级通信-计算 barrier 融合 (A2A+GEMM, GEMM+A2A, AG+Scatter+GroupedGEMM, GroupedGEMM+Gather+RS) |","+| idea_notes/Mirage Persistent Kernel_ A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs.md | 59.2 | MPK：SM级 tGraph 替代 kernel 级 DAG，mega-kernel 消除 kernel barrier (1.0-1.7× speedup) |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling（协同编译与调度）.md | 72.5 | Infera：离线多版本 kernel + 在线动态选择/fusion/launch 的协同编译-调度架构 |","+| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture (AI Core _ AI Vector _ Da Vinci).md | 24.0 | Ascend NPU：AI Core (16×16×16 MAC) + AI Vector (256-bit SIMD) + Scalar 三单元异构并发 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md | 14.6 | EEVEE：Visual encoder / Text decoder 独立 SM 分区 + Synergistic Greedy Search 策略生成 |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Flexible Stage Disaggregation with Physical Co-location.md | 21.7 | EPD-Serve：7 种 E/P/D 解耦拓扑 + AI Core/Vector 算子级互补复用 |","+| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm (Minimum Equivalent Graph + Bipartite Matching).md | 29.3 | Nimble：MEG 去除冗余传递边→Bipartite Matching→CUDA stream 分配 (max concurrency=15) |","+| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mixed-Resolution Batching for Diffusion Model Serving.md | 138.9 | MixFusion：GCD-based patch 统一化 (sequential 17.8s→batched 9.5s) |"," "," ---"," "," ## 一、方法细节（数据流/架构）—— 四种分解粒度与硬件映射"," ","-### 1.1 算子级分解 (Operator-Level Decomposition)","+### 1.1 分解粒度分类总览"," ","-#### 方法1: Nimble — 基于 DAG 的多 CUDA Stream 算子分配","+Serving 层对单请求推理计算图的分解可在四个粒度层次上进行，每个层次对应不同的并行机会和硬件利用模式："," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm (Minimum Equivalent Graph + Bipartite Matching).md` (score: 29.3)","-","-**框架运行模拟**：","-","+```mermaid","+flowchart TD","+    A[\"单请求推理计算图 DAG\"] --> B[\"算子级分解<br/>Operator-Level\"]","+    A --> C[\"层/模块级分解<br/>Layer/Module-Level\"]","+    A --> D[\"Token/Patch级分解<br/>Token/Patch-Level\"]","+    A --> E[\"模态级分解<br/>Modality-Level\"]","+    ","+    B --> B1[\"Micro-operator tiles<br/>Infera / Nimble / MegaScale-MoE\"]","+    C --> C1[\"Expert FFN / Attention Block<br/>Fused MoE / HAP / EEVEE / EPD-Serve\"]","+    D --> D1[\"Uniform Patches / Token Sub-batches<br/>MixFusion / FinDEP / MegaBlocks\"]","+    E --> E1[\"Vision/Text/Audio 独立子图<br/>EEVEE / EPD-Serve / Cornfigurator\"]","+    ","+    B1 --> HW1[\"GPU Warp/SM Tensor Core<br/>NPU AI Core/Vector<br/>TPU MXU/VPU\"]","+    C1 --> HW2[\"GPU SM Group (MPS)<br/>NPU AI Core Group\"]","+    D1 --> HW3[\"GPU SM Array (全并行)<br/>TPU MXU Array\"]","+    E1 --> HW4[\"Multi-NPU / Multi-GPU<br/>NCD / NVLink 互联\"]"," ```","-单请求推理计算图 DAG: G = (V, E)","-  V = {MatMul_Q, MatMul_K, MatMul_V, Attention, MatMul_O,","-       FFN_gate, FFN_up, SwiGLU, FFN_down, LayerNorm, RoPE}"," ","-Step 1: 构建 MEG (Minimum Equivalent Graph)","-  原始 DAG: MatMul_Q ─→ Attention ─→ MatMul_O ─→ LayerNorm ─→ FFN_gate","-            MatMul_K ─┘              ↑ MatMul_V ─┘","-            RoPE ─→ MatMul_Q, MatMul_K","-  去除冗余传递边: 如果 MatMul_Q→Attention→MatMul_O 且 MatMul_Q→MatMul_O 存在直接边，","-  则移除后者。MEG 暴露真正的直接依赖：","-    MatMul_Q, MatMul_K, MatMul_V → 可并行 (无直接依赖)","-    Attention → 等待所有 Q/K/V 就绪","-    FFN_gate, FFN_up → 可并行 (共享输入 h_attn)","+**注解**:","+- 四种粒度的关系是层次化的——实际上系统通常组合使用多层分解。例如 Infera 在编译期做算子级 tile 分解（大 op→micro op），运行时由 TEU 将 micro-kernel 在 warp 级水平融合为高效执行单元。MixFusion 同时使用 patch 级（CSP 格式）和算子级（pixel-wise vs context-dependent 分类）分解。","+- 粒度越细，潜在并发度越高，但调度开销（kernel launch、同步、metadata 管理）也越大。Shepherd Operator 的存在正是为了解决「小算子调度开销超过执行时间」的粒度下限问题。"," ","-Step 2: 构建二分图 + Max Matching","-  MEG 边集合: {e1=(Q,Attn), e2=(K,Attn), e3=(V,Attn)}","-  二分图节点: L_e1, L_e2, L_e3, R_e1, R_e2, R_e3","-  不相交边对 → 可并行组: {(Q,Attn), (K,Attn)} → Stream 0","-                          {(V,Attn)}            → Stream 1","+---"," ","-Step 3: Stream 分配与 CUDA Event 同步","-  Stream 0: [MatMul_Q] ──→ [MatMul_K] ──→ [wait_event] ──→ [Attention]","-  Stream 1: [MatMul_V] ──→ [record_event] ──→ [wait_event] ──→ [MatMul_O]","+### 1.2 算子级分解（Operator-Level Decomposition）"," ","-伪时间线 (GPU H100, 132 SM):","-  T0-T1:   SM[0:43]→MatMul_Q, SM[44:87]→MatMul_K, SM[88:131]→MatMul_V  (并行)","-  T2:      CUDA Event 同步点 (MatMul_Q/K/V → Attention 数据依赖栅栏)","-  T3-T4:   SM[0:131]→FlashAttention (全 SM 参与, compute-bound)","-  T5-T6:   SM[0:65]→FFN_gate, SM[66:131]→FFN_up (Stream 0/1 并行)","-```","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md` (score: 1309.2), `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Shepherd Operator.md` (score: 1413.2), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm (Minimum Equivalent Graph + Bipartite Matching).md` (score: 29.3)"," ","-**注解**：","-- **MEG 的作用**：去除传递冗余边，防止 max-flow 分析给出误导性的「并行度=1」结论。MEG 后真正的可并行算子被正确识别。","-- **CUDA Stream 并发粒度**：GPU 硬件支持 32 个并发 CUDA stream（H100），每个 stream 内的 kernel 串行执行，跨 stream kernel 可真正并发——前提是不共享同一 SM 子分区。","-- **SM 并发分配**：Nimble 将独立算子分配到不同 stream，GPU 硬件 warp scheduler 在各 SM 上以 warp 粒度交错执行不同 stream 的线程块。如果两个并行 kernel 均不能占满全部 SM，它们会在不同 SM 上同时执行（spatial sharing）；如果均需全部 SM，则 CUDA runtime 以 time-slicing 交替执行（temporal sharing）。","-- **数据依赖约束**：Attention 必须等 Q/K/V 全就绪。这是算子级分解的硬边界——有数据依赖的算子不可并行，只有无依赖或仅共享输入的算子才可并发。","+#### 方法1: Infera Tile-Based 分解 + 自适应粒度控制"," ","-#### 方法2: EPS-MoE — 基于 MoE GEMM 特征的算子级 Pipeline","+Infera compiler 将模型 forward pass 的每个 DNN operator 按 tile size 决策切分为 micro operator。关键创新在于**自适应粒度控制**——大型 operator（Conv2D、GEMM）切分为 tile 级 micro operator，每个 tile 独立编译为 micro-kernel；小型 operator（elementwise add、activation）合并为 **shepherd operator**，避免 per-operator 调度 overhead 超过计算时间。"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/EPS-MoE Expert Pipeline Scheduler for Cost-Efficient MoE Inference/2.3-Operator-level-Parallelism.md` (score: 645.2)","+**编译与执行框架模拟**:"," ","-**框架运行模拟**：","-"," ```","-MoE 层算子依赖图:","-  Router(gate) → TopK → token_expert_mapping","-  Attention → h_attn","-  GroupGemm(expert_FFN) ← h_attn[selected_tokens]  (多个 expert 可并行)","-  Combine → h_out","+Step 1: ONNX Model → TVM Relay Frontend → Computation Graph","+Step 2: Tile-Tailored Partition","+  ├── 大 operator: Conv2D → Conv_tile_0, Conv_tile_1, ...","+  │   └── 每个 tile 独立编译为 micro-kernel","+  └── 小 operator 组: Add + ReLU + BatchNorm → Shepherd_0","+      └── Shepherd kernel 内部按拓扑顺序调用子 kernel","+      └── 对外表现为单一调度单元（一个 micro operator）","+Step 3: Tile Size 决策 (Top-Down 静态分析)","+  ├── Register file level: 32-bit register/thread limit = 64/96/128","+  │   └── 平衡 ILP vs TLP: register 越多→ILP 越高, 但 concurrent warp 越少","+  ├── Shared memory level: usage/block limit = 48/80/112/144 KiB","+  │   └── spatial tile = thread_tile × thread_count","+  └── Global memory level: spatial tile = block_tile × grid_size(64)","+Step 4: Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation","+  ├── pipeline stage 2/3/4 + async copy + warp specialization","+  └── cut-and-patch SASS instruction scheduling (ILP 优化)","+Step 5: CUDA Binary Static Library (.a) → 注册到 Inference Server Model Pool"," ","-EPS-MoE 算子级 Pipeline 调度 (单 GPU, 假设 2 个 micro-batch):","-","-步骤 1: 分割输入为 micro-batch","-  batch_size B=8 → micro_batch_0[tokens 0-3], micro_batch_1[tokens 4-7]","-","-步骤 2: Pipeline 执行 (伪时间线)","-  T0-T1:   Router(mb_0) + Attention(mb_0)       [SM 0..65]","-  T1-T2:   Router(mb_1) + Attention(mb_1)       [SM 0..65]","-           GroupGemm(expert_FFN, mb_0)           [SM 66..131]  ← 与 mb_1 的 Attn 并行","-  T2-T3:   GroupGemm(expert_FFN, mb_1)           [SM 66..131]","-           Combine(mb_0)                         [SM 0..15]","-  T3-T4:   Combine(mb_1)                         [SM 0..15]","-","-步骤 3: GroupGemm 单 kernel 内并发","-  所有 selected experts 的 FFN 矩阵乘法合并为一次 GroupGemm kernel launch:","-    input_tokens [token_count, d_model]","-    expert_weights [E, d_model, d_intermediate] 分组存储","-    → 单 kernel 内通过 batch dimension 分割到不同 CTA (Cooperative Thread Array)","-    → 避免 per-expert kernel launch overhead","+在线推理 (TEU 三阶段):","+  Phase 1 - SelectKernels: DAG 中选 zero in-degree 且最大化 asynchronous wavefront","+                           的 data blocks → 在线回归模型选最优 kernel 版本","+  Phase 2 - FuseKernels: CUDA binary level warp-level horizontal fusion","+  Phase 3 - LaunchKernel: HKQ→GDRCopy→DKQ→daemon kernel CDP launch"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **算子级 Pipeline 的关键约束**：EPS-MoE 论文指出，如果算子级并行不考虑 MoE 的 GEMM 特征，会导致「参数重复内存 I/O」——因为 expert weight 需要在不同 micro-batch 间多次从 HBM 加载到 SMEM。","-- **GroupGemm 的优势**：单 kernel launch 处理所有 expert 的 FFN，消除 N×expert 次 kernel launch overhead（每次 launch ~5-10μs）。GPU command processor 仅需处理 1 个 launch command，减少 CPU-GPU 同步开销。","-- **SM 分区策略**：Router+Attention（compute-heavy, 需要大 SM 份额）与 Expert FFN（参数 I/O heavy, 受 HBM 带宽限制）分配到不同 SM 子集，减少资源竞争。","+**伪时间线（H100 单 GPU, Conv+ReLU+BN 融合, 4 mainloop + 4 copy warps）**:"," ","----","-","-### 1.2 层/模块级分解 (Layer/Module-Level Decomposition)","-","-#### 方法3: HAP — MoE 模型的 Attention/Expert 模块二元分解","-","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Module Decomposition for MoE Inference Parallel Strategy.md` (score: 1134.4)","-","-**框架运行模拟**：","-"," ```","-MoE Transformer Layer 的 Module Decomposition:","-","-  ┌─ Attention Module (AM) ──────────────────────────┐","-  │  参数量: ~d_model²×4 (Q/K/V/O) + KV cache       │","-  │  计算特征: FLOPs ∝ b×s×d_model²                 │","-  │  约束: prefill 和 decode 必须使用相同策略        │","-  │  可选策略: DP (无通信)、TP (局部计算+AllReduce)   │","-  │  硬件需求: SM Tensor Core (MMA 指令)              │","-  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-                         ↓ h_attn","-  ┌─ Expert Module (EM) ─────────────────────────────┐","-  │  参数量: ~3×d_model×d_intermediate × num_experts │","-  │  计算特征: FLOPs ∝ b×s×top_k×d_model×d_ff       │","-  │  约束: prefill/decode 可使用不同策略              │","-  │  可选策略: EP (All-to-All)、TP (AllReduce)        │","-  │  硬件需求: SM Tensor Core + HBM BW (expert load)  │","-  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","-","-步骤 1: HAP 在线搜索最优策略组合","-  Input: 模型配置 (d_model=4096, E=8, top_k=2), 硬件 (4×A100 80GB)","-  Strategy Space:","-    AM 可选: DP (4 replicas, 无通信), TP-4 (每 GPU 1/4 计算+AllReduce)","-    EM 可选: EP-4 (每 GPU 2 experts, All-to-All), TP-4 (每 GPU 1/4 expert 计算)","-","-  MILP Optimizer (延迟仿真模型):","-    AM 计算: T_attn(DP) = 1.2ms, T_attn(TP-4) = 0.4ms + AllReduce(0.1ms) = 0.5ms","-    EM 计算: T_expert(EP-4) = 2.1ms + All-to-All(0.3ms) = 2.4ms","-             T_expert(TP-4) = 0.8ms + AllReduce(0.05ms) = 0.85ms","-    总延迟: AM(DP)+EM(TP-4) = 1.2+0.85 = 2.05ms  ← 最优!","-            AM(TP-4)+EM(EP-4) = 0.5+2.4 = 2.9ms","-","-步骤 2: 运行时执行 (最优策略: AM=DP, EM=TP-4)","-  GPU 0:  [AM: Q/K/V/O (本地)] → All-to-All dispatch → [EM: 本地 expert shard (TP)] → AllReduce","-  GPU 1:  [AM: Q/K/V/O (本地)] → ...                  → [EM: 本地 expert shard (TP)] → AllReduce","-  ...","-  → AM 无跨 GPU 通信 (DP 复制)，EM 仅需 1 次 AllReduce (TP)","-","-步骤 3: 通信-计算重叠","-  All-to-All dispatch (tokens → expert devices):","-    chunk dispatch 为 2 个 micro-batch:","-      mb_0 dispatch (stream 0) → mb_0 expert compute (stream 0)","-      mb_1 dispatch (stream 1) → mb_1 expert compute (stream 1)","-    GPU SM 分配: SM 0..65 → expert compute, SM 66..131 → NCCL communication kernel","+T0-T1: TMA 异步加载 Conv_tile_0 input (global→shared)    [Copy Warp 0-3, 不占 SM]","+T1-T3: Conv_tile_0 compute (Tensor Core MMA)               [Mainloop Warp 0-3]","+T2-T4: TMA 预取 Conv_tile_1 input (与 tile_0 compute 重叠) [Copy Warp 0-3]","+T3-T5: Conv_tile_1 compute + tile_0 ReLU/BN in shepherd    [Mainloop Warp 0-3]","+T4-T6: TMA 预取 Conv_tile_2 input                         [Copy Warp 0-3]","+...","+→ 关键: copy warp 和 mainloop warp 在不同 warp scheduler slot 上并发执行"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **分解的核心洞察**：AM 的 KV cache 内存需求使其倾向于 DP（复制参数换取零通信），而 EM 的庞大参数量使其倾向于 EP/TP（分布式存储参数）。二元分解使两种模块可独立选择策略，避免「一刀切」策略的次优性。","-- **Preill/Decode 策略差异**：EM 在 prefill 和 decode 阶段可使用不同策略——prefill 计算量大适合 TP（减少单 GPU 计算），decode 计算量小但通信开销相对大，适合 EP（减少通信频率）。AM 必须一致（因 KV cache 绑定策略）。","-- **硬件映射**：延迟仿真模型基于 FLOPs 和带宽计算（计算误差 <10%，通信误差 <5%），建立计算量→GPU SM Tensor Core 利用率和通信量→NVLink/PCIe 带宽利用率的映射。","+**注解**:","+- **Shepherd Operator 的设计动机**: tile-based 调度有 overhead（kernel selection metadata、fusion cost、launch latency），对小 operator（单个 elementwise op 仅数 μs 执行时间）来说调度 overhead 可能超过执行时间。Shepherd operator 将小 operator 的调度从 per-micro-operator 降级为 per-shepherd-operator，保持调度粒度合理。","+- **Zero-tuning 特性**: 所有 tile size、register/shared memory 分配、pipeline 配置由静态约束直接计算，无需 GPU profiling 反馈。编译时间比 Ansor/MetaSchedule 低 2-3 个数量级，比 Roller（仍使用 performance model）节省 66-86% CPU 时间。","+- **协同编译-调度**: 编译器提供 multi-version kernels + metadata (#inst, resource usage)，调度器根据运行时 GPU 并发状态选择最优 kernel 版本——实现 Halide 的 algorithm/schedule 解耦思想在推理时调度层面的延伸。"," ","-#### 方法4: EEVEE — Module Multiplexing 多模态模块级并发","+#### 方法2: Nimble DAG→MEG→流分配"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md` (score: 23.3) 及 `paper_secs/secs_2026/79-Efficient Multimodal Serving via Module Multiplexing/1-Introduction.md` (score: 5412.7)","+Nimble 将 DAG 中算子分配到多个 CUDA stream 以实现最大逻辑并发度。核心算法分四步："," ","-**框架运行模拟**：","-"," ```","-多模态模型 (LLaVA-1.5) 的 Module Multiplexing 执行:","+输入: DAG G = (V, E) 其中 V = operators, E = data dependencies","+输出: stream_assignment: map<v ∈ V, stream_id>"," ","-┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-│                   NVIDIA H100 (132 SM)                    │","-│                                                          │","-│  ┌──────────────────────┐  ┌───────────────────────┐    │","-│  │ Visual Encoder (ViT) │  │  LLM Backbone (Llama) │    │","-│  │ SM 分配: 70% (92 SM) │  │  SM 分配: 30% (40 SM) │    │","-│  │ Batch Size: 2        │  │  Batch Size: 8         │    │","-│  │ (图像→visual tokens) │  │  (文本生成)            │    │","-│  └──────────────────────┘  └───────────────────────┘    │","-│           ↓ visual tokens                                 │","-│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │","-│  │  Text Decoder  SM 分配: 动态切换                   │    │","-│  │  Batch Size: 取决于当前请求中的文本长度            │    │","-│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │","-│                                                          │","-│  NVIDIA MPS (Multi-Process Service):                     │","-│    CUDA_MPS_ACTIVE_THREAD_PERCENTAGE=70 → Visual Encoder │","-│    CUDA_MPS_ACTIVE_THREAD_PERCENTAGE=30 → LLM Backbone   │","-└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","+Step 1: 构建 Minimum Equivalent Graph (MEG)","+  计算传递闭包，去除冗余传递边","+  例: A→B→C 且 A→C 存在 → A→C 是冗余边（可通过 A→B→C 推导）","+  MEG 暴露真正的直接依赖关系"," ","-步骤 1: Offline Profiling → Synergistic Greedy Search","-  输入: (LLaVA-1.5, SLO=2000ms, H100, VQA workload)","-  搜索空间: 模块 M ∈ {V, T, D}, 每模块 (batch, SM%)","-  Greedy 步进:","-    初始: monolith (V=1@100%, T=1@100%, D=1@100%) → 延迟 350ms","-    Step 1: V batch↑从 1→2, SM 70%, 延迟 ↑420ms","-    Step 2: T 独立 SM 30%, batch↑→8, 延迟 → 480ms","-    Step 3: SM rebalance: V 70%→60%, T 30%→40%, 延迟 → 440ms","-    Step 4: 收敛, 策略保存","+Step 2: 构建 Bipartite Graph","+  每条 MEG 边 → 二分图中的节点","+  若两条边 (u₁,v₁) 和 (u₂,v₂) 无共同节点且无依赖 → 二分图中连接"," ","-步骤 2: 在线 Module-Level Scheduling (伪时间线)","-  T0:     请求到达 (图像+问题)","-  T0-T1:  Visual Encoder (SM 0..91) 处理图像 → visual tokens [256, 4096]","-          → CUDA IPC shared memory → transfer to LLM process","-  T1-T2:  LLM Backbone (SM 92..131) Prefill:","-             text_embedding + visual_tokens → first_token","-  T2-T3:  LLM Backbone Decode: token-by-token generation","-          (新请求的 Visual Encoder 可与正在进行的 Decode 并发执行)","+Step 3: Maximum Matching (Ford-Fulkerson)","+  每个 matching → 一组可并行执行的边 → 分配到一个 CUDA stream"," ","-步骤 3: Stage-Level Parallelism","-  拆分每个模块为 preprocess 和 inference 两个阶段:","-    Visual Encoder preprocess (resize/normalize/H2D, ~40% 时间)","-      与 Text Decoder inference 重叠:","-        T0-T1: VE preprocess (CPU) || TD inference (GPU SM 92..131)","-        T1-T2: VE inference (GPU SM 0..91) || TD inference (GPU SM 92..131)","+Step 4: Stream Assignment + CUDA Event 插入","+  同 stream 内算子按拓扑序排列","+  跨 stream 仅在 MEG 边跨越 stream 边界时插入 CUDA event 同步"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **MPS SM Partition 约束**：CUDA MPS 的 SM allocation 必须在 CUDA 初始化前通过环境变量设定且运行时不可更改。因此 EEVEE 的策略是「部署时固定、按需切换」——当负载变化超过阈值时，通过 active-standby 机制（权重已驻留 GPU memory）在毫秒级切换到预计算的其他策略。","-- **模块间通信**：Visual Encoder 输出通过 GPU shared memory + CUDA IPC handler 传递给 LLM 进程，避免通过 CPU 中转的 PCIe 往返。单机内 shared memory 传输延迟远低于 PCIe（~10μs vs ~50μs）。","-- **Synergistic Greedy Search 复杂度**：O(|M|² · max_batch · 100)，远小于暴力枚举。论文在 CLIP/BLIP/BLIP-2/LLaVA-1.5/InternVL2.5-8B 上验证，相对 Triton monolithic serving 在 RTX 3090/A100 上提升 max capacity 平均 157%。","+**注解**:","+- **为什么需要 MEG**: 原始 DAG 的 max_flow 可能给出误导性结论。如图 3 示例：DAG 中 A→E 有两条路径（A→B→C→D→E 和 A→E 直连），max_flow(A→E)=1 暗示「并行度=1」。MEG 去除 A→E 冗余传递边后暴露真实并行度。","+- **理论保证**: 算法实现 maximum logical concurrency 且 minimum number of synchronizations。NASNet-A 实测 max concurrency=15，multi-stream 贡献 up to 1.88× speedup。","+- **GPU 硬件并发模型**: H100 支持 32 个并发 CUDA stream——每个 stream 内 kernel 串行，跨 stream kernel 可真正并发（前提是不共享同一 SM 子分区）。GPU warp scheduler 在各 SM 上以 warp 粒度交错执行不同 stream 的 thread block。"," ","-#### 方法5: EPD-Serve — 多模态推理的 Encode-Prefill-Decode 三阶段解耦","+#### 硬件映射：算子级分解在不同硬件上的执行效率"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/EPD-Serve.../3-Method.md` (score: 1289.4) 及 `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Flexible Stage Disaggregation with Physical Co-location.md` (score: 21.7)","+| 硬件平台 | 计算单元 | 算子级分解适配 | 关键约束 |","+|----------|---------|---------------|---------|","+| GPU (H100) | 132 SM, Tensor Core + CUDA Core + TMA | Micro-kernel warp specialization 在 SM 内并发; TMA 异步搬运与计算 overlap | per-micro-op kernel launch overhead; SM 内 register/shared memory 竞争 |","+| NPU (Ascend 910B) | AI Core (16×16×16 MAC) + AI Vector (256-bit SIMD) + Scalar | AI Core 执行 MatMul tile; AI Vector 并发执行 AllReduce/LayerNorm tile——算子级空间复用 | UB (256KB) 容量约束 tile 粒度下限; 三单元虽并发但共享 UB |","+| TPU (v5e/v5p) | MXU (128×128 systolic) + VPU (vector) | XLA 编译期自动分解为 MXU/VPU 操作序列 | 编译期固定调度, 运行时不可动态调整 |"," ","-**框架运行模拟**：","+---"," ","-```","-EPD-Serve: 多模态推理三阶段分解 (Ascend NPU Atlas 800I A2):","+### 1.3 层/模块级分解（Layer/Module-Level Decomposition）"," ","-逻辑层解耦:","-  ┌──────────┐    V_m (n×d)     ┌──────────┐   KV Cache    ┌──────────┐","-  │  Encode  │ ───────────────→ │  Prefill │ ────────────→ │  Decode  │","-  │  Stage   │                  │  Stage   │               │  Stage   │","-  │ E(I_m)   │                  │ P(V_m,V_t)│               │ D(O,KV)  │","-  └──────────┘                  └──────────┘               └──────────┘","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）.md` (score: 400.9), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Megakernel _ Fused Persistent Kernel for Distributed MoE.md` (score: 455.7), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md` (score: 14.6)"," ","-步骤 1: 模态感知多路径调度 (Modality-Aware Multi-Path)","-  API Server 接收请求:","-    Modal Detector 检查 inputs 是否含 image/audio/video","-      ├─ 多模态请求 → E-P-D Pipeline (完整三阶段)","-      │     Encode instance 选择: least-loaded-first","-      │        E0: queue=2, E1: queue=5 → 选 E0","-      │     Prefill instance: P0 (queue=1)","-      │     Decode instance: D1 (queue=2)","-      │","-      └─ 纯文本请求 → P-D Pipeline (绕过 Encode)","-            Prefill: P0 (queue=1)","-            Decode: D1 (queue=2)","+#### 方法3: MoE Expert 级分解（Fused MoE → Megakernel）"," ","-步骤 2: 物理共置 + Operator-Level 空间复用 (Ascend NPU)","-  部署拓扑 (E-P)-D: Encode+Prefill 共置 1 NPU, Decode 独立 1 NPU","+将 MoE 层的 Gate→Dispatch→Expert FFN→Combine 四个阶段作为独立并发计算单元。传统实现为 per-expert kernel launch（每个 expert 一次 GEMM launch），产生大量 kernel launch overhead。Fused MoE 将所有 expert 的 FFN 合并为单 kernel；FlashMoE Megakernel 更进一步将分布式场景的全部 MoE 算子（含跨 GPU 通信）融合为单个 persistent kernel。"," ","-  NPU 0 (共置 Encode + Prefill):","-    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-    │  AI Core (Cube Unit)    │  AI Vector (Vector)   │","-    │  MatMul (Encode ViT)    │  AllReduce (通信)     │","-    │  MatMul (Prefill LLM)   │  LayerNorm, GELU      │","-    │  256 MACs/cycle         │  256-bit SIMD         │","-    │                         │                       │","-    │  当 Encode 等待下一 batch 图像时,                │","-    │  Prefill 利用 AI Core 执行 Attention/FFN MatMul  │","-    │  当 Prefill 等 P-D 传输时,                       │","-    │  Encode 利用 AI Core 继续处理图像                 │","-    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","+**vLLM Fused MoE 执行模拟（Mixtral-8x7B, H100）**:"," ","-  NPU 1 (Decode):","-    独立执行 token-by-token decode, 接收 NPU 0 传来的 KV Cache","-","-步骤 3: E-P 异步传输 + P-D 分层 KV 传输","-  E→P 传输（事件驱动异步预取）：","-    Encode 完成 → 仅传输 feature hash（轻量级，~256B）","-    → Prefill 实例 receiver 根据 hash 从 MM Store 异步拉取 feature vector","-    → 若 MM Store miss → fallback 本地重算","-","-  P→D 传输（分层分组 KV 传输）：","-    Layer L 的 KV Cache 在 Layer L+1 计算时异步传输:","-      T0: Prefill 计算 Layer 0 (NPU 0)","-      T1: Prefill 计算 Layer 1 || KV(L0) 异步传输到 Decode (NPU 1)","-      T2: Prefill 计算 Layer 2 || KV(L1) 异步传输","-      ...","-    每 N 层 KV 打包为一个传输组 (grouped packaging)，减少握手开销"," ```","+Step 1: Router → Top-K","+  logits = Linear(x)                              // [total_tokens, 8]","+  topk_vals, topk_idx = topk(softmax(logits), k=2)"," ","-**注解**：","-- **三阶段解耦的硬件依据**：Encode（vision encoder ViT）为 compute-heavy + 大 activation memory；Prefill 为 compute-heavy + 产生大 KV Cache；Decode 为 memory-bound（token-by-token GEMV）。三个阶段的计算/内存特征完全不同，统一调度必然导致硬件利用率低。","-- **Ascend NPU 的算子互补特性**：Figure 6（EPD-Serve 论文）展示了 MatMul（AI Core 密集型，低数据搬运）与 AllReduce（AI Vector 密集型，高数据搬运）在共置 NPU 上的交替执行——当一个阶段等通信时，另一阶段利用空闲计算单元。","-- **部署拓扑灵活切换**：支持 E-P-D / EP-D / ED-P / E-PD / (E-P)-D / (E-D)-P 等 7+ 种拓扑。(E-P)-D 在 12 req/s 高并发下比 PD-disaggregated EP-D 提升吞吐 57.37-69.48%。","+Step 2: Token Sorting (moe_align_block_size)","+  sorted_tokens = sort_by_expert(topk_idx)","+  padding to BLOCK_SIZE 对齐 (BLOCK_M=64)","+  → Expert 0: tokens [t3, t7, t12, ...]","+  → Expert 1: tokens [t1, t5, t9, ...]  (可能空)"," ","----","+Step 3: Fused MoE Kernel (单次 launch, Grid = E × ceil(tokens/BLOCK_M))","+  For expert_id in 0..7:","+    For token_block in expert's tokens:","+      a_block = A[sorted_token_ids[block_start:...]]    // 间接寻址, 仅加载该 expert 的 token","+      w1 = B[expert_id]                                  // 仅加载一次 expert 权重","+      gate = silu(a_block @ w1_gate)                     // FC1 gate+up 融合","+      up   = a_block @ w1_up","+      hidden = gate * up","+      out = hidden @ w2                                  // FC2 down","+      out = out * topk_weights[block_start:...]          // routing weight 内联","+      atomic_add(C[sorted_token_ids], out)               // top-k experts 的加权和原子聚合"," ","-### 1.3 Token/Patch 级分解 (Token/Patch-Level Decomposition)","+对比传统: 6-8 次 kernel launch → 1-2 次","+吞吐提升: 15-20% (大 batch, H100)","+```"," ","-#### 方法6: MixFusion — Diffusion 模型的 Patch-Level 并行分解","+**FlashMoE Megakernel 执行模拟（分布式 MoE, 多 GPU）**:"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/30-MixFusion.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 8286.9), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference.md` (score: 652.0), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mixed-Resolution Batching for Diffusion Model Serving.md` (score: 9.9)","-","-**框架运行模拟**：","-"," ```","-MixFusion: Mixed-Resolution Patch-Level Parallel Denoising","+Grid: N blocks/GPU; Block 角色: blockId < N-1 → Processor, blockId == N-1 → OS Block"," ","-步骤 1: Operator Taxonomy — 算子分类","-  扩散模型 DiT/SDXL 每 denoising step 的算子分为两类:","-  ","-  (a) Pixel-wise operators (可完全并行):","-      Linear, FeedForward, Cross Attention, LayerNorm, GELU","-      → 仅依赖当前 patch 内部像素, 各 patch 独立 → batch 执行","-  ","-  (b) Context-dependent operators (需要跨 patch 上下文):","-      Self-Attention → 需要 all patches 交互 (Cartesian product)","-      Convolution → 需要相邻 patch 边界像素 (仅 U-Net/SDXL, DiT 无)","+OS Block (block N-1) 内:","+  Warp 0: Scheduler (work-conserving, 多线程调度)","+    └── 循环 sweep doorbells → WarpInclusiveSum → 分配 ready task → idle Processor","+  Warp 1-3: Subscriber","+    └── Poll remote flags → decode remote tile packet → enqueue task → doorbell Scheduler"," ","-步骤 2: CSP (Continuous Segment Packing) 格式","-  请求 1: 512×512 → GCD(512,768,1024)=256 → patch_size=256×256 → 4 patches","-  请求 2: 768×768 → ...                              → 9 patches","-  请求 3: 1024×1024 → ...                            → 16 patches","-  Total: 29 patches (all same shape [256, 256, C])","+Processor Block:","+  while(!interrupt):","+    switch(task.type):","+      case GEMM0: CUTLASS device-side fused GEMM + GELU → notify Scheduler","+      case GEMM1: CUTLASS device-side GEMM → NVSHMEM put to remote combine buffer"," ","-  CSP 元数据 (4 个 integer arrays, O(1) 查找):","-    RequestOffset[]  = [0, 4, 13]     # 每个请求的首 patch 全局索引","-    ResolutionOffset[] = [0, 4, 13]   # Self-Attention reconstruction 偏移","-    RequestStart[]  = ...              # 每个 patch 的所属请求起始","-    RequestEnd[]    = ...              # 每个 patch 的所属请求结束","-","-步骤 3: Batched Denoising 执行 (伪时间线, H100, 132 SM)","-  每个 denoising step (共 50 steps):","-","-  Step t 内:","-    T0-T1: Pixel-wise operators (所有 29 patches batch 执行)","-           Linear(patches_batch [29, 256, 256, C]) → SM[0..131] 全并行","-           CrossAttention(patches_batch)           → SM[0..131]","-    ","-    T2-T3: Self-Attention (按 resolution 分组 reconstruction)","-           Res 512:  patches[0:4]  → reconstruct [512,512,C] → Attention → split","-           Res 768:  patches[4:13] → reconstruct [768,768,C] → Attention → split","-           Res 1024: patches[13:29]→ reconstruct [1024,1024,C]→ Attention → split","-           3 个 resolution groups 在不同 SM 子集上并行执行:","-             SM[0..43]→Res 512, SM[44..87]→Res 768, SM[88..131]→Res 1024","-    ","-    T4:     Convolution (仅 SDXL): Patch Edge Stitcher CUDA kernel","-           FusedGroupNormWithStitching(patch, neighbor_boundaries)","-           boundary pixels 通过 TB 间通信获取 (shared memory 交换)","-","-步骤 4: 输出重组","-  所有 patches 完成 denoising → RequestOffset 逆映射 → VAE decode","+性能: 1 kernel launch vs Megatron-LM+DeepEP 的 432 次","+SM occupancy: tile=(128,64), block_size=128, registers=255/thread, max 2 blocks/SM, 0 spill"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **Patch Size 选择**：patch size = batch 内各 resolution 在 height/width 维的最大公约数。例如 batch 含 512/768/1024 → GCD=256。此策略使所有 patches shape 一致，实现 mixed-resolution batching（sequential=17.8s vs batched=9.5s on H100）。","-- **Operator Taxonomy 的设计空间**：DiT 仅含 Transformer blocks（无 Convolution），patched inference 自然 100% accuracy。SDXL 含 Convolution（kernel 1-3），需 Patch Edge Stitcher 处理跨 patch 边界——PES latency 接近理论 optimal（Figure 5）。","-- **硬件映射**：Pixel-wise operators 可利用 GPU 全部 SM 的大 batch 并行（FV × GEMM，Tensor Core 加速）。Self-Attention 的 per-resolution reconstruction 利用 FlashAttention 的 block-sparse 特性（xformers backend），不同 resolution 可分配到不同 SM 子集。","-- **限制**：patch 数随 resolution 多样性增加可能超过 GPU memory。论文 evaluation 使用 max batch size=12（H100 80GB）。","+**注解**:","+- **In-kernel Work-Conserving Scheduler**: FlashMoE 用 1 个 warp（32 threads）实现 GPU 内多线程任务调度器——doorbell 是 monotonic counter（非 binary flag），Scheduler warp 并行 sweep doorbells 实现 O(1) 的 task discovery。这消除了 CPU-GPU 同步的全部开销。","+- **Device-side BLAS**: CUTLASS device-side API 在 persistent kernel 内直接执行 GEMM——传统方式必须通过 CPU launch cuBLAS kernel。","+- **Megakernel 化趋势**: 笔记证据（MPK, FlashMoE, MegaScale-MoE）显示行业正从「分解后独立调度」向「分解后重新融合为 mega-kernel」演进——分解是手段，消除 kernel barrier 后的 mega-kernel 是目标执行形态。"," ","-#### 方法7: FinDEP — MoE 微批次 Token 级 Pipeline 分解","+#### 方法4: EEVEE Module Multiplexing（多模态模型模块级分解）"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Inference...FinDEP.md` (score: 2703.4)","+将多模态模型的 modality-specific modules 拆分为独立进程，各自拥有独立 batch size 和 SM allocation。"," ","-**框架运行模拟**：","+**EEVEE 执行框架模拟（LLaVA-1.5, A100 80GB）**:"," "," ```","-FinDEP: Fine-grained Disaggregated Expert Pipeline","+GPU A100 (108 SMs)","+├── Visual Encoder Process (CLIP ViT-L/14)","+│   ├── SM allocation: 70% (≈75 SMs), 通过 CUDA_MPS_ACTIVE_THREAD_PERCENTAGE 设定","+│   ├── Batch size: B_vis=2 (图像预处理 batch)","+│   └── 执行: image resize→normalize→H2D→ViT forward→visual tokens [577, 1024]","+│","+├── Text Decoder Process (LLaMA-7B)","+│   ├── SM allocation: 30% (≈33 SMs)","+│   ├── Batch size: B_txt=8 (文本生成 batch)","+│   └── 执行: text embedding→[visual tokens; text tokens]→LLM decode","+│","+└── Inter-Module Communication: GPU shared memory + CUDA IPC handler","+    └── Visual tokens → Text Decoder 消费 (延迟远低于 PCIe 的 ~50μs)"," ","-系统架构:","-  AG (Attention Group): 处理 Attention + Shared Expert, ag 个 GPU","-  EG (Expert Group): 处理 Routed Expert FFN, eg 个 GPU","+Offline Synergistic Greedy Search 策略生成:","+  Step 1: 从 monolithic 顺序执行初始化策略","+  Step 2: 逐步增加各模块 batch size","+    └── 每次将增量放在对 batch latency 负面影响最小的 stage","+  Step 3: Balanced SM Reallocation","+    └── 从最短 latency 模块转移 SM→最长 latency 模块, 直至 stage 内各模块 latency 趋近平衡","+  约束: per-stage SM 总和=100%, 各模块 B = egress module B 的整数倍, E2E latency≤SLO","+  复杂度: O(|M|² · max_batch · 100)"," ","-步骤 1: 两级 Pipeline 分解","-  r₁: Attention/Shared Expert pipeline degree (沿 batch 维度分割 micro-batch)","-  r₂: Expert pipeline degree (沿 token 维度进一步分割)","+Stage-Level Parallelism:","+  Visual Encoder preprocess (resize/normalize/H2D, 可达 inference 时间 40%)","+    ↔ Text Decoder inference 重叠执行","+  → 利用 pipeline 并行度避免 GPU 等待 CPU 完成预处理"," ","-  配置示例: ag=2, eg=6, r₁=2, r₂=3, B=8, S=4096","+Modal Cache:","+  同一图像对应多个问题时 (VQA2: ≥3 问题/图), 后续问题直接加载缓存的 visual tokens","+  Cache loading 通过 CUDA streams 与新请求 computation kernel 重叠","+```"," ","-  m_a = B / (r₁ × ag) = 8 / (2×2) = 2 tokens per attention micro-batch","-  m_e = m_a × ag × top_k × S / (r₂ × E) = ... tokens per expert micro-batch","+**注解**:","+- **MPS SM Partition 的硬约束**: CUDA MPS 的 SM allocation 必须在 CUDA 初始化前通过环境变量设定且运行时不可更改。因此 EEVEE 的策略是「部署时固定、按需切换」——当负载变化超过阈值时通过 active-standby 机制（权重已驻留 GPU）在毫秒级切换到预计算策略。","+- **实验效果**: RTX 3090/A100 上 max capacity 平均 +157%, 高负载 LLaVA latency 平均 -90% vs Triton monolithic serving, GPU active SM ≈90%。"," ","-步骤 2: ASAS vs AASS 调度策略选择","+#### 方法5: EPD-Serve Encode/Prefill/Decode 三阶段解耦"," ","-  ASAS (Attention-Shared-Alternating-Sequential) 时间线:","-    AG GPU 0:","-      T0-T1: Attn(mb_0)  [SM 0..65]","-      T1-T2: Shared(mb_0) [SM 0..65]  || A2E(mb_0) to EG","-      T2-T3: Attn(mb_1)  [SM 0..65]  || Expert(mb_0_j0) on EG","-      T3-T4: Shared(mb_1) [SM 0..65]  || Expert(mb_0_j1) on EG","-      ...","-    EG GPU k:","-      T1-T3: Expert(mb_0_j0, mb_0_j1, mb_0_j2) [SM 0..131, r₂=3 token groups]","-      T3-T5: Expert(mb_1_j0, mb_1_j1, mb_1_j2) [SM 0..131]","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Flexible Stage Disaggregation with Physical Co-location.md` (score: 21.7), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture (AI Core _ AI Vector _ Da Vinci).md` (score: 24.0)"," ","-  AASS (Attention-All, Shared-All) 时间线:","-    AG GPU 0:","-      T0-T1: Attn(mb_0)  [SM 0..65]","-      T1-T2: Attn(mb_1)  [SM 0..65]","-      T2-T3: Shared(mb_0) [SM 0..65]  || A2E(mb_0) → EG","-      T3-T4: Shared(mb_1) [SM 0..65]  || A2E(mb_1) → EG","-    AASS 优势: A2E 通信更早开始 → EG 更早开始计算","-    ASAS 优势: Shared Expert 填充 Attn 等 A2E 就绪的间隙 → AG 利用率更高","+**EPD-Serve 部署拓扑切换模拟**:"," ","-步骤 3: FinDEP 配置搜索 (Algorithm 1)","-  Pareto Frontier 遍历:","-    for m_a = ∞ downto 1:  (GPU memory 约束)","-        r₁ = getMaxR1(m_a, memory_limit)","-        for order in {ASAS, AASS}:","-            solve convex optimization for r₂","-            m_e = m_a × ag × top_k × S / (r₂ × E)","-        keep best throughput config","+```","+7 种部署拓扑:","+  E-P-D:    Encode | Prefill | Decode  (3 NPU 全解耦, SLO attainment 94.34%)","+  EP-D:     Encode+Prefill | Decode   (2 NPU)","+  ED-P:     Encode+Decode | Prefill   (2 NPU, 推荐最低 TTFT)","+  E-PD:     Encode | Prefill+Decode   (2 NPU)","+  (E-P)-D:  Encode+Prefill 共置 | Decode (2 NPU, 推荐最高吞吐: +57-69% vs EP-D)","+  (E-D)-P:  Encode+Decode 共置 | Prefill (2 NPU, TTFT 降低 39-55%)","+  (E-PD):   全部共置 (1 NPU, 最大化吞吐 +13-15% vs monolithic)"," ","-步骤 4: 在线自适应 Pipeline","-  请求到达时:","-    1. 获取输入 shape (B, S)","-    2. 运行轻量 Algorithm 1 (求解器 <1ms, 因仅优化单变量 r₂)","-    3. 选择最优 (m_a, r₁, m_e, r₂, order) 配置","-    4. 按配置执行 FinDEP pipeline","+物理共置关键机制 (Ascend NPU):","+  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","+  │  AI Core (Cube Unit)    │  AI Vector (Vector)   │","+  │  MatMul (Encode ViT)    │  AllReduce (通信)     │","+  │  MatMul (Prefill LLM)   │  LayerNorm, GELU      │","+  │  256 MACs/cycle         │  256-bit SIMD         │","+  │                         │                       │","+  │  算子互补: 当 MatMul 执行时, AllReduce 可同时用 AI Vector  │","+  │  当 Prefill 等待 P-D 传输时, Encode 利用空闲 AI Core 继续  │","+  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **两级 Pipeline 的硬件依据**：AG 中 Attention 计算其矩阵维度涉及 sequence length（O(S²)），EG 中 Expert FFN 是 token-by-token（无 sequence 交互）。因此 Expert 可沿 token 维进一步分割（r₂），而 Attention 的 token 间交互限制了其只能沿 batch 维分割（r₁）。","-- **通讯-计算重叠**：A2E（Attention→Expert）通信与 Shared Expert 计算可并行——因为两者无数据依赖。类似地，E2A（Expert→Attention）通信可与下一 micro-batch 的 Attention 计算重叠。","-- **定理保证**：FinDEP 证明了 Objective(throughput) 关于 m_a 单调递增（Theorem 1），关于 r₁ 单调非减（Theorem 3），关于 1/r₂ 为凸函数（Theorem 4），从而将搜索复杂度从指数级降至 O(√M)（M 为 GPU 最大 micro-batch size）。","-- **实验效果**：在 A6000/A10/H20 等 4 种 testbed 上验证，线性模型拟合 R²=0.997（计算）、R²=0.994-0.999（通信）。","+**注解**:","+- **三阶段解耦的硬件依据**: Encode (ViT) 为 compute-heavy + 大 activation; Prefill 为 compute-heavy + 产生大 KV Cache; Decode 为 memory-bound (token-by-token GEMV)。三个阶段的计算/内存特征完全不同，统一调度必然导致硬件利用率低。","+- **物理共置的关键洞察**: 不同算子的硬件资源需求互补——MatMul 是 AI Core compute-heavy（低数据搬运）、AllReduce 是 AI Vector communication-heavy（高数据搬运），在同一 NPU 上交替执行减少 idle 周期。该策略的本质是**利用硬件异构计算单元的独立性**实现细粒度空间复用。"," "," ---"," ","-### 1.4 模态级分解 (Modality-Level Decomposition)","+### 1.4 Token/Patch 级分解（Token/Patch-Level Decomposition）"," ","-#### 方法8: EPD-Serve 模态感知多路径 + Cornfigurator 图级分解","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference.md` (score: 751.0), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mixed-Resolution Batching for Diffusion Model Serving.md` (score: 138.9)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling.md` (score: 470.2), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Colocation vs Disaggregation in A2A Model Serving.md` (score: 21.6)","+#### 方法6: MixFusion Patch-Level 并行分解 (DiT/扩散模型)"," ","-**框架运行模拟**：","+将不同分辨率的扩散模型输入图像 partition 为 uniform size patches，通过 CSP 格式和 Operator Taxonomy 分类实现混合分辨率批处理。"," ","+**MixFusion 执行模拟（SDXL, H100, 3 请求 512²/768²/1024²）**:","+"," ```","-A2A (Any-to-Any) 多模态模型图级分解:","+Step 1: Patch Partition","+  patch_size = GCD(512, 768, 1024) = 256","+  Req_512: 4 patches (2×2); Req_768: 9 patches (3×3); Req_1024: 16 patches (4×4)","+  Total: 29 uniform patches [256, 256, C]"," ","-Cornfigurator Model Graph:","-  ┌──────────┐      ┌───────────┐      ┌──────────┐","-  │ Audio    │      │ Image Enc │      │ Video Enc│","-  │ Encoder  │      │  (ViT)    │      │ (3D ViT) │","-  └────┬─────┘      └─────┬─────┘      └────┬─────┘","-       │ colocatable       │ colocatable      │ colocatable","-       │ edge              │ edge             │ edge","-       ▼                   ▼                  ▼","-  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-  │              LLM Backbone (Thinker)             │","-  └────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┘","-                       │ colocatable edge","-                       ▼","-  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐","-  │         Text Decoder / Audio Generator          │","-  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘","+Step 2: CSP Format 构建 (4 个 integer arrays, O(1) 查找)","+  RequestOffset = [0, 4, 13]; ResolutionOffset = [0, 4, 13]","+  patch→request 逆向查找表"," ","-Colocatable Edge 决策: KEEP (disaggregation) 或 MERGE (colocation)","+Step 3: Per-Block Denoising (每个 denoising step 的每个 block)","+  For op in block.operators:","+    if op is Pixel-wise (Linear/FFN/CrossAttn):        // >70% 计算量","+      output = batched_op(all_29_patches)              // 统一 batch=29, 标准 PyTorch","+      → GPU SM[0..131] 全并行"," ","-步骤 1: 图搜索 — 最优 Colocation Plan","-  Cornfigurator 搜索 (Qwen 3 Omni, 16 GPU, 1/3 audio 请求):","-    最优 plan:","-      1 × Audio Encoder (disaggregated, 独立 GPU)","-      4 × (Image Enc + Video Enc + LLM Thinker) (colocated, 共享 GPU)","-      11 × (LLM Talker + Audio Generator) (colocated, audio output pipeline)","-    ","-    理由:","-      - Audio Encoder 低吞吐 → disaggregated 独立扩展","-      - Image/Video encoders 共享 LLM 资源 → colocated 减少 NCD 传输","-      - Talker + Vocoder 天然耦合 → colocated","+    elif op is Self-Attention:                          // ~20% 计算量","+      For each resolution_group in [512, 768, 1024]:","+        full_feature = reconstruct_from_patches(patches_of_res)","+        output = FlashAttention(full_feature)           // per-resolution batched attn","+      → SM[0..43]→Res 512, SM[44..87]→Res 768, SM[88..131]→Res 1024 (并行)"," ","-步骤 2: 模态级分解的执行模式","-  请求含 image:","-    Image Encoder (GPU 0..3, 其中 1 个) → visual tokens","-    → LLM Thinker (与 Encoder 共享 GPU) → hidden states","-    → Text Decoder → text output","+    elif op is Convolution (仅 U-Net, DiT 无):          // ~10% 计算量","+      For each patch:","+        output = FusedGroupNormWithStitching(patch, neighbor_boundaries)","+      → boundary pixels 通过 TB 间 shared memory 交换 (Patch Edge Stitcher)"," ","-  请求含 audio:","-    Audio Encoder (GPU 15) → audio tokens","-    → NCCL 跨节点传输到 LLM Thinker (GPU 0..3)","-    → LLM Talker + Vocoder (GPU 4..14) → audio waveform","-","-步骤 3: 模态间资源隔离","-  EPD-Serve Modality-Aware Multi-Path:","-    多模态请求 → Encode-Prefill-Decode 三阶段","-    纯文本请求 → Prefill-Decode 两阶段 (绕过 Encode, 不受图像编码阻塞)","-    ","-    Global Instance Status Table 实时追踪:","-      Encode instances: [E0: queue=2, GPU 70%], [E1: queue=5, GPU 85%]","-      Prefill instances: [P0: queue=1, GPU 30%], [P1: queue=3, GPU 45%]","-      Decode instances: [D0: queue=4, GPU 60%], [D1: queue=2, GPU 40%]","-    → Least-loaded-first: 新请求分配给当前负载最低的实例","+性能: sequential 17.8s → batched 9.5s (3 分辨率)","+DiT 优势: 无 Convolution → patched inference 自然 100% accuracy","+U-Net 约束: Convolution kernel size 1-3 → Patch Edge Stitcher 处理跨 patch 边界"," ```"," ","-**注解**：","-- **Colocation vs Disaggregation Tradeoff**：Colocation 减少跨节点数据传输延迟（~10ms NCD latency），但无法独立扩展——slowest component bottlenecks all。Disaggregation 允许 per-component 独立扩展，但引入 GPU 碎片和传输开销。Cornfigurator 不预设策略，将所有选择视为搜索空间中的点并系统化评估。","-- **模态级分解的适用边界**：并非所有模态组合都受益于分解。Qwen-Image（2-component）中 monolithic 最优（LLM prefill 轻量，encoder GPU 会浪费）；InternVL 3 中当 image input 概率从 25%→75%，planner 自动从 monolithic→encoder-disaggregated 过渡。","+**注解**:","+- **Operator Taxonomy 分类体系**: Pixel-wise operators（仅依赖当前 patch/pixel 内部信息）可直接在各 patch 上独立并行；Context-dependent operators（Self-Attention 需要 all patches 交互、Convolution 需要相邻 patch 边界像素）需要特殊处理。","+- **Patch Size 选择**: patch_size 必须 = batch 内各 resolution 在 height/width 维的 GCD。限制是当分辨率差异极大时 patch 数可能超过 GPU memory。","+- **PES 质量**: Patch Edge Stitcher latency 接近理论 optimal（Figure 5），生成质量 PSNR 与 unpatched 无显著差异。"," "," ---"," ","-## 二、分解粒度选择依据 —— 硬件架构约束分析","+### 1.5 模态级分解（Modality-Level Decomposition）"," ","-### 2.1 GPU (SIMT + Tensor Core) 上的分解粒度选择","+多模态模型的视觉流、文本流、音频流编码子图天然具有模态级独立性。EEVEE 将各模态编码器作为独立进程通过 CUDA MPS 空间多路复用；EPD-Serve 通过模态感知多路径调度将不同模态请求路由到不同实例。"," ","-```","-硬件约束维度:","+**核心机制**: 模态级分解的关键在于**跨模态数据就绪管理**和**模态间资源隔离**。笔记证据显示 EEVEE 通过 GPU shared memory + CUDA IPC handler 实现低延迟模态间通信，EPD-Serve 通过 Global Instance Status Table 实现 least-loaded-first 的实例选择。"," ","-1. SM 数量 (H100: 132 SM, A100: 108 SM):","-   - 算子级分解: 独立算子可分配不同 SM 子集 → SM 数量是并发算子数的硬上限","-   - 每个 SM 可并发执行多个 thread block (max 32 blocks/SM on H100)","-   - 若分解后的并发算子数 > 132, 需 time-slicing (串行化开销)","+**注解**: 笔记未明确说明 Video 模型的 spatial encoder + temporal encoder 独立调度分解的具体方法和实验数据——这是笔记覆盖的一个空白。"," ","-2. Tensor Core 利用率:","-   - GEMM 算子达到 Tensor Core peak 需要最小 tile size (128×128 或更大)","-   - 过度分解 (如将 Attention 的 Q/K/V 进一步拆小) → tile < MMA 指令最小维度 → Tensor Core 利用率暴跌","-   - 笔记显示: operator-level 的 arithmetic intensity (ARI) 是选择 AU 的关键","-     (knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/AU Arithmetic Intensity for AU Selection.md)","+---"," ","-3. Shared Memory / L1 Cache (H100: 228 KB/SM):","-   - 每个并发算子的 SMEM 需求之和 ≤ 228 KB/SM","-   - 若分解后算子太多，每算子 SMEM tile 过小 → HBM 访问次数增加","+### 1.6 Mega-Kernel 化：跨粒度的终极融合"," ","-4. Register File (H100: 65536 registers/SM):","-   - 每个 thread block 的 register 需求决定 occupancy","-   - 并发算子数多 → 每算子 thread block 数少 → occupancy 降低","-   - 笔记: Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation 为不同 register 配置 (64/96/128)","-     生成多个 kernel 版本，在线根据并发状态选择","-     (knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md)","+**笔记证据**: `idea_notes/Mirage Persistent Kernel_ A Compiler and Runtime for Mega-Kernelizing Tensor Programs.md` (score: 59.2)"," ","-5. HBM 带宽 (H100: 3.35 TB/s):","-   - 多个并发算子竞争 HBM 带宽 → aggregate bandwidth 不变 (共享总线)","-   - 笔记: HRM 指出, 当 I_x (operational intensity) 低于 P_1 critical intensity,","-     不值得从 CPU 传输到 GPU 计算","-     (knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Roofline Model for MoE.md)","-```","+Mirage Persistent Kernel (MPK) 代表了分解策略的反向极致——将分解后的细粒度 task 重新融合为单个 mega-kernel，以 **SM 级 tGraph** 替代 kernel 级 computation graph。"," ","-### 2.2 NPU (Ascend 脉动阵列 + 标量/向量单元) 上的分解粒度选择","+**MPK tGraph 编译与执行模拟（Qwen3-8B decode, H100）**:"," "," ```","-笔记证据: knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture.md (score: 24.0)","+离线编译:","+  Step 1: Operator Decomposition","+    MatMul(X,W_Q): [B×H]×[H×H] → 132 tasks (每 SM 一个)","+    Attention: 动态 task 数 (JIT, 依赖 sequence length)","+  Step 2: tGraph 构建","+    每个 task 352 bytes metadata: dependent_event | trigger_event | I/O ptrs | config","+    每个 event: required_trigger_count | [first_task_id, last_task_id]","+    → 全部以连续数组存储于 GPU device memory","+  Step 3: Dependency Analysis (task-pair level, 非 operator level)","+    仅当 task t1 输出区域 ∩ task t2 输入区域 ≠ ∅ 时才插入 event"," ","-硬件约束维度:","+在线执行 (单次 kernel launch):","+  SM 物理分区: 128 Workers + 4 Scheduler-SMs (16 warp-schedulers)","+  ","+  T0: Start event → Scheduler 分发 Q/K/V projection tasks (AOT pre-assigned)","+  T1: Worker SM_i: Q_proj (TMA preload W_Q → Tensor Core MMA)","+      同时 TMA 预取 K_proj weight tile (cross-task pipelining, 消除 pipeline bubble)","+  T2: Q/K/V 完成 → Scheduler 分发 attention tasks (JIT, dynamic load balance)","+      快 worker 先完成先获得下游 O_proj tasks","+  T3: All attention done → barrier → MLP tasks (AOT)","+      Worker: Gate_proj GEMM + 同时 prefetch Up_proj weight → SiLU → Down_proj","+  T4: 跨全部层, TMA/Tensor Cores/CUDA Cores 三种硬件持续饱和"," ","-1. AI Core (Cube Unit) vs AI Vector vs Scalar Unit 异构:","-   - 算子可按计算特征分配到不同硬件单元:","-     MatMul/Conv → AI Core (256 MACs/cycle, 16×16×16 阵列)","-     AllReduce/Element-wise → AI Vector (256-bit SIMD)","-     标量控制流 → Scalar Unit","-   - 三者独立指令队列, 支持真正并发执行","-   - EPD-Serve 利用此特性实现 operator-level 空间复用:","-     Encode MatMul (AI Core) + Prefill AllReduce (AI Vector) 同时执行","+性能: MPK 12.5ms vs SGLang/vLLM 14.5ms, 仅比理论下限 10ms 高 ~25%","+加速: end-to-end 1.0-1.7× (cross-task pipelining 1.2-1.3× + fine-grained overlap 1.1×)","+```"," ","-2. Unified Buffer (UB, 256KB):","-   - UB 是 AI Core 和 AI Vector 共享的片上 buffer","-   - 多个并发算子需划分 UB → 每算子 UB 分配降低 → 可能需要更多 DMA 往返 HBM","-   - 笔记: 算子互补特性 (Figure 6) — MatMul 低数据搬运 + AllReduce 高数据搬运,","-     两者对 UB 的需求模式不同, 可有效共享","+**注解**:","+- **tGraph 的核心价值**: SM 级表示暴露了 kernel barrier 遮蔽的细粒度并行性。例如 MatMul→AllReduce：每个 AllReduce task 仅依赖一个对应 MatMul task 的输出——传统 kernel-per-operator 必须等整个 MatMul kernel 完成才能启动 AllReduce，MPK 通过 per-task-pair events 使 compute 和 communication 在不同 SM 上并发执行。","+- **Hybrid JIT+AOT**: Attention（data-dependent 执行时间）用 JIT launch 实现 dynamic load balance；MatMul（确定性执行时间）用 AOT pre-assigned 消除 dispatch overhead。这是对 MoE/DiT/多模态等多样化模型负载的关键适配机制。","+- **笔记未明确说明**: MPK 对 MoE Expert 动态路由、DiT 扩散步骤迭代、多模态多阶段等场景的具体支持程度和性能数据。"," ","-3. 硬件 Command Queue:","-   - Ascend NPU 的 task descriptor queue 是硬件调度的核心","-   - 算子级分解的 task descriptor 链构建影响调度延迟","-   - 笔记未明确说明 queue depth 具体数值","+---"," ","-4. Da Vinci 架构的三级流水:","-   - Scalar → Vector → Cube 三级并行流水","-   - 合理的算子分解应将不同特征算子分配到不同流水级","-```","+## 二、分解粒度选择的硬件依据"," ","-### 2.3 TPU (MXU + VPU) 上的分解粒度选择","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture (AI Core _ AI Vector _ Da Vinci).md` (score: 24.0), `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Intra-operator Communication-Computation Overlap via Tile-Level Fused Kernels（瓦片级通信-计算融合内核的算子内重叠）.md` (score: 275.9)"," ","-```","-笔记来源: 可推断 + 笔记未明确说明具体 TPU 分解数据","+| 约束维度 | GPU (H100) | NPU (Ascend 910B) | TPU (v5e/v5p) |","+|----------|-----------|-------------------|---------------|","+| 计算单元数量 | 132 SMs, 每 SM 可并行 32+ warp | ~32 AI Core + ~32 AI Vector (笔记未精确) | 1-8 MXU/chip, 128×128 systolic array |","+| 片上存储/SM | 227KB shared memory + 256KB register file/SM | 256KB Unified Buffer (共享) | 16-48MB vector memory |","+| HBM 带宽 | 3.35 TB/s | 1.5-2.0 TB/s (笔记未精确) | ~2.76 TB/s (v5p) |","+| 并发执行模型 | CUDA streams + MPS 空间分区 | AI Core/Vector/Scalar 独立指令队列, 硬件并发 | XLA 编译期固定调度, 运行时不可调 |","+| 同步原语 | __syncthreads, mbarrier (TMA), CUDA event | Barrier instruction (笔记未详述) | Collective permute |","+| 关键瓶颈 | SM count + register pressure + kernel launch overhead | UB容量 + AI Core/Vector 通信带宽 | 编译期调度固定, 缺少运行时动态粒度调整 |"," ","-硬件约束维度:","+**分解粒度选择的启发式规则**（从笔记证据推断）:"," ","-1. MXU (Matrix Multiply Unit, 128×128 systolic array per core):","-   - 输入矩阵需 ≥ 128×128 才能高效利用 MXU","-   - 过度分解导致 systolic array 填充率低 (bubble cycles)","-   - TPU v5p: 每个 TensorCore 有 4 个 MXU","+1. **算子级分解上限**: 分解后的 micro-operator 计算量应大于调度 overhead。Shepherd Operator 的存在表明 elementwise op（数 μs 执行）的调度 overhead 已超过其计算收益——需合并。","+2. **层/模块级分解约束**: 分解出的独立模块应具有互补的硬件资源需求。GPU 上 Attention (compute-heavy) 和 Expert FFN (memory-heavy) 可通过 MPS SM 分区减少竞争；NPU 上 MatMul (AI Core) 和 AllReduce (AI Vector) 可通过异构单元并发实现空间复用。","+3. **Token/Patch 级分解上限**: 子批次数量受计算单元数量约束——每个 SM 至少需要一个完整的 GEMM tile (≥64×128) 才能有效利用 Tensor Core。子批次过多导致 occupancy 下降。","+4. **模态级分解约束**: 受显存限制——所有模态的权重需同时驻留。GPU H100 80GB 可同时容纳 LLaVA-1.5 的 ViT (~300M) + LLaMA-7B，但更大模型可能需要串行或 offloading。","+5. **Mega-kernel 化前提**: 编译时必须能静态分析全部 task 的依赖关系和资源需求（MPK 的 tGraph 依赖 Mirage superoptimizer 自动生成每个 task 的优化 CUDA 实现）——对于高度动态的 MoE routing 或扩散步骤可能需要 Hybrid JIT+AOT 混合策略。"," ","-2. VPU (Vector Processing Unit):","-   - 处理 activation functions, LayerNorm, etc.","-   - 与 MXU 可并发执行 (类似 Ascend 的 AI Core / AI Vector 架构)","+---"," ","-3. HBM (TPU v5p: ~95 GB per chip, ~2.7 TB/s BW):","-   - 分解后并发单元的 HBM bandwidth 共享","-   - 笔记未明确说明 TPU 的片上 memory hierarchy 与 GPU shared memory 的对应关系","+## 三、实现（辅助说明）"," ","-4. XLA 编译期调度:","-   - TPU 的算子分解和调度在 XLA 编译期决定 (与 GPU 的运行时 CUDA stream 调度不同)","-   - 笔记: XLA 编译期调度 vs 运行时调度 的边界影响分解灵活性","-     (knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md)","-```","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling（协同编译与调度）.md` (score: 72.5)"," ","-### 2.4 分解粒度对比表","+| 系统 | 分解策略 | 实现方式 | 适用模型 | 硬件平台 |","+|------|---------|---------|---------|---------|","+| Infera | 算子级 tile 分解 + shepherd 合并 | TVM 0.16.0 tile-tailored compiler (~17k LoC C++), zero-tuning | 通用 DNN | NVIDIA GPU |","+| Nimble | DAG→MEG→Bipartite Matching→CUDA stream | PyTorch TorchScript IR 分析 + AoT stream assignment | 通用 DL (CNN/Transformer) | NVIDIA GPU |","+| MixFusion | Patch级 + 算子级 (pixel-wise/context-dependent) | PyTorch custom ops (CSP, PES CUDA kernel) | DiT (SD3), U-Net (SDXL) | NVIDIA H100 |","+| vLLM Fused MoE | Token 组 + Expert 级融合 | Triton JIT kernel (`fused_moe.py`) | MoE (Mixtral, DeepSeek-V2) | NVIDIA H100 |","+| FlashMoE | Megakernel (全融合) | CUDA C++ (~6820 行), CUTLASS device-side, NVSHMEM | 分布式 MoE | NVIDIA GPU |","+| MegaScale-MoE | Tile 级通信-计算 barrier 融合 (4 类 fused kernel) | CUDA kernel + device memory barrier + GPU copy engine | MoE 训练/推理 | NVIDIA GPU |","+| EEVEE | 模块级 + 模态级 (SM MPS 分区) | Python (~5000 行), vLLM + NVIDIA MPS | LLaVA, BLIP-2, InternVL2.5 | NVIDIA A100, RTX 3090 |","+| EPD-Serve | 阶段级 (E/P/D 解耦) + 算子级硬件互补 | PyTorch/Ascend + Mooncake Store | 多模态 LLM | Ascend NPU (Atlas 800I A2) |","+| MPK | SM 级 tGraph→mega-kernel | torch.compile(backend=MPK) + Mirage superoptimizer | LLM (Qwen3 等) | NVIDIA H100, B200 |","+| MoE-Blaze | Atomic-free GPU parallel dispatch | CUDA kernel (3 步替代 multi-pass radix sort) | MoE | NVIDIA GPU |"," ","-| 粒度 | 并发单元 | 硬件约束瓶颈 | GPU 最优度 | NPU 最优度 | TPU 最优度 | 典型方法 |","-|------|----------|-------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|---------|","-| 算子级 | MatMul, Attention, LayerNorm 等单算子 | SM 数 + Tensor Core tile min size + register pressure | 中: 受 SM 数和 SMEM 限制 | 高: AI Core/Vector 异构支持好 | 中: XLA 编译期固定 | Nimble, EPS-MoE |","-| 层/模块级 | Attention block, Expert FFN, Encoder/Decoder modules | HBM capacity (每人驻留参数) + inter-module 通信 BW | 高: MPS SM partition 成熟 | 高: EPD 三阶段解耦 | 中: 需跨 MXU 调度 | HAP, EEVEE, EPD-Serve |","-| Token/Patch 级 | token groups, image patches | token 间交互 (Self-Attention) 破坏独立性 + patch boundary stitching overhead | 高: Diffusion patch 天然并行 | 笔记未说明 | 笔记未说明 | MixFusion, FinDEP |","-| 模态级 | vision/text/audio 独立编码子图 | NCD 传输延迟 + 模态间同步 + GPU fragmentation | 中: NCD ~10ms 开销 | 高: EPD 物理共置 + 逻辑解耦 | 笔记未说明 | EPD-Serve, Cornfigurator |","+**注解**: 笔记显示大部分前沿系统未开源（FlashMoE、MegaScale-MoE、MPK、EEVEE 均未找到官方仓库），实验可复现性受限。vLLM Fused MoE 为开源实现，是当前最成熟的 MoE 推理分解参考实现。"," "," ---"," ","-## 三、实验环境 (辅助说明)","+## 四、实验环境（辅助说明）"," ","-| 方法 | 论文 | 硬件平台 | Benchmark | 关键指标 |","-|------|------|----------|-----------|----------|","-| Module Multiplexing | EEVEE | RTX 3090, A100 | CLIP/BLIP/LLaVA-1.5/InternVL2.5-8B | Max capacity ↑157%, GPU active SM ~90% |","-| EPD 三阶段解耦 | EPD-Serve | Atlas 800I A2 (Ascend 910B, 64GB HBM) | VisualWebInstruct (256+256 mixed) | (E-P)-D 吞吐 ↑57-69% vs EP-D, SLO attainment 94.34% (E-P-D) |","-| Patch-Level Parallel | MixFusion | H100 80GB | SDXL, SD3 (512/768/1024 mixed res) | Batch speedup: sequential 17.8s→batched 9.5s |","-| FinDEP Pipeline | FinDEP (MoE) | A6000, A10, H20 ×8 | DeepSeek-V2/V3, Qwen-MoE | Throughput-optimized via r₁/r₂ pipeline; GEMM model R²=0.997 |","-| HAP Module Decomp | HAP | A100 80GB ×4/8 | Mixtral 8x7B, DeepSeek-V2 | 计算误差 <10%, 通信误差 <5% |","-| Operator Stream Assign | Nimble | A100 40GB ×4 | NASNet-A, BERT, GPT-2 | Multi-stream speedup up to 1.88× |","-| HRM Analysis | MoE-Lightning | L4 24GB, A10 24GB | Mixtral 8x7B | CPU-GPU hybrid throughput optimization |","+**笔记证据**: `experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/MixFusion_ A Patch-Level Parallel Serving System for Mixed-Resolution Diffusion Models.md` (score: 192.9), `experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/Efficient Multimodal Serving via Module Multiplexing.md` (score: 24.0)"," ","----","+| 系统 | 硬件 | Benchmark | 关键指标 |","+|------|------|-----------|---------|","+| MixFusion | H100 80GB | SDXL/SD3 多分辨率 (512/768/1024) | Sequential 17.8s→Batched 9.5s; PES ~optimal |","+| EEVEE | A100, RTX 3090 | CLIP, BLIP, BLIP-2, LLaVA-1.5, InternVL2.5-8B | Max capacity +157%, latency -90% vs Triton, SM active ~90% |","+| EPD-Serve | Atlas 800I A2 (Ascend 910B, 64GB) | VisualWebInstruct (256+256 mixed) | (E-P)-D 吞吐 +57-69%, SLO attainment 94.34% (E-P-D) |","+| Infera | NVIDIA GPU (笔记未给出型号) | Multi-model mixed serving | Cooperative speedup 1.6-3.5× vs operator-based |","+| MegaScale-MoE | NVIDIA GPU (笔记未给出型号) | 6 种 MoE 模型 | Fused vs non-fused 通信+计算 time 1.2-4.7×; 训练 iteration time -7.1-12.9% |","+| Fused MoE (vLLM) | 4×H100 | Mixtral-8x7B (MoE-Inference-Bench) | 吞吐 +15-20% (大 batch), 不同 seq length 保持 12-18% |","+| MPK | H100, B200 | Qwen3-8B/1.7B | E2E 1.0-1.7× vs SGLang/vLLM; 仅比理论下限高 ~25% |","+| Nimble | A100 40GB ×4 | NASNet-A, BERT, GPT-2 | Multi-stream up to 1.88× speedup |"," ","-## 四、是什么？(辅助说明)","+**注解**: 笔记中跨硬件平台（GPU vs NPU vs TPU）的分解效率对比实验数据缺失。各系统独立验证自身的硬件平台，缺乏统一 benchmark 下的 apple-to-apple 粒度对比（如 MixFusion patch 级 vs 纯算子级在 DiT 上的对比）。"," ","-单请求推理计算分解的本质是：将 LLM/Diffusion/多模态模型的 forward pass 计算图（DAG）按数据依赖关系切分为可独立或流水线执行的子计算单元。四种分解粒度的关系是层次化的 — 算子级是最细粒度（单个 MatMul/Attention），层级是中间粒度（attention block/expert FFN），token/patch 级是在 batch 维度进一步分割，模态级是最粗粒度（独立的 encoder 子图）。选择的依据是硬件计算单元数量（SM/MXU/AI Core 数）、片上存储容量（shared memory/UB/vector memory）和访存带宽（HBM/PCIe/NCD）三者的权衡。","-"," ---"," "," ## 五、方法对比表"," ","-| 方法 | 核心机制 | 分解粒度 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |","-|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|","-| Nimble Stream Assign | MEG + Bipartite Matching 多 CUDA stream 分配 | 算子级 | PyTorch TorchScript + CUDA Graph | NVIDIA A100 | Max logical concurrency 15, 1.88× speedup | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm (29.3) |","-| EPS-MoE Op Pipeline | GroupGemm + micro-batch pipeline | 算子级 | DeepSpeed-FastGen + NCCL | NVIDIA A6000 | 基于 GEMM 特征的算子调度, 避免重复 I/O | paper_secs/secs_moe/EPS-MoE.../2.3 (645.2) |","-| HAP Module Decomp | Attention/Expert 二元分解 + MILP 策略搜索 | 层/模块级 | DeepSpeed-FastGen 扩展 | NVIDIA A100 80GB | 计算误差 <10%, 通信误差 <5% | knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Module Decomposition (1134.4) |","-| EEVEE Module Mux | MPS SM partition + synergistic greedy search | 层/模块级 | vLLM + NVIDIA MPS | RTX 3090, A100 | Max capacity ↑157%, SM active ~90% | paper_secs/secs_2026/79-EEVEE.../1-Introduction (5412.7) |","-| EPD-Serve 3-Stage | E-P-D 三阶段解耦 + 物理共置 + 算子空间复用 | 层/模块级 | Ascend CANN + Mooncake Store | Atlas 800I A2 (Ascend 910B) | (E-P)-D 吞吐 ↑57-69%, SLO 94.34% | paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/EPD-Serve.../3-Method (1289.4) |","-| MixFusion Patch | CSP 格式 + operator taxonomy 分类 + per-resolution reconstruction | Token/Patch 级 | PyTorch + xformers + CUDA C++ | H100 80GB | SDXL batch 9.5s vs seq 17.8s, PES ~optimal | paper_secs/secs_2026/30-MixFusion.../1-Introduction (8286.9) |","-| FinDEP MoE Pipeline | r₁ (batch) × r₂ (token) 两级 pipeline + ASAS/AASS 选择 | Token/Patch 级 | FlashInfer + NCCL | A6000/A10/H20 ×8 | GEMM model R²=0.997, Comm model R²=0.994-0.999 | paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Inference...FinDEP (2703.4) |","-| Cornfigurator A2A | Colocatable edge KEEP/MERGE 搜索 + 图级最优决策 | 模态级 | Cornserve framework | Multi-GPU (NCD/Pull) | per-component 独立 scaling | knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Colocation vs Disaggregation (21.6) |","+| 方法 | 核心机制 | 分解粒度 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键并行机会 | 调度开销 | 笔记证据 |","+|------|----------|---------|---------|---------|-------------|---------|---------|","+| Infera Tile-Based | 大 op→micro-op tile + 小 op→shepherd merge + multi-version kernel | 算子级 | TVM compiler + TEU runtime | GPU | Micro-op tile 间异步流水线 (overlap load/compute) | 中 (per-tile metadata) | knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记 (1309.2/1413.2) |","+| Nimble Stream Assign | MEG + Bipartite Matching 最大逻辑并发度 | 算子级 | PyTorch JIT trace + AoT | GPU | 15 个可并行算子 (NASNet-A) | 低 (AoT 离线) | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记 (29.3) |","+| MegaScale-MoE Intra-op | 4 类 tile 级通信-计算 barrier 融合 | 算子内 Tile 级 | CUDA kernel + device memory barrier | GPU (分布式) | Tile 到达即计算, 不等全量通信完成 | 中 (per-tile flag polling) | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记 (275.9) |","+| vLLM Fused MoE | Router→Dispatch→GEMM→Combine 单 kernel | Token组 + Expert级 | Triton JIT kernel | H100 | 8 experts FFN 在单 kernel 内并发 | 低 (1 launch) | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记 (400.9) |","+| FlashMoE Megakernel | 全部 MoE ops + 跨 GPU 通信融合为单 persistent kernel | Megakernel (全融合) | CUDA + CUTLASS + NVSHMEM | GPU (分布式) | Processor/Scheduler/Subscriber warp 角色分工 | 极低 (1 launch) | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记 (455.7) |","+| EEVEE Module Mux | 模态模块独立进程 + SM 分区 + Modal Cache | 模块级 + 模态级 | vLLM + NVIDIA MPS | A100/RTX3090 | Visual encoder ↔ Text decoder MPS 并发 | 低 (硬件分区) | knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记 (14.6) |","+| EPD-Serve Stage Disagg | E/P/D 三阶段解耦 + 物理共置 + AI Core/Vector 互补 | 阶段级 + 算子级 | PyTorch/Ascend + Mooncake | Ascend NPU 910B | AI Core (MatMul) ↔ AI Vector (AllReduce) 交替 | 中 (topology switch) | knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记 (21.7) |","+| MixFusion Patch Decomp | CSP uniform patch + Operator Taxonomy (pixel-wise/context-dependent) | Patch级 + 算子级 | PyTorch cust. ops + PES | H100 | Pixel-wise ops 全并行; per-resolution attn 分组并行 | 低 (patch batch) | knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记 (751.0) |","+| MPK tGraph Mega-Kernel | SM级 tGraph (task-pair 依赖) + cross-task pipelining + Hybrid JIT/AOT | SM 级 (超算子级) | torch.compile + Mirage superopt | H100/B200 | TMA/Tensor Core/CUDA Core 三种单元持续饱和 | 极低 (1 launch) | idea_notes (59.2) |","+| FinDEP | r₁(batch) × r₂(token) 两级 pipeline + ASAS/AASS 选择 | Token 级 | FlashInfer + NCCL | A6000/A10/H20 | AG attention 与 EG expert compute 流水线重叠 | 低 (solver <1ms) | paper_secs (2703.4) |"," "," ---"," "," ## 六、不确定性"," ","-1. **Video 模型的时空调度分解**：笔记中未找到专门讨论 Video 模型（VideoDiT/Sora-like/spatial-temporal encoder 分离）的 token/patch 级分解方法的详细笔记。MixFusion 主要关注图像 Diffusion（U-Net/DiT），未涉及 Video 的 temporal dimension 分解。Video 的长视频分块调度与上下文窗口滑动调度的具体分解策略需进一步搜索或标记为「笔记未明确说明」。","+1. **TPU (v5e/v5p/v6e) 上的分解策略实验数据**: 笔记中所有主要实验（MixFusion, EEVEE, EPD-Serve, Fused MoE, MPK）均基于 GPU 或 NPU。TPU 上 MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 模型的算子级/模块级分解 benchmark 数据在笔记中完全缺失。XLA 编译器的自动分解策略在笔记中未详细描述。"," ","-2. **TPU (MXU + VPU) 上的分解实验数据**：笔记中 EPD-Serve 基于 Ascend NPU，FinDEP/MixFusion/EEVEE 均基于 NVIDIA GPU。TPU 上的算子/模块/模态级分解的 benchmark 数据笔记未覆盖。MoE-Lightning 的 HRM 涉及 CPU-GPU 混合系统但未涉及 TPU。","+2. **Video 模型的时空分解**: 笔记未找到 Video 模型（VideoDiT, Sora-like, Video-LLaMA）的 spatial encoder + temporal encoder 独立调度分解的具体方法和实验数据。最接近的笔记是 MixFusion 的图像 patch 级分解和 OneVision-Encoder 的 HEVC codec-based patchification，但针对 Video generation 的帧间/帧内并行调度在 Serving 层的证据缺失。"," ","-3. **片上存储划分的具体数值**：笔记中 Nimble 和 EEVEE 的 SM allocation 为百分比级别，未给出 per-operator shared memory 或 register 的具体划分数值。Ascend NPU 的 UB (Unified Buffer) 在 EPD-Serve 共置场景下的具体分区大小笔记未明确说明。","+3. **NPU 片上 UB 容量约束的数值分析**: EPD-Serve 描述了 Ascend NPU 的算子级空间复用，但 Unified Buffer (256KB) 在共置场景下的 per-operator partition 大小和 spill 策略笔记未给出具体数值。"," ","-4. **分解粒度的「最优并发度」实验测定**：笔记中 HAP/MixFusion/FinDEP 均提供了搜索算法（MILP/greedy/convex optimization），但不同硬件平台（H100 vs A100 vs Ascend 910B）的「最佳并发度 vs 吞吐量」对比实验数据笔记不完整。需参考原始论文的 per-platform ablation study。","+4. **Groq LPU / Cerebras CS-3 的分解策略**: 笔记中未找到这两类 dataflow 架构加速器的分解策略证据——其分解粒度选择是否与传统 GPU/NPU 策略有本质差异，笔记未明确说明。"," ","-5. **GPU SM 亲和性绑定与 NPU task queue 的对比**：笔记中间接提及（EEVEE MPS SM partition, EPD-Serve AI Core/Vector complementarity），但两种硬件平台的「分解后并发单元硬件资源分配策略」的系统化对比笔记未覆盖。","+5. **跨粒度组合的最优配置**: 笔记中各系统独立验证各自的分解策略，缺乏统一 benchmark 下不同粒度分解策略的对比（如 MixFusion patch 级 vs 纯算子级在 DiT 上的对比实验）。"," ","-[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L2-Q2.3","+6. **前沿系统开源状态**: FlashMoE、MegaScale-MoE (ByteDance 内部)、MPK、EEVEE 的官方开源仓库在笔记中均未标注——实验可复现性受限。","+","+7. **Video 专用 benchmark**: 笔记未找到 Video-MME 或类似 Video 推理 benchmark 上与计算图分解相关的实验数据。","+","+---","+","+[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q2.3"]}],"originalFile":"# Q2.3 — Serving 层如何将单请求推理计算分解为可并发执行的计算单元？\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/30-MixFusion.../1-Introduction.md | 8286.9 | Patch-level 并行分解：CSP 格式 + operator taxonomy 分类体系 |\n| paper_secs/secs_2026/79-Efficient Multimodal Serving.../1-Introduction.md | 5412.7 | Module Multiplexing：模块级分解 + SM 空间多路复用 |\n| paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Inference...FinDEP.md | 2703.4 | DEP + FinDEP: expert 微批次 token 级细粒度 pipeline 分解 |\n| paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/EPD-Serve.../3-Method.md | 1289.4 | EPD 三阶段解耦 + operator-level 空间复用 (Ascend NPU) |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Module Decomposition for MoE.md | 1134.4 | HAP: Attention/Expert 模块二元分解 + 独立并行策略 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion.md | 652.0 | MixFusion: Pixel-wise vs Context-dependent 算子分类 |\n| paper_secs/secs_moe/EPS-MoE.../2.3-Operator-level-Parallelism.md | 645.2 | EPS-MoE: 算子级并行需结合 MoE 特征避免重复 I/O |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md | 23.3 | EEVEE: module-level scheduling + stage-level parallelism 运转流程 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture.md | 24.0 | Ascend NPU AI Core/AI Vector 异构单元 operator-level 空间复用 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mixed-Resolution Batching for Diffusion.md | 9.9 | MixFusion CSP 格式: GCD-based patch partition |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Flexible Stage Disaggregation.md | 21.7 | EPD-Serve: 逻辑隔离 + 物理共置的部署拓扑 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm.md | 29.3 | Nimble: MEG + Bipartite Matching 多 CUDA stream 分配 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Colocation vs Disaggregation in A2A.md | 21.6 | Cornfigurator: Colocation vs Disaggregation tradeoff 决策 |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Expert Parallelism.md | 22.9 | Expert Parallelism 全流程：dispatch→compute→combine |\n| knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Roofline Model for MoE.md | 22.0 | HRM: operator-level arithmetic intensity → bottleneck 判定 |\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节（数据流/架构）—— 四种分解粒度与硬件映射\n\n### 1.1 算子级分解 (Operator-Level Decomposition)\n\n#### 方法1: Nimble — 基于 DAG 的多 CUDA Stream 算子分配\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm (Minimum Equivalent Graph + Bipartite Matching).md` (score: 29.3)\n\n**框架运行模拟**：\n\n```\n单请求推理计算图 DAG: G = (V, E)\n  V = {MatMul_Q, MatMul_K, MatMul_V, Attention, MatMul_O,\n       FFN_gate, FFN_up, SwiGLU, FFN_down, LayerNorm, RoPE}\n\nStep 1: 构建 MEG (Minimum Equivalent Graph)\n  原始 DAG: MatMul_Q ─→ Attention ─→ MatMul_O ─→ LayerNorm ─→ FFN_gate\n            MatMul_K ─┘              ↑ MatMul_V ─┘\n            RoPE ─→ MatMul_Q, MatMul_K\n  去除冗余传递边: 如果 MatMul_Q→Attention→MatMul_O 且 MatMul_Q→MatMul_O 存在直接边，\n  则移除后者。MEG 暴露真正的直接依赖：\n    MatMul_Q, MatMul_K, MatMul_V → 可并行 (无直接依赖)\n    Attention → 等待所有 Q/K/V 就绪\n    FFN_gate, FFN_up → 可并行 (共享输入 h_attn)\n\nStep 2: 构建二分图 + Max Matching\n  MEG 边集合: {e1=(Q,Attn), e2=(K,Attn), e3=(V,Attn)}\n  二分图节点: L_e1, L_e2, L_e3, R_e1, R_e2, R_e3\n  不相交边对 → 可并行组: {(Q,Attn), (K,Attn)} → Stream 0\n                          {(V,Attn)}            → Stream 1\n\nStep 3: Stream 分配与 CUDA Event 同步\n  Stream 0: [MatMul_Q] ──→ [MatMul_K] ──→ [wait_event] ──→ [Attention]\n  Stream 1: [MatMul_V] ──→ [record_event] ──→ [wait_event] ──→ [MatMul_O]\n\n伪时间线 (GPU H100, 132 SM):\n  T0-T1:   SM[0:43]→MatMul_Q, SM[44:87]→MatMul_K, SM[88:131]→MatMul_V  (并行)\n  T2:      CUDA Event 同步点 (MatMul_Q/K/V → Attention 数据依赖栅栏)\n  T3-T4:   SM[0:131]→FlashAttention (全 SM 参与, compute-bound)\n  T5-T6:   SM[0:65]→FFN_gate, SM[66:131]→FFN_up (Stream 0/1 并行)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **MEG 的作用**：去除传递冗余边，防止 max-flow 分析给出误导性的「并行度=1」结论。MEG 后真正的可并行算子被正确识别。\n- **CUDA Stream 并发粒度**：GPU 硬件支持 32 个并发 CUDA stream（H100），每个 stream 内的 kernel 串行执行，跨 stream kernel 可真正并发——前提是不共享同一 SM 子分区。\n- **SM 并发分配**：Nimble 将独立算子分配到不同 stream，GPU 硬件 warp scheduler 在各 SM 上以 warp 粒度交错执行不同 stream 的线程块。如果两个并行 kernel 均不能占满全部 SM，它们会在不同 SM 上同时执行（spatial sharing）；如果均需全部 SM，则 CUDA runtime 以 time-slicing 交替执行（temporal sharing）。\n- **数据依赖约束**：Attention 必须等 Q/K/V 全就绪。这是算子级分解的硬边界——有数据依赖的算子不可并行，只有无依赖或仅共享输入的算子才可并发。\n\n#### 方法2: EPS-MoE — 基于 MoE GEMM 特征的算子级 Pipeline\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/EPS-MoE Expert Pipeline Scheduler for Cost-Efficient MoE Inference/2.3-Operator-level-Parallelism.md` (score: 645.2)\n\n**框架运行模拟**：\n\n```\nMoE 层算子依赖图:\n  Router(gate) → TopK → token_expert_mapping\n  Attention → h_attn\n  GroupGemm(expert_FFN) ← h_attn[selected_tokens]  (多个 expert 可并行)\n  Combine → h_out\n\nEPS-MoE 算子级 Pipeline 调度 (单 GPU, 假设 2 个 micro-batch):\n\n步骤 1: 分割输入为 micro-batch\n  batch_size B=8 → micro_batch_0[tokens 0-3], micro_batch_1[tokens 4-7]\n\n步骤 2: Pipeline 执行 (伪时间线)\n  T0-T1:   Router(mb_0) + Attention(mb_0)       [SM 0..65]\n  T1-T2:   Router(mb_1) + Attention(mb_1)       [SM 0..65]\n           GroupGemm(expert_FFN, mb_0)           [SM 66..131]  ← 与 mb_1 的 Attn 并行\n  T2-T3:   GroupGemm(expert_FFN, mb_1)           [SM 66..131]\n           Combine(mb_0)                         [SM 0..15]\n  T3-T4:   Combine(mb_1)                         [SM 0..15]\n\n步骤 3: GroupGemm 单 kernel 内并发\n  所有 selected experts 的 FFN 矩阵乘法合并为一次 GroupGemm kernel launch:\n    input_tokens [token_count, d_model]\n    expert_weights [E, d_model, d_intermediate] 分组存储\n    → 单 kernel 内通过 batch dimension 分割到不同 CTA (Cooperative Thread Array)\n    → 避免 per-expert kernel launch overhead\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **算子级 Pipeline 的关键约束**：EPS-MoE 论文指出，如果算子级并行不考虑 MoE 的 GEMM 特征，会导致「参数重复内存 I/O」——因为 expert weight 需要在不同 micro-batch 间多次从 HBM 加载到 SMEM。\n- **GroupGemm 的优势**：单 kernel launch 处理所有 expert 的 FFN，消除 N×expert 次 kernel launch overhead（每次 launch ~5-10μs）。GPU command processor 仅需处理 1 个 launch command，减少 CPU-GPU 同步开销。\n- **SM 分区策略**：Router+Attention（compute-heavy, 需要大 SM 份额）与 Expert FFN（参数 I/O heavy, 受 HBM 带宽限制）分配到不同 SM 子集，减少资源竞争。\n\n---\n\n### 1.2 层/模块级分解 (Layer/Module-Level Decomposition)\n\n#### 方法3: HAP — MoE 模型的 Attention/Expert 模块二元分解\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Module Decomposition for MoE Inference Parallel Strategy.md` (score: 1134.4)\n\n**框架运行模拟**：\n\n```\nMoE Transformer Layer 的 Module Decomposition:\n\n  ┌─ Attention Module (AM) ──────────────────────────┐\n  │  参数量: ~d_model²×4 (Q/K/V/O) + KV cache       │\n  │  计算特征: FLOPs ∝ b×s×d_model²                 │\n  │  约束: prefill 和 decode 必须使用相同策略        │\n  │  可选策略: DP (无通信)、TP (局部计算+AllReduce)   │\n  │  硬件需求: SM Tensor Core (MMA 指令)              │\n  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                         ↓ h_attn\n  ┌─ Expert Module (EM) ─────────────────────────────┐\n  │  参数量: ~3×d_model×d_intermediate × num_experts │\n  │  计算特征: FLOPs ∝ b×s×top_k×d_model×d_ff       │\n  │  约束: prefill/decode 可使用不同策略              │\n  │  可选策略: EP (All-to-All)、TP (AllReduce)        │\n  │  硬件需求: SM Tensor Core + HBM BW (expert load)  │\n  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n步骤 1: HAP 在线搜索最优策略组合\n  Input: 模型配置 (d_model=4096, E=8, top_k=2), 硬件 (4×A100 80GB)\n  Strategy Space:\n    AM 可选: DP (4 replicas, 无通信), TP-4 (每 GPU 1/4 计算+AllReduce)\n    EM 可选: EP-4 (每 GPU 2 experts, All-to-All), TP-4 (每 GPU 1/4 expert 计算)\n\n  MILP Optimizer (延迟仿真模型):\n    AM 计算: T_attn(DP) = 1.2ms, T_attn(TP-4) = 0.4ms + AllReduce(0.1ms) = 0.5ms\n    EM 计算: T_expert(EP-4) = 2.1ms + All-to-All(0.3ms) = 2.4ms\n             T_expert(TP-4) = 0.8ms + AllReduce(0.05ms) = 0.85ms\n    总延迟: AM(DP)+EM(TP-4) = 1.2+0.85 = 2.05ms  ← 最优!\n            AM(TP-4)+EM(EP-4) = 0.5+2.4 = 2.9ms\n\n步骤 2: 运行时执行 (最优策略: AM=DP, EM=TP-4)\n  GPU 0:  [AM: Q/K/V/O (本地)] → All-to-All dispatch → [EM: 本地 expert shard (TP)] → AllReduce\n  GPU 1:  [AM: Q/K/V/O (本地)] → ...                  → [EM: 本地 expert shard (TP)] → AllReduce\n  ...\n  → AM 无跨 GPU 通信 (DP 复制)，EM 仅需 1 次 AllReduce (TP)\n\n步骤 3: 通信-计算重叠\n  All-to-All dispatch (tokens → expert devices):\n    chunk dispatch 为 2 个 micro-batch:\n      mb_0 dispatch (stream 0) → mb_0 expert compute (stream 0)\n      mb_1 dispatch (stream 1) → mb_1 expert compute (stream 1)\n    GPU SM 分配: SM 0..65 → expert compute, SM 66..131 → NCCL communication kernel\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **分解的核心洞察**：AM 的 KV cache 内存需求使其倾向于 DP（复制参数换取零通信），而 EM 的庞大参数量使其倾向于 EP/TP（分布式存储参数）。二元分解使两种模块可独立选择策略，避免「一刀切」策略的次优性。\n- **Preill/Decode 策略差异**：EM 在 prefill 和 decode 阶段可使用不同策略——prefill 计算量大适合 TP（减少单 GPU 计算），decode 计算量小但通信开销相对大，适合 EP（减少通信频率）。AM 必须一致（因 KV cache 绑定策略）。\n- **硬件映射**：延迟仿真模型基于 FLOPs 和带宽计算（计算误差 <10%，通信误差 <5%），建立计算量→GPU SM Tensor Core 利用率和通信量→NVLink/PCIe 带宽利用率的映射。\n\n#### 方法4: EEVEE — Module Multiplexing 多模态模块级并发\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Module Multiplexing（模块多路复用）.md` (score: 23.3) 及 `paper_secs/secs_2026/79-Efficient Multimodal Serving via Module Multiplexing/1-Introduction.md` (score: 5412.7)\n\n**框架运行模拟**：\n\n```\n多模态模型 (LLaVA-1.5) 的 Module Multiplexing 执行:\n\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                   NVIDIA H100 (132 SM)                    │\n│                                                          │\n│  ┌──────────────────────┐  ┌───────────────────────┐    │\n│  │ Visual Encoder (ViT) │  │  LLM Backbone (Llama) │    │\n│  │ SM 分配: 70% (92 SM) │  │  SM 分配: 30% (40 SM) │    │\n│  │ Batch Size: 2        │  │  Batch Size: 8         │    │\n│  │ (图像→visual tokens) │  │  (文本生成)            │    │\n│  └──────────────────────┘  └───────────────────────┘    │\n│           ↓ visual tokens                                 │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │\n│  │  Text Decoder  SM 分配: 动态切换                   │    │\n│  │  Batch Size: 取决于当前请求中的文本长度            │    │\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │\n│                                                          │\n│  NVIDIA MPS (Multi-Process Service):                     │\n│    CUDA_MPS_ACTIVE_THREAD_PERCENTAGE=70 → Visual Encoder │\n│    CUDA_MPS_ACTIVE_THREAD_PERCENTAGE=30 → LLM Backbone   │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n步骤 1: Offline Profiling → Synergistic Greedy Search\n  输入: (LLaVA-1.5, SLO=2000ms, H100, VQA workload)\n  搜索空间: 模块 M ∈ {V, T, D}, 每模块 (batch, SM%)\n  Greedy 步进:\n    初始: monolith (V=1@100%, T=1@100%, D=1@100%) → 延迟 350ms\n    Step 1: V batch↑从 1→2, SM 70%, 延迟 ↑420ms\n    Step 2: T 独立 SM 30%, batch↑→8, 延迟 → 480ms\n    Step 3: SM rebalance: V 70%→60%, T 30%→40%, 延迟 → 440ms\n    Step 4: 收敛, 策略保存\n\n步骤 2: 在线 Module-Level Scheduling (伪时间线)\n  T0:     请求到达 (图像+问题)\n  T0-T1:  Visual Encoder (SM 0..91) 处理图像 → visual tokens [256, 4096]\n          → CUDA IPC shared memory → transfer to LLM process\n  T1-T2:  LLM Backbone (SM 92..131) Prefill:\n             text_embedding + visual_tokens → first_token\n  T2-T3:  LLM Backbone Decode: token-by-token generation\n          (新请求的 Visual Encoder 可与正在进行的 Decode 并发执行)\n\n步骤 3: Stage-Level Parallelism\n  拆分每个模块为 preprocess 和 inference 两个阶段:\n    Visual Encoder preprocess (resize/normalize/H2D, ~40% 时间)\n      与 Text Decoder inference 重叠:\n        T0-T1: VE preprocess (CPU) || TD inference (GPU SM 92..131)\n        T1-T2: VE inference (GPU SM 0..91) || TD inference (GPU SM 92..131)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **MPS SM Partition 约束**：CUDA MPS 的 SM allocation 必须在 CUDA 初始化前通过环境变量设定且运行时不可更改。因此 EEVEE 的策略是「部署时固定、按需切换」——当负载变化超过阈值时，通过 active-standby 机制（权重已驻留 GPU memory）在毫秒级切换到预计算的其他策略。\n- **模块间通信**：Visual Encoder 输出通过 GPU shared memory + CUDA IPC handler 传递给 LLM 进程，避免通过 CPU 中转的 PCIe 往返。单机内 shared memory 传输延迟远低于 PCIe（~10μs vs ~50μs）。\n- **Synergistic Greedy Search 复杂度**：O(|M|² · max_batch · 100)，远小于暴力枚举。论文在 CLIP/BLIP/BLIP-2/LLaVA-1.5/InternVL2.5-8B 上验证，相对 Triton monolithic serving 在 RTX 3090/A100 上提升 max capacity 平均 157%。\n\n#### 方法5: EPD-Serve — 多模态推理的 Encode-Prefill-Decode 三阶段解耦\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/EPD-Serve.../3-Method.md` (score: 1289.4) 及 `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Flexible Stage Disaggregation with Physical Co-location.md` (score: 21.7)\n\n**框架运行模拟**：\n\n```\nEPD-Serve: 多模态推理三阶段分解 (Ascend NPU Atlas 800I A2):\n\n逻辑层解耦:\n  ┌──────────┐    V_m (n×d)     ┌──────────┐   KV Cache    ┌──────────┐\n  │  Encode  │ ───────────────→ │  Prefill │ ────────────→ │  Decode  │\n  │  Stage   │                  │  Stage   │               │  Stage   │\n  │ E(I_m)   │                  │ P(V_m,V_t)│               │ D(O,KV)  │\n  └──────────┘                  └──────────┘               └──────────┘\n\n步骤 1: 模态感知多路径调度 (Modality-Aware Multi-Path)\n  API Server 接收请求:\n    Modal Detector 检查 inputs 是否含 image/audio/video\n      ├─ 多模态请求 → E-P-D Pipeline (完整三阶段)\n      │     Encode instance 选择: least-loaded-first\n      │        E0: queue=2, E1: queue=5 → 选 E0\n      │     Prefill instance: P0 (queue=1)\n      │     Decode instance: D1 (queue=2)\n      │\n      └─ 纯文本请求 → P-D Pipeline (绕过 Encode)\n            Prefill: P0 (queue=1)\n            Decode: D1 (queue=2)\n\n步骤 2: 物理共置 + Operator-Level 空间复用 (Ascend NPU)\n  部署拓扑 (E-P)-D: Encode+Prefill 共置 1 NPU, Decode 独立 1 NPU\n\n  NPU 0 (共置 Encode + Prefill):\n    ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n    │  AI Core (Cube Unit)    │  AI Vector (Vector)   │\n    │  MatMul (Encode ViT)    │  AllReduce (通信)     │\n    │  MatMul (Prefill LLM)   │  LayerNorm, GELU      │\n    │  256 MACs/cycle         │  256-bit SIMD         │\n    │                         │                       │\n    │  当 Encode 等待下一 batch 图像时,                │\n    │  Prefill 利用 AI Core 执行 Attention/FFN MatMul  │\n    │  当 Prefill 等 P-D 传输时,                       │\n    │  Encode 利用 AI Core 继续处理图像                 │\n    └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n  NPU 1 (Decode):\n    独立执行 token-by-token decode, 接收 NPU 0 传来的 KV Cache\n\n步骤 3: E-P 异步传输 + P-D 分层 KV 传输\n  E→P 传输（事件驱动异步预取）：\n    Encode 完成 → 仅传输 feature hash（轻量级，~256B）\n    → Prefill 实例 receiver 根据 hash 从 MM Store 异步拉取 feature vector\n    → 若 MM Store miss → fallback 本地重算\n\n  P→D 传输（分层分组 KV 传输）：\n    Layer L 的 KV Cache 在 Layer L+1 计算时异步传输:\n      T0: Prefill 计算 Layer 0 (NPU 0)\n      T1: Prefill 计算 Layer 1 || KV(L0) 异步传输到 Decode (NPU 1)\n      T2: Prefill 计算 Layer 2 || KV(L1) 异步传输\n      ...\n    每 N 层 KV 打包为一个传输组 (grouped packaging)，减少握手开销\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **三阶段解耦的硬件依据**：Encode（vision encoder ViT）为 compute-heavy + 大 activation memory；Prefill 为 compute-heavy + 产生大 KV Cache；Decode 为 memory-bound（token-by-token GEMV）。三个阶段的计算/内存特征完全不同，统一调度必然导致硬件利用率低。\n- **Ascend NPU 的算子互补特性**：Figure 6（EPD-Serve 论文）展示了 MatMul（AI Core 密集型，低数据搬运）与 AllReduce（AI Vector 密集型，高数据搬运）在共置 NPU 上的交替执行——当一个阶段等通信时，另一阶段利用空闲计算单元。\n- **部署拓扑灵活切换**：支持 E-P-D / EP-D / ED-P / E-PD / (E-P)-D / (E-D)-P 等 7+ 种拓扑。(E-P)-D 在 12 req/s 高并发下比 PD-disaggregated EP-D 提升吞吐 57.37-69.48%。\n\n---\n\n### 1.3 Token/Patch 级分解 (Token/Patch-Level Decomposition)\n\n#### 方法6: MixFusion — Diffusion 模型的 Patch-Level 并行分解\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/30-MixFusion.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 8286.9), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Operator Taxonomy for Patch-Level Diffusion Inference.md` (score: 652.0), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Mixed-Resolution Batching for Diffusion Model Serving.md` (score: 9.9)\n\n**框架运行模拟**：\n\n```\nMixFusion: Mixed-Resolution Patch-Level Parallel Denoising\n\n步骤 1: Operator Taxonomy — 算子分类\n  扩散模型 DiT/SDXL 每 denoising step 的算子分为两类:\n  \n  (a) Pixel-wise operators (可完全并行):\n      Linear, FeedForward, Cross Attention, LayerNorm, GELU\n      → 仅依赖当前 patch 内部像素, 各 patch 独立 → batch 执行\n  \n  (b) Context-dependent operators (需要跨 patch 上下文):\n      Self-Attention → 需要 all patches 交互 (Cartesian product)\n      Convolution → 需要相邻 patch 边界像素 (仅 U-Net/SDXL, DiT 无)\n\n步骤 2: CSP (Continuous Segment Packing) 格式\n  请求 1: 512×512 → GCD(512,768,1024)=256 → patch_size=256×256 → 4 patches\n  请求 2: 768×768 → ...                              → 9 patches\n  请求 3: 1024×1024 → ...                            → 16 patches\n  Total: 29 patches (all same shape [256, 256, C])\n\n  CSP 元数据 (4 个 integer arrays, O(1) 查找):\n    RequestOffset[]  = [0, 4, 13]     # 每个请求的首 patch 全局索引\n    ResolutionOffset[] = [0, 4, 13]   # Self-Attention reconstruction 偏移\n    RequestStart[]  = ...              # 每个 patch 的所属请求起始\n    RequestEnd[]    = ...              # 每个 patch 的所属请求结束\n\n步骤 3: Batched Denoising 执行 (伪时间线, H100, 132 SM)\n  每个 denoising step (共 50 steps):\n\n  Step t 内:\n    T0-T1: Pixel-wise operators (所有 29 patches batch 执行)\n           Linear(patches_batch [29, 256, 256, C]) → SM[0..131] 全并行\n           CrossAttention(patches_batch)           → SM[0..131]\n    \n    T2-T3: Self-Attention (按 resolution 分组 reconstruction)\n           Res 512:  patches[0:4]  → reconstruct [512,512,C] → Attention → split\n           Res 768:  patches[4:13] → reconstruct [768,768,C] → Attention → split\n           Res 1024: patches[13:29]→ reconstruct [1024,1024,C]→ Attention → split\n           3 个 resolution groups 在不同 SM 子集上并行执行:\n             SM[0..43]→Res 512, SM[44..87]→Res 768, SM[88..131]→Res 1024\n    \n    T4:     Convolution (仅 SDXL): Patch Edge Stitcher CUDA kernel\n           FusedGroupNormWithStitching(patch, neighbor_boundaries)\n           boundary pixels 通过 TB 间通信获取 (shared memory 交换)\n\n步骤 4: 输出重组\n  所有 patches 完成 denoising → RequestOffset 逆映射 → VAE decode\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **Patch Size 选择**：patch size = batch 内各 resolution 在 height/width 维的最大公约数。例如 batch 含 512/768/1024 → GCD=256。此策略使所有 patches shape 一致，实现 mixed-resolution batching（sequential=17.8s vs batched=9.5s on H100）。\n- **Operator Taxonomy 的设计空间**：DiT 仅含 Transformer blocks（无 Convolution），patched inference 自然 100% accuracy。SDXL 含 Convolution（kernel 1-3），需 Patch Edge Stitcher 处理跨 patch 边界——PES latency 接近理论 optimal（Figure 5）。\n- **硬件映射**：Pixel-wise operators 可利用 GPU 全部 SM 的大 batch 并行（FV × GEMM，Tensor Core 加速）。Self-Attention 的 per-resolution reconstruction 利用 FlashAttention 的 block-sparse 特性（xformers backend），不同 resolution 可分配到不同 SM 子集。\n- **限制**：patch 数随 resolution 多样性增加可能超过 GPU memory。论文 evaluation 使用 max batch size=12（H100 80GB）。\n\n#### 方法7: FinDEP — MoE 微批次 Token 级 Pipeline 分解\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Inference...FinDEP.md` (score: 2703.4)\n\n**框架运行模拟**：\n\n```\nFinDEP: Fine-grained Disaggregated Expert Pipeline\n\n系统架构:\n  AG (Attention Group): 处理 Attention + Shared Expert, ag 个 GPU\n  EG (Expert Group): 处理 Routed Expert FFN, eg 个 GPU\n\n步骤 1: 两级 Pipeline 分解\n  r₁: Attention/Shared Expert pipeline degree (沿 batch 维度分割 micro-batch)\n  r₂: Expert pipeline degree (沿 token 维度进一步分割)\n\n  配置示例: ag=2, eg=6, r₁=2, r₂=3, B=8, S=4096\n\n  m_a = B / (r₁ × ag) = 8 / (2×2) = 2 tokens per attention micro-batch\n  m_e = m_a × ag × top_k × S / (r₂ × E) = ... tokens per expert micro-batch\n\n步骤 2: ASAS vs AASS 调度策略选择\n\n  ASAS (Attention-Shared-Alternating-Sequential) 时间线:\n    AG GPU 0:\n      T0-T1: Attn(mb_0)  [SM 0..65]\n      T1-T2: Shared(mb_0) [SM 0..65]  || A2E(mb_0) to EG\n      T2-T3: Attn(mb_1)  [SM 0..65]  || Expert(mb_0_j0) on EG\n      T3-T4: Shared(mb_1) [SM 0..65]  || Expert(mb_0_j1) on EG\n      ...\n    EG GPU k:\n      T1-T3: Expert(mb_0_j0, mb_0_j1, mb_0_j2) [SM 0..131, r₂=3 token groups]\n      T3-T5: Expert(mb_1_j0, mb_1_j1, mb_1_j2) [SM 0..131]\n\n  AASS (Attention-All, Shared-All) 时间线:\n    AG GPU 0:\n      T0-T1: Attn(mb_0)  [SM 0..65]\n      T1-T2: Attn(mb_1)  [SM 0..65]\n      T2-T3: Shared(mb_0) [SM 0..65]  || A2E(mb_0) → EG\n      T3-T4: Shared(mb_1) [SM 0..65]  || A2E(mb_1) → EG\n    AASS 优势: A2E 通信更早开始 → EG 更早开始计算\n    ASAS 优势: Shared Expert 填充 Attn 等 A2E 就绪的间隙 → AG 利用率更高\n\n步骤 3: FinDEP 配置搜索 (Algorithm 1)\n  Pareto Frontier 遍历:\n    for m_a = ∞ downto 1:  (GPU memory 约束)\n        r₁ = getMaxR1(m_a, memory_limit)\n        for order in {ASAS, AASS}:\n            solve convex optimization for r₂\n            m_e = m_a × ag × top_k × S / (r₂ × E)\n        keep best throughput config\n\n步骤 4: 在线自适应 Pipeline\n  请求到达时:\n    1. 获取输入 shape (B, S)\n    2. 运行轻量 Algorithm 1 (求解器 <1ms, 因仅优化单变量 r₂)\n    3. 选择最优 (m_a, r₁, m_e, r₂, order) 配置\n    4. 按配置执行 FinDEP pipeline\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **两级 Pipeline 的硬件依据**：AG 中 Attention 计算其矩阵维度涉及 sequence length（O(S²)），EG 中 Expert FFN 是 token-by-token（无 sequence 交互）。因此 Expert 可沿 token 维进一步分割（r₂），而 Attention 的 token 间交互限制了其只能沿 batch 维分割（r₁）。\n- **通讯-计算重叠**：A2E（Attention→Expert）通信与 Shared Expert 计算可并行——因为两者无数据依赖。类似地，E2A（Expert→Attention）通信可与下一 micro-batch 的 Attention 计算重叠。\n- **定理保证**：FinDEP 证明了 Objective(throughput) 关于 m_a 单调递增（Theorem 1），关于 r₁ 单调非减（Theorem 3），关于 1/r₂ 为凸函数（Theorem 4），从而将搜索复杂度从指数级降至 O(√M)（M 为 GPU 最大 micro-batch size）。\n- **实验效果**：在 A6000/A10/H20 等 4 种 testbed 上验证，线性模型拟合 R²=0.997（计算）、R²=0.994-0.999（通信）。\n\n---\n\n### 1.4 模态级分解 (Modality-Level Decomposition)\n\n#### 方法8: EPD-Serve 模态感知多路径 + Cornfigurator 图级分解\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Modality-Aware Multi-Path Scheduling.md` (score: 470.2), `knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Colocation vs Disaggregation in A2A Model Serving.md` (score: 21.6)\n\n**框架运行模拟**：\n\n```\nA2A (Any-to-Any) 多模态模型图级分解:\n\nCornfigurator Model Graph:\n  ┌──────────┐      ┌───────────┐      ┌──────────┐\n  │ Audio    │      │ Image Enc │      │ Video Enc│\n  │ Encoder  │      │  (ViT)    │      │ (3D ViT) │\n  └────┬─────┘      └─────┬─────┘      └────┬─────┘\n       │ colocatable       │ colocatable      │ colocatable\n       │ edge              │ edge             │ edge\n       ▼                   ▼                  ▼\n  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │              LLM Backbone (Thinker)             │\n  └────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┘\n                       │ colocatable edge\n                       ▼\n  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │         Text Decoder / Audio Generator          │\n  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nColocatable Edge 决策: KEEP (disaggregation) 或 MERGE (colocation)\n\n步骤 1: 图搜索 — 最优 Colocation Plan\n  Cornfigurator 搜索 (Qwen 3 Omni, 16 GPU, 1/3 audio 请求):\n    最优 plan:\n      1 × Audio Encoder (disaggregated, 独立 GPU)\n      4 × (Image Enc + Video Enc + LLM Thinker) (colocated, 共享 GPU)\n      11 × (LLM Talker + Audio Generator) (colocated, audio output pipeline)\n    \n    理由:\n      - Audio Encoder 低吞吐 → disaggregated 独立扩展\n      - Image/Video encoders 共享 LLM 资源 → colocated 减少 NCD 传输\n      - Talker + Vocoder 天然耦合 → colocated\n\n步骤 2: 模态级分解的执行模式\n  请求含 image:\n    Image Encoder (GPU 0..3, 其中 1 个) → visual tokens\n    → LLM Thinker (与 Encoder 共享 GPU) → hidden states\n    → Text Decoder → text output\n\n  请求含 audio:\n    Audio Encoder (GPU 15) → audio tokens\n    → NCCL 跨节点传输到 LLM Thinker (GPU 0..3)\n    → LLM Talker + Vocoder (GPU 4..14) → audio waveform\n\n步骤 3: 模态间资源隔离\n  EPD-Serve Modality-Aware Multi-Path:\n    多模态请求 → Encode-Prefill-Decode 三阶段\n    纯文本请求 → Prefill-Decode 两阶段 (绕过 Encode, 不受图像编码阻塞)\n    \n    Global Instance Status Table 实时追踪:\n      Encode instances: [E0: queue=2, GPU 70%], [E1: queue=5, GPU 85%]\n      Prefill instances: [P0: queue=1, GPU 30%], [P1: queue=3, GPU 45%]\n      Decode instances: [D0: queue=4, GPU 60%], [D1: queue=2, GPU 40%]\n    → Least-loaded-first: 新请求分配给当前负载最低的实例\n```\n\n**注解**：\n- **Colocation vs Disaggregation Tradeoff**：Colocation 减少跨节点数据传输延迟（~10ms NCD latency），但无法独立扩展——slowest component bottlenecks all。Disaggregation 允许 per-component 独立扩展，但引入 GPU 碎片和传输开销。Cornfigurator 不预设策略，将所有选择视为搜索空间中的点并系统化评估。\n- **模态级分解的适用边界**：并非所有模态组合都受益于分解。Qwen-Image（2-component）中 monolithic 最优（LLM prefill 轻量，encoder GPU 会浪费）；InternVL 3 中当 image input 概率从 25%→75%，planner 自动从 monolithic→encoder-disaggregated 过渡。\n\n---\n\n## 二、分解粒度选择依据 —— 硬件架构约束分析\n\n### 2.1 GPU (SIMT + Tensor Core) 上的分解粒度选择\n\n```\n硬件约束维度:\n\n1. SM 数量 (H100: 132 SM, A100: 108 SM):\n   - 算子级分解: 独立算子可分配不同 SM 子集 → SM 数量是并发算子数的硬上限\n   - 每个 SM 可并发执行多个 thread block (max 32 blocks/SM on H100)\n   - 若分解后的并发算子数 > 132, 需 time-slicing (串行化开销)\n\n2. Tensor Core 利用率:\n   - GEMM 算子达到 Tensor Core peak 需要最小 tile size (128×128 或更大)\n   - 过度分解 (如将 Attention 的 Q/K/V 进一步拆小) → tile < MMA 指令最小维度 → Tensor Core 利用率暴跌\n   - 笔记显示: operator-level 的 arithmetic intensity (ARI) 是选择 AU 的关键\n     (knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/AU Arithmetic Intensity for AU Selection.md)\n\n3. Shared Memory / L1 Cache (H100: 228 KB/SM):\n   - 每个并发算子的 SMEM 需求之和 ≤ 228 KB/SM\n   - 若分解后算子太多，每算子 SMEM tile 过小 → HBM 访问次数增加\n\n4. Register File (H100: 65536 registers/SM):\n   - 每个 thread block 的 register 需求决定 occupancy\n   - 并发算子数多 → 每算子 thread block 数少 → occupancy 降低\n   - 笔记: Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation 为不同 register 配置 (64/96/128)\n     生成多个 kernel 版本，在线根据并发状态选择\n     (knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md)\n\n5. HBM 带宽 (H100: 3.35 TB/s):\n   - 多个并发算子竞争 HBM 带宽 → aggregate bandwidth 不变 (共享总线)\n   - 笔记: HRM 指出, 当 I_x (operational intensity) 低于 P_1 critical intensity,\n     不值得从 CPU 传输到 GPU 计算\n     (knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Hierarchical Roofline Model for MoE.md)\n```\n\n### 2.2 NPU (Ascend 脉动阵列 + 标量/向量单元) 上的分解粒度选择\n\n```\n笔记证据: knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Ascend NPU Architecture.md (score: 24.0)\n\n硬件约束维度:\n\n1. AI Core (Cube Unit) vs AI Vector vs Scalar Unit 异构:\n   - 算子可按计算特征分配到不同硬件单元:\n     MatMul/Conv → AI Core (256 MACs/cycle, 16×16×16 阵列)\n     AllReduce/Element-wise → AI Vector (256-bit SIMD)\n     标量控制流 → Scalar Unit\n   - 三者独立指令队列, 支持真正并发执行\n   - EPD-Serve 利用此特性实现 operator-level 空间复用:\n     Encode MatMul (AI Core) + Prefill AllReduce (AI Vector) 同时执行\n\n2. Unified Buffer (UB, 256KB):\n   - UB 是 AI Core 和 AI Vector 共享的片上 buffer\n   - 多个并发算子需划分 UB → 每算子 UB 分配降低 → 可能需要更多 DMA 往返 HBM\n   - 笔记: 算子互补特性 (Figure 6) — MatMul 低数据搬运 + AllReduce 高数据搬运,\n     两者对 UB 的需求模式不同, 可有效共享\n\n3. 硬件 Command Queue:\n   - Ascend NPU 的 task descriptor queue 是硬件调度的核心\n   - 算子级分解的 task descriptor 链构建影响调度延迟\n   - 笔记未明确说明 queue depth 具体数值\n\n4. Da Vinci 架构的三级流水:\n   - Scalar → Vector → Cube 三级并行流水\n   - 合理的算子分解应将不同特征算子分配到不同流水级\n```\n\n### 2.3 TPU (MXU + VPU) 上的分解粒度选择\n\n```\n笔记来源: 可推断 + 笔记未明确说明具体 TPU 分解数据\n\n硬件约束维度:\n\n1. MXU (Matrix Multiply Unit, 128×128 systolic array per core):\n   - 输入矩阵需 ≥ 128×128 才能高效利用 MXU\n   - 过度分解导致 systolic array 填充率低 (bubble cycles)\n   - TPU v5p: 每个 TensorCore 有 4 个 MXU\n\n2. VPU (Vector Processing Unit):\n   - 处理 activation functions, LayerNorm, etc.\n   - 与 MXU 可并发执行 (类似 Ascend 的 AI Core / AI Vector 架构)\n\n3. HBM (TPU v5p: ~95 GB per chip, ~2.7 TB/s BW):\n   - 分解后并发单元的 HBM bandwidth 共享\n   - 笔记未明确说明 TPU 的片上 memory hierarchy 与 GPU shared memory 的对应关系\n\n4. XLA 编译期调度:\n   - TPU 的算子分解和调度在 XLA 编译期决定 (与 GPU 的运行时 CUDA stream 调度不同)\n   - 笔记: XLA 编译期调度 vs 运行时调度 的边界影响分解灵活性\n     (knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Cooperative Compilation and Scheduling.md)\n```\n\n### 2.4 分解粒度对比表\n\n| 粒度 | 并发单元 | 硬件约束瓶颈 | GPU 最优度 | NPU 最优度 | TPU 最优度 | 典型方法 |\n|------|----------|-------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|---------|\n| 算子级 | MatMul, Attention, LayerNorm 等单算子 | SM 数 + Tensor Core tile min size + register pressure | 中: 受 SM 数和 SMEM 限制 | 高: AI Core/Vector 异构支持好 | 中: XLA 编译期固定 | Nimble, EPS-MoE |\n| 层/模块级 | Attention block, Expert FFN, Encoder/Decoder modules | HBM capacity (每人驻留参数) + inter-module 通信 BW | 高: MPS SM partition 成熟 | 高: EPD 三阶段解耦 | 中: 需跨 MXU 调度 | HAP, EEVEE, EPD-Serve |\n| Token/Patch 级 | token groups, image patches | token 间交互 (Self-Attention) 破坏独立性 + patch boundary stitching overhead | 高: Diffusion patch 天然并行 | 笔记未说明 | 笔记未说明 | MixFusion, FinDEP |\n| 模态级 | vision/text/audio 独立编码子图 | NCD 传输延迟 + 模态间同步 + GPU fragmentation | 中: NCD ~10ms 开销 | 高: EPD 物理共置 + 逻辑解耦 | 笔记未说明 | EPD-Serve, Cornfigurator |\n\n---\n\n## 三、实验环境 (辅助说明)\n\n| 方法 | 论文 | 硬件平台 | Benchmark | 关键指标 |\n|------|------|----------|-----------|----------|\n| Module Multiplexing | EEVEE | RTX 3090, A100 | CLIP/BLIP/LLaVA-1.5/InternVL2.5-8B | Max capacity ↑157%, GPU active SM ~90% |\n| EPD 三阶段解耦 | EPD-Serve | Atlas 800I A2 (Ascend 910B, 64GB HBM) | VisualWebInstruct (256+256 mixed) | (E-P)-D 吞吐 ↑57-69% vs EP-D, SLO attainment 94.34% (E-P-D) |\n| Patch-Level Parallel | MixFusion | H100 80GB | SDXL, SD3 (512/768/1024 mixed res) | Batch speedup: sequential 17.8s→batched 9.5s |\n| FinDEP Pipeline | FinDEP (MoE) | A6000, A10, H20 ×8 | DeepSeek-V2/V3, Qwen-MoE | Throughput-optimized via r₁/r₂ pipeline; GEMM model R²=0.997 |\n| HAP Module Decomp | HAP | A100 80GB ×4/8 | Mixtral 8x7B, DeepSeek-V2 | 计算误差 <10%, 通信误差 <5% |\n| Operator Stream Assign | Nimble | A100 40GB ×4 | NASNet-A, BERT, GPT-2 | Multi-stream speedup up to 1.88× |\n| HRM Analysis | MoE-Lightning | L4 24GB, A10 24GB | Mixtral 8x7B | CPU-GPU hybrid throughput optimization |\n\n---\n\n## 四、是什么？(辅助说明)\n\n单请求推理计算分解的本质是：将 LLM/Diffusion/多模态模型的 forward pass 计算图（DAG）按数据依赖关系切分为可独立或流水线执行的子计算单元。四种分解粒度的关系是层次化的 — 算子级是最细粒度（单个 MatMul/Attention），层级是中间粒度（attention block/expert FFN），token/patch 级是在 batch 维度进一步分割，模态级是最粗粒度（独立的 encoder 子图）。选择的依据是硬件计算单元数量（SM/MXU/AI Core 数）、片上存储容量（shared memory/UB/vector memory）和访存带宽（HBM/PCIe/NCD）三者的权衡。\n\n---\n\n## 五、方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | 分解粒度 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| Nimble Stream Assign | MEG + Bipartite Matching 多 CUDA stream 分配 | 算子级 | PyTorch TorchScript + CUDA Graph | NVIDIA A100 | Max logical concurrency 15, 1.88× speedup | knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Stream Assignment Algorithm (29.3) |\n| EPS-MoE Op Pipeline | GroupGemm + micro-batch pipeline | 算子级 | DeepSpeed-FastGen + NCCL | NVIDIA A6000 | 基于 GEMM 特征的算子调度, 避免重复 I/O | paper_secs/secs_moe/EPS-MoE.../2.3 (645.2) |\n| HAP Module Decomp | Attention/Expert 二元分解 + MILP 策略搜索 | 层/模块级 | DeepSpeed-FastGen 扩展 | NVIDIA A100 80GB | 计算误差 <10%, 通信误差 <5% | knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Module Decomposition (1134.4) |\n| EEVEE Module Mux | MPS SM partition + synergistic greedy search | 层/模块级 | vLLM + NVIDIA MPS | RTX 3090, A100 | Max capacity ↑157%, SM active ~90% | paper_secs/secs_2026/79-EEVEE.../1-Introduction (5412.7) |\n| EPD-Serve 3-Stage | E-P-D 三阶段解耦 + 物理共置 + 算子空间复用 | 层/模块级 | Ascend CANN + Mooncake Store | Atlas 800I A2 (Ascend 910B) | (E-P)-D 吞吐 ↑57-69%, SLO 94.34% | paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/EPD-Serve.../3-Method (1289.4) |\n| MixFusion Patch | CSP 格式 + operator taxonomy 分类 + per-resolution reconstruction | Token/Patch 级 | PyTorch + xformers + CUDA C++ | H100 80GB | SDXL batch 9.5s vs seq 17.8s, PES ~optimal | paper_secs/secs_2026/30-MixFusion.../1-Introduction (8286.9) |\n| FinDEP MoE Pipeline | r₁ (batch) × r₂ (token) 两级 pipeline + ASAS/AASS 选择 | Token/Patch 级 | FlashInfer + NCCL | A6000/A10/H20 ×8 | GEMM model R²=0.997, Comm model R²=0.994-0.999 | paper_secs/secs_moe/Efficient MoE Inference...FinDEP (2703.4) |\n| Cornfigurator A2A | Colocatable edge KEEP/MERGE 搜索 + 图级最优决策 | 模态级 | Cornserve framework | Multi-GPU (NCD/Pull) | per-component 独立 scaling | knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Colocation vs Disaggregation (21.6) |\n\n---\n\n## 六、不确定性\n\n1. **Video 模型的时空调度分解**：笔记中未找到专门讨论 Video 模型（VideoDiT/Sora-like/spatial-temporal encoder 分离）的 token/patch 级分解方法的详细笔记。MixFusion 主要关注图像 Diffusion（U-Net/DiT），未涉及 Video 的 temporal dimension 分解。Video 的长视频分块调度与上下文窗口滑动调度的具体分解策略需进一步搜索或标记为「笔记未明确说明」。\n\n2. **TPU (MXU + VPU) 上的分解实验数据**：笔记中 EPD-Serve 基于 Ascend NPU，FinDEP/MixFusion/EEVEE 均基于 NVIDIA GPU。TPU 上的算子/模块/模态级分解的 benchmark 数据笔记未覆盖。MoE-Lightning 的 HRM 涉及 CPU-GPU 混合系统但未涉及 TPU。\n\n3. **片上存储划分的具体数值**：笔记中 Nimble 和 EEVEE 的 SM allocation 为百分比级别，未给出 per-operator shared memory 或 register 的具体划分数值。Ascend NPU 的 UB (Unified Buffer) 在 EPD-Serve 共置场景下的具体分区大小笔记未明确说明。\n\n4. **分解粒度的「最优并发度」实验测定**：笔记中 HAP/MixFusion/FinDEP 均提供了搜索算法（MILP/greedy/convex optimization），但不同硬件平台（H100 vs A100 vs Ascend 910B）的「最佳并发度 vs 吞吐量」对比实验数据笔记不完整。需参考原始论文的 per-platform ablation study。\n\n5. **GPU SM 亲和性绑定与 NPU task queue 的对比**：笔记中间接提及（EEVEE MPS SM partition, EPD-Serve AI Core/Vector complementarity），但两种硬件平台的「分解后并发单元硬件资源分配策略」的系统化对比笔记未覆盖。\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L2-Q2.3\n","userModified":false}}
